   <h2 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"1" id=3D"infrastructure"><sp=
an class=3D"secno">1. </span><span class=3D"bs-old-id" id=3D"dependencies">=
</span><span class=3D"bs-old-id" id=3D"terminology"></span><span class=3D"c=
ontent">Infrastructure</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#infrastructure"></a></h2>
   <p>This specification depends on the Infra Standard. <a data-link-type=
=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-infra" title=3D"Inf=
ra Standard">[INFRA]</a>

</p>
   <p>Some of the terms used in this specification are defined in <cite>Enc=
oding</cite>,
<cite>Selectors</cite>, <cite>Trusted Types</cite>, <cite>Web IDL</cite>, <=
cite>XML</cite>,
<cite>Namespaces in XML</cite>, and <cite>Associating Style Sheets with XML=
 documents</cite>.
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-en=
coding" title=3D"Encoding Standard">[ENCODING]</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-se=
lectors4" title=3D"Selectors Level 4">[SELECTORS4]</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-tr=
usted-types" title=3D"Trusted Types">[TRUSTED-TYPES]</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-we=
bidl" title=3D"Web IDL Standard">[WEBIDL]</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-xm=
l" title=3D"Extensible Markup Language (XML) 1.0 (Fifth Edition)">[XML]</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-xm=
l-names" title=3D"Namespaces in XML 1.0 (Third Edition)">[XML-NAMES]</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-xm=
l-stylesheet" title=3D"Associating Style Sheets with XML documents 1.0 (Sec=
ond Edition)">[XML-STYLESHEET]</a>

</p>
   <p>When extensions are needed, the DOM Standard can be updated according=
ly, or a new standard
can be written that hooks into the provided extensibility hooks for
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" data-lt=
=3D"other applicable specifications" id=3D"other-applicable-specifications"=
>applicable specifications</dfn>.


</p>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"1.1" id=3D"trees"><span clas=
s=3D"secno">1.1. </span><span class=3D"content">Trees</span><a class=3D"sel=
f-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#trees"></a></h3>
   <p>A <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" i=
d=3D"concept-tree">tree</dfn> is a finite hierarchical tree structure. In
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-tree-order">tree order</dfn> is preorder, depth-first traversal of a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree">tree</a>.

</p>
   <p>An object that
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data=
-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"participate|participate in a tree|participates in a=
 tree" id=3D"concept-tree-participate">participates</dfn>
in a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A0">tree</a> has a <dfn class=3D"df=
n-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=
=3D"concept-tree-parent">parent</dfn>, which is either
null or an object, and has
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data=
-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"child|children" id=3D"concept-tree-child">children<=
/dfn>, which is an
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ordered-se=
t" id=3D"ref-for-ordered-set">ordered set</a> of objects. An object <var>A<=
/var> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-tree-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent">parent</a> is objec=
t
<var>B</var> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child">child</a> of <v=
ar>B</var>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D=
"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-root">root</dfn> of an object is =
itself, if its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A0">parent</a> is null, or=
 else it is the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#concept-tree-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-root">root</a> of its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A1">parent</a>. The <a dat=
a-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root"=
 id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-root=E2=91=A0">root</a> of a <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-tree=E2=91=A1">tree</a> is any object
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-participate" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-participate">participating</a> in =
that <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A2">tree</a> whose <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent" id=3D"r=
ef-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A2">parent</a> is null.

</p>
   <p>An object <var>A</var> is called a
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data=
-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-descendant">descendant</dfn> of an object <=
var>B</var>, if
either <var>A</var> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A0"=
>child</a> of <var>B</var> or <var>A</var> is a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A1">child</a> of an object <=
var>C</var> that is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#concept-tree-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant">d=
escendant</a> of
<var>B</var>.

</p>
   <p>An <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D"=
dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-inclusive-descendant">inclusive de=
scendant</dfn> is an
object or one of its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-tree-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=
=91=A0">descendants</a>.

</p>
   <p>An object <var>A</var> is called an <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-d=
fn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-a=
ncestor">ancestor</dfn>
of an object <var>B</var> if and only if <var>B</var> is a <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-descendant" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A1">descendant</a> of
<var>A</var>.

</p>
   <p>An <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D"=
dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor">inclusive ance=
stor</dfn> is an object
or one of its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#concept-tree-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-ancestor">ancestors</a>=
.

</p>
   <p>An object <var>A</var> is called a <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-df=
n-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-si=
bling">sibling</dfn> of
an object <var>B</var>, if and only if <var>B</var> and <var>A</var> share =
the same non-null
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A3">parent</a>.

</p>
   <p>An <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D"=
dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-inclusive-sibling">inclusive sibli=
ng</dfn> is an object or
one of its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-tree-sibling" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-sibling">siblings</a>.

</p>
   <p>An object <var>A</var> is <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"=
tree" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-preceding">=
preceding</dfn> an
object <var>B</var> if <var>A</var> and <var>B</var> are in the same <a dat=
a-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A3">tree</a> and <var>A</var>
comes before <var>B</var> in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order">tree=
 order</a>.

</p>
   <p>An object <var>A</var> is <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"=
tree" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-following">=
following</dfn> an
object <var>B</var> if <var>A</var> and <var>B</var> are in the same <a dat=
a-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A4">tree</a> and <var>A</var>
comes after <var>B</var> in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=
=A0">tree order</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D=
"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-first-child">first child</dfn> of=
 an object is its first
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A2">child</a> or null if it =
has no <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conce=
pt-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A3">children</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D=
"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-last-child">last child</dfn> of a=
n object is its last
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A4">child</a> or null if it =
has no <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conce=
pt-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A5">children</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D=
"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-previous-sibling">previous siblin=
g</dfn> of an object is
its first <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-tree-preceding" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-preceding">preceding</a> <=
a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-=
sibling" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-sibling=E2=91=A0">sibling</a> or null i=
f it has no
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-preceding" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-preceding=E2=91=A0">preceding</a> <a=
 data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-s=
ibling" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-sibling=E2=91=A1">sibling</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D=
"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-next-sibling">next sibling</dfn> =
of an object is its
first <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-tree-following" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-following">following</a> <a da=
ta-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-sibl=
ing" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-sibling=E2=91=A2">sibling</a> or null if it=
 has no <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-tree-following" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-following=E2=91=A0">followin=
g</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-sibling" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-sibling=E2=91=A3">sibling</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"tree" data-dfn-type=3D=
"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-tree-index">index</dfn> of an object i=
s its number of
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-preceding" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-preceding=E2=91=A1">preceding</a> <a=
 data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-s=
ibling" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-sibling=E2=91=A4">siblings</a>, or 0 if =
it has none.


</p>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"1.2" id=3D"ordered-sets"><sp=
an class=3D"secno">1.2. </span><span class=3D"content">Ordered sets</span><=
a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#ordered-sets"></=
a></h3>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"ordered set parser">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"=
" id=3D"concept-ordered-set-parser">ordered set parser</dfn> takes a string
<var>input</var> and then runs these steps:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>inputTokens</var> be the result of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#split-on-=
ascii-whitespace" id=3D"ref-for-split-on-ascii-whitespace">splitting <var>i=
nput</var> on ASCII whitespace</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>tokens</var> be a new <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ordered-set" id=3D"ref-for-ordered-set=E2=91=
=A0">ordered set</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#l=
ist-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate">For each</a> <var>token</var> of <=
var>inputTokens</var>: <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec=
.whatwg.org/#set-append" id=3D"ref-for-set-append">append</a>
 <var>token</var> to <var>tokens</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>Return <var>tokens</var>.

    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"ordered set serializer">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"=
" id=3D"concept-ordered-set-serializer">ordered set serializer</dfn> takes =
a
<var>set</var> and returns the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://in=
fra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-concatenate" id=3D"ref-for-string-concatenate">=
concatenation</a> of <var>set</var> using U+0020 SPACE.
</p>
   </div>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"1.3" id=3D"selectors"><span =
class=3D"secno">1.3. </span><span class=3D"content">Selectors</span><a clas=
s=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#selectors"></a></h3>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"scope-match a selectors strin=
g">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"scope-match-a-selectors-string">scope-match a selectors string</dfn>=
 given a string <var>selectors</var> against a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node">node</a> <var>node</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>selector</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn"=
 href=3D"https://drafts.csswg.org/selectors-4/#parse-a-selector" id=3D"ref-=
for-parse-a-selector">parse a selector</a> <var>selectors</var>.
 <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-s=
electors4" title=3D"Selectors Level 4">[SELECTORS4]</a>

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>selector</var> is failure, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw"=
>throw</a> a "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"e=
xception" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#syntaxerror" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-syntaxerror">SyntaxError</a></code>"
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.=
whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException">DOMException<=
/a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dra=
fts.csswg.org/selectors-4/#match-a-selector-against-a-tree" id=3D"ref-for-m=
atch-a-selector-against-a-tree">match a selector against a tree</a> with <v=
ar>selector</var> and
 <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-root=E2=91=A1"=
>root</a> using <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://drafts.csswg.org/=
selectors-4/#scoping-root" id=3D"ref-for-scoping-root">scoping root</a> <va=
r>node</var>. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#biblio-selectors4" title=3D"Selectors Level 4">[SELECTORS4]</a>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Support for namespaces within selectors =
is not planned and will not be added.


</p>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"1.4" id=3D"namespaces"><span=
 class=3D"secno">1.4. </span><span class=3D"content">Name validation</span>=
<a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#namespaces"></a=
></h3>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"valid namespace prefix">
    <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#s=
tring" id=3D"ref-for-string">string</a> is a <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"valid-namespace-prefix">valid n=
amespace prefix</dfn> if its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infr=
a.spec.whatwg.org/#string-length" id=3D"ref-for-string-length">length</a> i=
s at least 1 and it
does not contain <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatw=
g.org/#ascii-whitespace" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-whitespace">ASCII whitespace</=
a>, U+0000 NULL, U+002F (/), or U+003E (&gt;).
</p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"valid attribute local name">
    <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#s=
tring" id=3D"ref-for-string=E2=91=A0">string</a> is a <dfn class=3D"dfn-pan=
eled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"valid-attribute-local-=
name">valid attribute local name</dfn> if its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-length" id=3D"ref-for-string-len=
gth=E2=91=A0">length</a> is at least 1
and it does not contain <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#ascii-whitespace" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-whitespace=E2=91=A0">AS=
CII whitespace</a>, U+0000 NULL, U+002F (/), U+003D (=3D), or U+003E (&gt;)=
.
</p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"valid element local name">
    <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#s=
tring" id=3D"ref-for-string=E2=91=A1">string</a> <var>name</var> is a <dfn =
class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"valid-=
element-local-name">valid element local name</dfn> if the following steps r=
eturn true:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>name</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-length" id=3D"ref-for-string-length=E2=
=91=A1">length</a> is 0, then return false.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>name</var>=E2=80=99s 0th <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-point" id=3D"ref-for-code-point">code =
point</a> is an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg=
.org/#ascii-alpha" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-alpha">ASCII alpha</a>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>If <var>name</var> contains <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-whitespace" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-whitespa=
ce=E2=91=A1">ASCII whitespace</a>, U+0000 NULL, U+002F (/), or U+003E (&gt;=
), then
   return false.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Return true.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>name</var>=E2=80=99s 0th <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-point" id=3D"ref-for-code-point=E2=91=
=A0">code point</a> is not U+003A (:), U+005F (_), or in the range U+0080
 to U+10FFFF, inclusive, then return false.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>name</var>=E2=80=99s subsequent <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-point" id=3D"ref-for-code-point=
=E2=91=A1">code points</a>, if any, are not <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-alpha" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-alpha=
=E2=91=A0">ASCII alphas</a>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infr=
a.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-digit" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-digit">ASCII digits</a>=
,
 U+002D (-), U+002E (.), U+003A (:), U+005F (_), or in the range U+0080 to =
U+10FFFF, inclusive, then
 return false.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return true.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">This concept is used to validate <a data=
-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-element">element</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-conc=
ept-element-local-name">local names</a>, when
constructed by DOM APIs. The intention is to allow any name that is possibl=
e to construct using the
HTML parser (the branch where the first <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-point" id=3D"ref-for-code-point=E2=91=A2=
">code point</a> is an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec=
.whatwg.org/#ascii-alpha" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-alpha=E2=91=A1">ASCII alpha</=
a>), plus some additional
possibilities. For those additional possibilities, the ASCII range is restr=
icted for historical
reasons, but beyond ASCII anything is allowed.

</p>
   <div class=3D"note" role=3D"note">
    <p>The following JavaScript-compatible regular expression is an impleme=
ntation of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-eleme=
nt-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-valid-element-local-name">valid element local =
name</a>:

 </p>
<pre><code class=3D"highlight lang-javascript"><c- sr=3D"">/^(?:[A-Za-z][^\=
0\t\n\f\r\u0020/&gt;]*|[:_\u0080-\u{10FFFF}][A-Za-z0-9-.:_\u0080-\u{10FFFF}=
]*)$/u</c->
</code></pre>
   </div>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#st=
ring" id=3D"ref-for-string=E2=91=A2">string</a> is a <dfn class=3D"dfn-pane=
led" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"valid-doctype-name">val=
id doctype name</dfn> if it does not contain <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-whitespace" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-wh=
itespace=E2=91=A2">ASCII whitespace</a>,
U+0000 NULL, or U+003E (&gt;).

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The empty string is a <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-doctype-name" id=3D"ref=
-for-valid-doctype-name">valid doctype name</a>.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"validate and extract">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D=
"" id=3D"validate-and-extract">validate and extract</dfn> a <var>namespace<=
/var> and <var>qualifiedName</var>, given a
<var>context</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>namespace</var> is the empty string, then set it to null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>prefix</var> be null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>localName</var> be <var>qualifiedName</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>qualifiedName</var> contains a U+003A (:):

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>Set <var>prefix</var> to the part of <var>qualifiedName</var> be=
fore the first U+003A (:).

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Set <var>localName</var> to the part of <var>qualifiedName</var>=
 after the first U+003A (:).

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>prefix</var> is not a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-valid-na=
mespace-prefix">valid namespace prefix</a>, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=
=E2=91=A0">throw</a> an
   "<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#invalidcharactererror" id=3D"ref-for-invalidcharactererror">=
InvalidCharacterError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"=
idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A0">DOMException</a></code>.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#a=
ssert" id=3D"ref-for-assert">Assert</a>: <var>prefix</var> is either null o=
r a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-na=
mespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-valid-namespace-prefix=E2=91=A0">valid namesp=
ace prefix</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>context</var> is "<code>attribute</code>" and <var>localNa=
me</var> is not a
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-attri=
bute-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-valid-attribute-local-name">valid attribute =
local name</a>, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.=
whatwg.org/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A1">throw</a> an "<cod=
e class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatw=
g.org/#invalidcharactererror" id=3D"ref-for-invalidcharactererror=E2=91=A0"=
>InvalidCharacterError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-f=
or-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A1">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>context</var> is "<code>element</code>" and <var>localName=
</var> is not a
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-eleme=
nt-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-valid-element-local-name=E2=91=A0">valid eleme=
nt local name</a>, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A2">throw</a> an "<=
code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#invalidcharactererror" id=3D"ref-for-invalidcharactererror=E2=91=
=A1">InvalidCharacterError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-typ=
e=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"r=
ef-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A2">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>prefix</var> is non-null and <var>namespace</var> is null,=
 then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn=
-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A3">throw</a> a
 "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" hr=
ef=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#namespaceerror" id=3D"ref-for-namespa=
ceerror">NamespaceError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"re=
f-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A3">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>prefix</var> is "<code>xml</code>" and <var>namespace</var=
> is not the
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#xml-names=
pace" id=3D"ref-for-xml-namespace">XML namespace</a>, then <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-=
dfn-throw=E2=91=A4">throw</a> a "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" =
data-link-type=3D"exception" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#namesp=
aceerror" id=3D"ref-for-namespaceerror=E2=91=A0">NamespaceError</a></code>"=
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.=
whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A4">DOME=
xception</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If either <var>qualifiedName</var> or <var>prefix</var> is "<code>=
xmlns</code>" and
 <var>namespace</var> is not the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://=
infra.spec.whatwg.org/#xmlns-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-xmlns-namespace">XMLN=
S namespace</a>, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec=
.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A5">throw</a> a
 "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" hr=
ef=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#namespaceerror" id=3D"ref-for-namespa=
ceerror=E2=91=A1">NamespaceError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-li=
nk-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" i=
d=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A5">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>namespace</var> is the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#xmlns-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-xmlns-namespac=
e=E2=91=A0">XMLNS namespace</a> and neither <var>qualifiedName</var>
 nor <var>prefix</var> is "<code>xmlns</code>", then <a data-link-type=3D"d=
fn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-th=
row=E2=91=A6">throw</a> a "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-l=
ink-type=3D"exception" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#namespaceerr=
or" id=3D"ref-for-namespaceerror=E2=91=A2">NamespaceError</a></code>"
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.=
whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A6">DOME=
xception</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return (<var>namespace</var>, <var>prefix</var>, <var>localName</v=
ar>).
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"note" role=3D"note">
    <p>Various APIs in this specification used to validate namespace prefix=
es, attribute local names,
 element local names, and doctype names more strictly. This was done in a w=
ay that aligned with
 various XML-related specifications. (Although not all rules from the those=
 specifications were
 enforced.)

 </p>
    <p>This was found to be annoying for web developers, especially since i=
t meant there were some
 names that could be created by the HTML parser, but not by DOM APIs. So, t=
he validations have been
 loosened to just those described above.
</p>
   </div>
   <h2 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"2" id=3D"events"><span class=
=3D"secno">2. </span><span class=3D"content">Events</span><a class=3D"self-=
link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#events"></a></h2>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"2.1" id=3D"introduction-to-d=
om-events"><span class=3D"secno">2.1. </span><span class=3D"content">Introd=
uction to "DOM Events"</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#introduction-to-dom-events"></a></h3>
   <p>Throughout the web platform <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event">events</a=
> are <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-event-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispatch">dispatched</a> to o=
bjects to signal an
occurrence, such as network activity or user interaction. These objects imp=
lement the
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget">EventTarget</a></code> inte=
rface and can therefore add <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listene=
r">event listeners</a> to observe
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A0">events</a> by calling <code class=
=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom=
-eventtarget-addeventlistener" id=3D"ref-for-dom-eventtarget-addeventlisten=
er">addEventListener()</a></code>:</p>
<pre class=3D"highlight lang-javascript">obj<c- p=3D"">.</c->addEventListen=
er<c- p=3D"">(</c-><c- u=3D"">"load"</c-><c- p=3D"">,</c-> imgFetched<c- p=
=3D"">)</c->

<c- a=3D"">function</c-> imgFetched<c- p=3D"">(</c->ev<c- p=3D"">)</c-> <c-=
 p=3D"">{</c->
  <c- c1=3D"">// great success</c->
  =E2=80=A6
<c- p=3D"">}</c->
</pre>
   <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A0">Event list=
eners</a> can be removed
by utilizing the
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-eventtarget-removeeventlistener" id=3D"ref-for-dom-eventtarget-=
removeeventlistener">removeEventListener()</a></code>
method, passing the same arguments.</p>
   <p>Alternatively, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=
=A1">event listeners</a> can be removed by passing an <code class=3D"idl"><=
a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" =
id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal">AbortSignal</a></code> to
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-eventtarget-addeventlistener" id=3D"ref-for-dom-eventtarget-add=
eventlistener=E2=91=A0">addEventListener()</a></code> and calling <code cla=
ss=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#d=
om-abortcontroller-abort" id=3D"ref-for-dom-abortcontroller-abort">abort()<=
/a></code> on the controller
owning the signal.</p>
   <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A1">Events</a> are objects too a=
nd implement the
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#event" id=3D"ref-for-event">Event</a></code> interface (or a derive=
d interface). In the example above
<var>ev</var> is the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A2">event</a>. <v=
ar>ev</var> is
passed as an argument to the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A2">event listener</=
a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/=
#event-listener-callback" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback">callback</=
a>
(typically a JavaScript Function as shown above).
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A3">Event listeners<=
/a> key off the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A3">event</a>=E2=80=99s
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-event-type" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-type">type</a></code> attri=
bute value
("<code>load</code>" in the above example). The
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A4">event</a>=E2=80=99s
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-event-target" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-target">target</a></code>=
 attribute value returns the
object to which the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A5">event</a> was
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispatch=E2=91=A0">dispatched</a>
(<var>obj</var> above).</p>
   <p id=3D"synthetic-events">Although <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=
=A6">events</a> are typically <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispa=
tch=E2=91=A1">dispatched</a> by the user agent
as the result of user interaction or the completion of some task, applicati=
ons can <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-event-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispatch=E2=91=A2">dispatch=
</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A7">events</a> themselves by using wha=
t are commonly known as synthetic events:

</p>
<pre class=3D"highlight lang-javascript"><c- c1=3D"">// add an appropriate =
event listener</c->
obj<c- p=3D"">.</c->addEventListener<c- p=3D"">(</c-><c- u=3D"">"cat"</c-><=
c- p=3D"">,</c-> <c- a=3D"">function</c-><c- p=3D"">(</c->e<c- p=3D"">)</c-=
> <c- p=3D"">{</c-> process<c- p=3D"">(</c->e<c- p=3D"">.</c->detail<c- p=
=3D"">)</c-> <c- p=3D"">})</c->

<c- c1=3D"">// create and dispatch the event</c->
<c- a=3D"">var</c-> event <c- o=3D"">=3D</c-> <c- ow=3D"">new</c-> CustomEv=
ent<c- p=3D"">(</c-><c- u=3D"">"cat"</c-><c- p=3D"">,</c-> <c- p=3D"">{</c-=
><c- u=3D"">"detail"</c-><c- o=3D"">:</c-><c- p=3D"">{</c-><c- u=3D"">"hazc=
heeseburger"</c-><c- o=3D"">:</c-><c- kc=3D"">true</c-><c- p=3D"">}})</c->
obj<c- p=3D"">.</c->dispatchEvent<c- p=3D"">(</c->event<c- p=3D"">)</c->
</pre>
   <p>Apart from signaling, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A8">events=
</a> are
sometimes also used to let an application control what happens next in an
operation. For instance as part of form submission an
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">event</a> whose
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-event-type" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-type=E2=91=A0">type</a></co=
de> attribute value is
"<code>submit</code>" is
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispatch=E2=91=A3">dispatched</a>. =
If this
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">event</a>=E2=80=99s
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-event-preventdefault" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-preventdefault">p=
reventDefault()</a></code> method is
invoked, form submission will be terminated. Applications who wish to make
use of this functionality through <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A1">events</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispatch=E2=91=A4">dispatched</a> b=
y the application
(synthetic events) can make use of the return value of the
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-eventtarget-dispatchevent" id=3D"ref-for-dom-eventtarget-dispat=
chevent">dispatchEvent()</a></code> method:</p>
<pre class=3D"highlight lang-javascript"><c- k=3D"">if</c-><c- p=3D"">(</c-=
>obj<c- p=3D"">.</c->dispatchEvent<c- p=3D"">(</c->event<c- p=3D"">))</c-> =
<c- p=3D"">{</c->
  <c- c1=3D"">// event was not canceled, time for some magic</c->
  =E2=80=A6
<c- p=3D"">}</c->
</pre>
   <p>When an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">event</a> i=
s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ev=
ent-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispatch=E2=91=A5">dispatched</a>=
 to an object that <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-tree-participate" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-participate=E2=
=91=A0">participates</a> in a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A5">tree</=
a>
(e.g., an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A0">element</a>), it can=
 reach <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conce=
pt-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A4">event lis=
teners</a> on that object=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-ancestor=E2=91=A0">ancestors</a> too.=
 Effectively, all the object=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-tree-inclusive-ancestor">inclusive ancestor</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A5">event listeners<=
/a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#ev=
ent-listener-capture" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-capture">capture</a> is =
true are invoked, in
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=A1">tree order</a>. And then=
, if <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">event</a>=E2=80=99s =
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-event-bubbles" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-bubbles">bubbles</a></co=
de> is true, all the object=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-inclusive-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor=E2=91=A0=
">inclusive ancestor</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=
=E2=91=A6">event listeners</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-listener-capture" id=3D"ref-for-event-listen=
er-capture=E2=91=A0">capture</a> is false
are invoked, now in reverse <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=
=A2">tree order</a>.

</p>
   <p>Let=E2=80=99s look at an example of how <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-even=
t=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">events</a> work in a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=
=91=A6">tree</a>:

</p>
<pre class=3D"highlight lang-markup"><c- cp=3D"">&lt;!doctype html&gt;</c->
<c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">html</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
 <c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">head</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
  <c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">title</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->Boring examp=
le<c- p=3D"">&lt;/</c-><c- f=3D"">title</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
 <c- p=3D"">&lt;/</c-><c- f=3D"">head</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
 <c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">body</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
  <c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">p</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->Hello <c- p=3D""=
>&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">span</c-> <c- e=3D"">id</c-><c- o=3D"">=3D</c-><c- s=
=3D"">x</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->world<c- p=3D"">&lt;/</c-><c- f=3D"">span</=
c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->!<c- p=3D"">&lt;/</c-><c- f=3D"">p</c-><c- p=3D"">&g=
t;</c->
  <c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">script</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
   <c- a=3D"">function</c-> test<c- p=3D"">(</c->e<c- p=3D"">)</c-> <c- p=
=3D"">{</c->
     debug<c- p=3D"">(</c->e<c- p=3D"">.</c->target<c- p=3D"">,</c-> e<c- p=
=3D"">.</c->currentTarget<c- p=3D"">,</c-> e<c- p=3D"">.</c->eventPhase<c- =
p=3D"">)</c->
   <c- p=3D"">}</c->
   document<c- p=3D"">.</c->addEventListener<c- p=3D"">(</c-><c- u=3D"">"he=
y"</c-><c- p=3D"">,</c-> test<c- p=3D"">,</c-> <c- p=3D"">{</c->capture<c- =
o=3D"">:</c-> <c- kc=3D"">true</c-><c- p=3D"">})</c->
   document<c- p=3D"">.</c->body<c- p=3D"">.</c->addEventListener<c- p=3D""=
>(</c-><c- u=3D"">"hey"</c-><c- p=3D"">,</c-> test<c- p=3D"">)</c->
   <c- a=3D"">var</c-> ev <c- o=3D"">=3D</c-> <c- ow=3D"">new</c-> Event<c-=
 p=3D"">(</c-><c- u=3D"">"hey"</c-><c- p=3D"">,</c-> <c- p=3D"">{</c->bubbl=
es<c- o=3D"">:</c-><c- kc=3D"">true</c-><c- p=3D"">})</c->
   document<c- p=3D"">.</c->getElementById<c- p=3D"">(</c-><c- u=3D"">"x"</=
c-><c- p=3D"">).</c->dispatchEvent<c- p=3D"">(</c->ev<c- p=3D"">)</c->
  <c- p=3D"">&lt;/</c-><c- f=3D"">script</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
 <c- p=3D"">&lt;/</c-><c- f=3D"">body</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
<c- p=3D"">&lt;/</c-><c- f=3D"">html</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
</pre>
   <p>The <code>debug</code> function will be invoked twice. Each time the =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">event</a>=E2=80=99s
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-event-target" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-target=E2=91=A0">target</=
a></code> attribute value will be the <code>span</code> <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-concept-element=E2=91=A1">element</a>. The first time
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-event-currenttarget" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-currenttarget">cur=
rentTarget</a></code> attribute=E2=80=99s value will be the <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document" id=3D"ref=
-for-concept-document">document</a>, the second time the
<code>body</code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A2">element</a>.=
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#dom-event-eventphase" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-eventphase">eventPha=
se</a></code> attribute=E2=80=99s value switches from
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-event-capturing_phase" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-capturing_phase"=
>CAPTURING_PHASE</a></code> to <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-bubbling_phase" id=3D"ref-=
for-dom-event-bubbling_phase">BUBBLING_PHASE</a></code>. If an <a data-link=
-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-listener" =
id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A7">event listener</a> was regis=
tered
for the <code>span</code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A3">elem=
ent</a>, <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-eventphase" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-eventphase=
=E2=91=A0">eventPhase</a></code> attribute=E2=80=99s value would have
been <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#dom-event-at_target" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-at_target">AT_TAR=
GET</a></code>.


</p>
