   <p>An <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#event" id=3D"ref-for-event=E2=91=A1">Event</a></code> obje=
ct is simply named an <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data=
-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-event">event</dfn>. It allows for
signaling that something has occurred, e.g., that an image has completed do=
wnloading.

</p>
   <p>A <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" i=
d=3D"potential-event-target">potential event target</dfn> is null or an <co=
de class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A4">EventTarget</a></code=
> object.

</p>
   <p>An <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">event</a> has an=
 associated <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Event" data-dfn-type=
=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"event-target">target</dfn> (a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#potential-ev=
ent-target" id=3D"ref-for-potential-event-target">potential event target</a=
>). Unless stated otherwise it is null.

</p>
   <p>An <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">event</a> has an=
 associated <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Event" data-dfn-type=
=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"event-relatedtarget">relatedTarget</dfn> (a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#potential-ev=
ent-target" id=3D"ref-for-potential-event-target=E2=91=A0">potential event =
target</a>). Unless stated otherwise it is null.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Other specifications use <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-relatedtarget" id=3D"=
ref-for-event-relatedtarget">relatedTarget</a> to define a
<code>relatedTarget</code> attribute. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-uievents" title=3D"UI Events">[UIEVENTS=
]</a>

</p>
   <p>An <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">event</a> has an=
 associated <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Event" data-dfn-type=
=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"event-touch-target-list">touch target list<=
/dfn> (a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list" id=
=3D"ref-for-list">list</a> of zero or more <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#potential-event-target" id=3D"ref-for-pote=
ntial-event-target=E2=91=A1">potential event targets</a>). Unless stated ot=
herwise it is the
empty list.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-touch-target-list" id=3D"ref-for-event-tou=
ch-target-list">touch target list</a> is for the exclusive use of defining =
the
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io=
/touch-events/#idl-def-touchevent" id=3D"ref-for-idl-def-touchevent">TouchE=
vent</a></code> interface and related interfaces. <a data-link-type=3D"bibl=
io" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-touch-events" title=3D"Touc=
h Events">[TOUCH-EVENTS]</a>

</p>
   <p>An <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">event</a> has an=
 associated <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Event" data-dfn-type=
=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"event-path">path</dfn>. A <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-path" id=3D"ref-for-eve=
nt-path">path</a> is a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list" id=
=3D"ref-for-list=E2=91=A0">list</a> of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-path-item" id=3D"ref-for-event-path-item">=
event path items</a>. An <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" d=
ata-noexport=3D"" id=3D"event-path-item">event path item</dfn> is a <a data=
-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#struct" id=3D"ref=
-for-struct">struct</a>
consisting of an <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"event path item=
" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"event-path-invocation-targ=
et">invocation target</dfn>
(an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A5">EventTarget</a=
></code> object), an
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"event path item" data-dfn-type=
=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"event-path-invocation-target-in-shadow-tr=
ee">invocation-target-in-shadow-tree</dfn>
(a boolean), a
