   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"composedPath()" data-algorith=
m-for=3D"Event">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Event" data-=
dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-event-composedpath"><code>co=
mposedPath()</code></dfn> method steps are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>composedPath</var> be an empty <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list" id=3D"ref-for-list=E2=91=A2">l=
ist</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>path</var> be <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://w=
ebidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1">this</a>=E2=80=99=
s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-path=
" id=3D"ref-for-event-path=E2=91=A2">path</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>path</var> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra=
.spec.whatwg.org/#list-is-empty" id=3D"ref-for-list-is-empty">is empty</a>,=
