 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>currentTarget</var> be <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2">this</a>=
=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-currenttarget" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-current=
target=E2=91=A3">currentTarget</a></code> attribute value.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#a=
ssert" id=3D"ref-for-assert=E2=91=A0">Assert</a>: <var>currentTarget</var> =
is an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A6">EventTarget<=
/a></code> object.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#l=
ist-append" id=3D"ref-for-list-append">Append</a> <var>currentTarget</var> =
to <var>composedPath</var>.

