     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>currentTargetHiddenSubtreeLevel</var> be 0.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>index</var> be <var>path</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-size" id=3D"ref-for-l=
ist-size">size</a> =E2=88=92 1.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>While <var>index</var> is greater than or equal to 0:

  </p>
      <ol>
