</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-istrusted" id=3D"ref-f=
or-dom-event-istrusted=E2=91=A1">isTrusted</a></code> is a convenience that=
 indicates whether an
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A0">event</a> is <a data-link=
-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-dispatch" =
id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispatch=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">dispatched</a> by t=
he user agent (as opposed to using
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-eventtarget-dispatchevent" id=3D"ref-for-dom-eventtarget-dispat=
chevent=E2=91=A0">dispatchEvent()</a></code>). The sole legacy exception is=
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://html.spec.wh=
atwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#dom-click" id=3D"ref-for-dom-click">cli=
ck()</a></code>, which causes
the user agent to dispatch an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A2=E2=91=
=A1">event</a> whose <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-istrusted" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-i=
strusted=E2=91=A2">isTrusted</a></code> attribute is initialized to
false.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Event" data-d=
fn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-event-timestamp"><code>tim=
eStamp</code></dfn> attribute must return the value it was
initialized to.

</p>
   <hr>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"initialize" data-algorithm-fo=
r=3D"Event">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Event" data-dfn-type=
=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-event-initialize">initialize</dfn> =
an <var>event</var>, with
<var>type</var>, <var>bubbles</var>, and <var>cancelable</var>, run these s=
teps:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Set <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#initialized-flag" id=3D"ref-for-initialized-fla=
g">initialized flag</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Unset <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#stop-propagation-flag" id=3D"ref-for-stop-pro=
pagation-flag=E2=91=A3">stop propagation flag</a>,
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#stop-immedi=
ate-propagation-flag" id=3D"ref-for-stop-immediate-propagation-flag=E2=91=
=A0">stop immediate propagation flag</a>, and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#canceled-flag" id=3D"ref-for-canceled-fla=
g=E2=91=A2">canceled flag</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-istrusted" id=3D"=
ref-for-dom-event-istrusted=E2=91=A3">isTrusted</a></code> attribute to fal=
se.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-target" id=3D"ref-for-event-target=E2=91=
=A7">target</a> to null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-type" id=3D"ref-f=
or-dom-event-type=E2=91=A4">type</a></code> attribute to <var>type</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-bubbles" id=3D"re=
f-for-dom-event-bubbles=E2=91=A3">bubbles</a></code> attribute to <var>bubb=
les</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-cancelable" id=3D=
"ref-for-dom-event-cancelable=E2=91=A4">cancelable</a></code> attribute to =
<var>cancelable</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"initEvent(type, bubbles, canc=
elable)" data-algorithm-for=3D"Event">
    <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Event" data-dfn-type=3D=
"method" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"initEvent(type, bubbles, cancelable)|i=
nitEvent(type, bubbles)|initEvent(type)" id=3D"dom-event-initevent"><code>i=
nitEvent(<var>type</var>, <var>bubbles</var>, <var>cancelable</var>)</code>=
</dfn>
method steps are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dispatch-flag" id=3D"=
ref-for-dispatch-flag">dispatch flag</a> is set, then return.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-event-initialize" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-initialize">Initialize</=
a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" =
id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">this</a> with <var>type</var>, <var>b=
ubbles</var>, and
 <var>cancelable</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-initevent" id=3D"ref-f=
or-dom-event-initevent=E2=91=A0">initEvent()</a></code> is redundant with <=
a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A2">event</a> constructors and
incapable of setting <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-composed" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-co=
mposed=E2=91=A1">composed</a></code>. It has to be supported for legacy con=
tent.


</p>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"2.3" id=3D"interface-window-=
extensions"><span class=3D"secno">2.3. </span><span class=3D"content">Legac=
y extensions to the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"h=
ttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#window" id=3D"r=
ef-for-window">Window</a></code> interface</span><a class=3D"self-link" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-window-extensions"></a></h3>
<pre class=3D"def highlight idl"><c- b=3D"">partial</c-> <c- b=3D"">interfa=
ce</c-> <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"interface" href=3D"https://=
html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#window" id=3D"ref-for-=
window=E2=91=A0"><c- g=3D"">Window</c-></a> {
  [<a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"extended-attribute" href=3D"http=
s://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#Replaceable" id=3D"ref-for-Replaceable"><c- g=
=3D"">Replaceable</c-></a>] <c- b=3D"">readonly</c-> <c- b=3D"">attribute</=
c-> (<a data-link-type=3D"idl-name" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#ev=
ent" id=3D"ref-for-event=E2=91=A2"><c- n=3D"">Event</c-></a> <c- b=3D"">or<=
/c-> <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"interface" href=3D"https://web=
idl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-undefined" id=3D"ref-for-idl-undefined=E2=91=A3"><=
c- b=3D"">undefined</c-></a>) <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"attri=
bute" data-readonly=3D"" data-type=3D"(Event or undefined)" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-window-event" id=3D"ref-for-dom-window-event"><c-=
 g=3D"">event</c-></a>; // legacy
};
</pre>
   <p>Each <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://ht=
ml.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#window" id=3D"ref-for-wi=
ndow=E2=91=A1">Window</a></code> object has an associated <dfn class=3D"dfn=
-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Window" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" =
id=3D"window-current-event">current event</dfn> (undefined or an
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#event" id=3D"ref-for-event=E2=91=A3">Event</a></code> object). Unle=
ss stated otherwise it is undefined.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Window" data-=
dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-window-event"><code>event=
</code></dfn> getter steps are to return <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5"=
>this</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#window-curre=
nt-event" id=3D"ref-for-window-current-event">current event</a>.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Web developers are strongly encouraged t=
o instead rely on the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event" id=3D"ref-for-event=E2=91=A4">Event</a=
></code> object passed
to event listeners, as that will result in more portable code. This attribu=
te is not available in
workers or worklets, and is inaccurate for events dispatched in <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-tree" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-tree=E2=91=A0">shadow trees</a>.


</p>
