   <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A3">Events</a> using th=
e
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#customevent" id=3D"ref-for-customevent=E2=91=A0">CustomEvent</a></c=
ode> interface can be used to carry custom data.</p>
   <dl class=3D"domintro">
    <dt><code><var>event</var> =3D new <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=
=3D"constructor" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-customevent-custo=
mevent" id=3D"ref-for-dom-customevent-customevent">CustomEvent</a>(<var>typ=
e</var> [, <var>eventInitDict</var>])</code>
=20
    </dt><dd>Works analogously to the constructor for <code class=3D"idl"><=
a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event" id=3D"=
ref-for-event=E2=91=A6">Event</a></code> except
 that the <var>eventInitDict</var> argument now
 allows for setting the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-customevent-detail" id=3D"ref-for-dom-=
customevent-detail=E2=91=A0">detail</a></code> attribute
 too.

=20
    </dd><dt><code><var>event</var> . <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-customevent-detail" id=3D=
"ref-for-dom-customevent-detail=E2=91=A1">detail</a></code></code>
=20
    </dt><dd>Returns any custom data <var>event</var> was created with.
 Typically used for synthetic events.

   </dd></dl>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"CustomEvent" =
data-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-customevent-detail">=
<code>detail</code></dfn> attribute must return the value it
was initialized to.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"initCustomEvent(type, bubbles=
, cancelable, detail)" data-algorithm-for=3D"CustomEvent">
    <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"CustomEvent" data-dfn-t=
ype=3D"method" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"initCustomEvent(type, bubbles, c=
ancelable, detail)|initCustomEvent(type, bubbles, cancelable)|initCustomEve=
nt(type, bubbles)|initCustomEvent(type)" id=3D"dom-customevent-initcustomev=
ent"><code>initCustomEvent(<var>type</var>, <var>bubbles</var>, <var>cancel=
able</var>, <var>detail</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dispatch-flag" id=3D"=
ref-for-dispatch-flag=E2=91=A0">dispatch flag</a> is set, then return.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-event-initialize" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-initialize=E2=91=A0">Ini=
tialize</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">this</a> with <var>type</var=
>, <var>bubbles</var>, and
 <var>cancelable</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">this</a>=E2=80=99s <code cl=
ass=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
dom-customevent-detail" id=3D"ref-for-dom-customevent-detail=E2=91=A2">deta=
il</a></code> attribute to <var>detail</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"2.5" id=3D"constructing-even=
ts"><span class=3D"secno">2.5. </span><span class=3D"content">Constructing =
events</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
nstructing-events"></a></h3>
   <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#other-=
applicable-specifications" id=3D"ref-for-other-applicable-specifications">S=
pecifications</a> may define
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-event-constructor-ext">event constructing steps</dfn> for all or some
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A4">events</a>. The algorithm=
 is passed an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A5">event</a> <=
var>event</var> and an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dictdef-eventinit" id=3D"ref-for-dictdef-e=
ventinit=E2=91=A1">EventInit</a></code>
<var>eventInitDict</var> as indicated in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#inner-event-creation-steps" id=3D"ref-for-=
inner-event-creation-steps">inner event creation steps</a>.</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">This construct can be used by <code clas=
s=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#ev=
ent" id=3D"ref-for-event=E2=91=A7">Event</a></code> subclasses that have a =
more complex structure
than a simple 1:1 mapping between their initializing dictionary members and=
 IDL attributes.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"constructor" data-algorithm-f=
or=3D"Event">
    <p>When a <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Event" data-dfn-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-event-constructor">constructor</d=
fn> of the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#event" id=3D"ref-for-event=E2=91=A8">Event</a></code>
interface, or of an interface that inherits from the <code class=3D"idl"><a=
 data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event" id=3D"r=
ef-for-event=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">Event</a></code> interface, is invoked, the=
se steps
must be run, given the arguments <var>type</var> and <var>eventInitDict</va=
r>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>event</var> be the result of running the <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#inner-event-creation-steps" =
id=3D"ref-for-inner-event-creation-steps=E2=91=A0">inner event creation ste=
ps</a> with
 this interface, null, now, and <var>eventInitDict</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Initialize <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-=
link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-type" id=
=3D"ref-for-dom-event-type=E2=91=A5">type</a></code> attribute to <var>type=
</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>event</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"creating an event">
    <p>To
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" data-lt=
=3D"creating an event|create an event" id=3D"concept-event-create">create a=
n event</dfn>
using <var>eventInterface</var>, which must be either <code class=3D"idl"><=
a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event" id=3D"=
ref-for-event=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">Event</a></code> or an interface that inhe=
rits from
it, and optionally given a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://tc39.e=
s/ecma262/#realm" id=3D"ref-for-realm">realm</a> <var>realm</var>, run thes=
e steps:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>realm</var> is not given, then set it to null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>dictionary</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"df=
n" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-convert-ecmascript-to-idl-va=
lue" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-convert-ecmascript-to-idl-value">converting</a>
  the JavaScript value undefined to the dictionary type accepted by <var>ev=
entInterface</var>=E2=80=99s
  constructor. (This dictionary type will either be <code class=3D"idl"><a =
data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dictdef-eventin=
it" id=3D"ref-for-dictdef-eventinit=E2=91=A2">EventInit</a></code> or a dic=
tionary that inherits from
  it.)

  </p>
      <p class=3D"XXX">This does not work if members are required; see
  <a href=3D"https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/600">whatwg/dom#600</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>event</var> be the result of running the <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#inner-event-creation-steps" =
id=3D"ref-for-inner-event-creation-steps=E2=91=A1">inner event creation ste=
ps</a> with
  <var>eventInterface</var>, <var>realm</var>, the time of the occurrence t=
hat the event is
  signaling, and <var>dictionary</var>.

  </p>
      <p class=3D"example" id=3D"example-timestamp-initialization"><a class=
=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#example-timestamp-initi=
alization"></a>In macOS the time of the occurrence for input
  actions is available via the <code>timestamp</code> property of <code>NSE=
vent</code> objects.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Initialize <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-=
link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-istrusted"=
 id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-istrusted=E2=91=A4">isTrusted</a></code> attribute=
 to true.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>event</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-create" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-cr=
eate">Create an event</a> is meant to be used by other specifications which=
 need to
separately <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-event-create" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-create=E2=91=A0">create</a=
> and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-event-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispatch=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">d=
ispatch</a> events, instead of simply
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t-fire" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-fire">firing</a> them. It ensures the e=
vent=E2=80=99s attributes are initialized to the
correct defaults.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"inner event creation steps">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=
=3D"" id=3D"inner-event-creation-steps">inner event creation steps</dfn>, g=
iven an <var>eventInterface</var>,
<var>realm</var>, <var>time</var>, and <var>dictionary</var>, are as follow=
s:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>event</var> be the result of creating a new object using =
<var>eventInterface</var>. If
  <var>realm</var> is non-null, then use that realm; otherwise, use the def=
ault behavior defined in
  Web IDL.

  </p>
      <p class=3D"XXX">As of the time of this writing Web IDL does not yet =
define any default behavior;
  see <a href=3D"https://github.com/whatwg/webidl/issues/135">whatwg/webidl=
#135</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#initialized-flag" id=3D"ref-for-initialized-fla=
g=E2=91=A0">initialized flag</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Initialize <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-=
link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-timestamp"=
 id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-timestamp=E2=91=A1">timeStamp</a></code> attribute=
 to the
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-relat=
ive-high-resolution-coarse-time" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-relative-high-resolution=
-coarse-time">relative high resolution coarse time</a> given <var>time</var=
> and <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/w=
ebappapis.html#concept-relevant-global" id=3D"ref-for-concept-relevant-glob=
al">relevant global object</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#m=
ap-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-map-iterate">For each</a> <var>member</var> =E2=
=86=92 <var>value</var> of <var>dictionary</var>: if
 <var>event</var> has an attribute whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-identifier" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-identifie=
r">identifier</a> is <var>member</var>, then
 initialize that attribute to <var>value</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Run the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-event-constructor-ext" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-constructor=
-ext">event constructing steps</a> with <var>event</var> and <var>dictionar=
y</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>event</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"2.6" id=3D"defining-event-in=
terfaces"><span class=3D"secno">2.6. </span><span class=3D"content">Definin=
g event interfaces</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#defining-event-interfaces"></a></h3>
   <p>In general, when defining a new interface that inherits from <code cl=
ass=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
event" id=3D"ref-for-event=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">Event</a></code> please alway=
s ask
feedback from the <a href=3D"https://whatwg.org/">WHATWG</a> or the
<a href=3D"https://www.w3.org/2008/webapps/">W3C WebApps WG</a> community.<=
/p>
   <p>The <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#customevent" id=3D"ref-for-customevent=E2=91=A1">CustomEv=
ent</a></code> interface can be used as starting point.
However, do not introduce any <code>init<var>*</var>Event()</code>
methods as they are redundant with constructors. Interfaces that inherit
from the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#event" id=3D"ref-for-event=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">Event</a></c=
ode> interface that have such a method only have it
for historical reasons.</p>
