rget"><span class=3D"secno">2.7. </span><span class=3D"content">Interface <=
code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A7">EventTarget</a></co=
de></span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#inter=
face-eventtarget"></a></h3>
