};
</pre>
   <p>An <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A8">EventTarg=
et</a></code> object represents a target to which an <a data-link-type=3D"d=
fn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-conce=
pt-event=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A6">event</a> can be <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-conc=
ept-event-dispatch=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">dispatched</a>
when something has occurred.

</p>
   <p>Each <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA=
">EventTarget</a></code> object has an associated <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled=
" data-dfn-for=3D"EventTarget" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=
=3D"eventtarget-event-listener-list">event listener list</dfn> (a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list" id=
=3D"ref-for-list=E2=91=A3">list</a> of zero or more <a data-link-type=3D"df=
n" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-listener" id=3D"ref-f=
or-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">event listeners</a>). It is in=
itially the empty list.

</p>
   <p>An <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" =
id=3D"concept-event-listener">event listener</dfn> can be used to observe a=
 specific
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A7">event</a> and consists of=
:

</p>
   <ul class=3D"brief">
    <li><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"event listener" data-dfn=
-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"event-listener-type">type</dfn> (a s=
tring)
=20
    </li><li><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"event listener" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"event-listener-callback">callback=
</dfn> (null or an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#callbackdef-eventlistener" id=3D"ref-for-callbac=
kdef-eventlistener=E2=91=A1">EventListener</a></code> object)
=20
    </li><li><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"event listener" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"event-listener-capture">capture=
</dfn> (a boolean, initially false)
=20
    </li><li><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"event listener" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"event-listener-passive">passive=
</dfn> (null or a boolean, initially null)
=20
    </li><li><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"event listener" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"event-listener-once">once</dfn>=
 (a boolean, initially false)
=20
    </li><li><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"event listener" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"event-listener-signal">signal</=
dfn> (null or an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A1">A=
bortSignal</a></code> object)
=20
    </li><li><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"event listener" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"event-listener-removed">removed=
</dfn> (a boolean for bookkeeping purposes, initially false)

   </li></ul>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Although <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-listener-callback" id=3D"ref-for-eve=
nt-listener-callback=E2=91=A1">callback</a> is an <code class=3D"idl"><a da=
ta-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#callbackdef-event=
listener" id=3D"ref-for-callbackdef-eventlistener=E2=91=A2">EventListener</=
a></code>
object, an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A1">event listener</a> is a broader concept as can be seen above.

</p>
   <p>Each <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0=
">EventTarget</a></code> object also has an associated <dfn class=3D"dfn-pa=
neled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"get-the-parent">get the=
 parent</dfn> algorithm,
which takes an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A8">event</a> =
<var>event</var>, and returns an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"i=
dl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventta=
rget=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">EventTarget</a></code> object. Unless
specified otherwise it returns null.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A2">N=
odes</a>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-shadow-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-root=E2=91=A0">shadow roots=
</a>, and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A0">documents</a> over=
ride the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#get-the-pare=
nt" id=3D"ref-for-get-the-parent">get the parent</a> algorithm.

</p>
   <p>Each <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2=
">EventTarget</a></code> object can have an associated
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"EventTarget" data-dfn-type=3D"df=
n" data-export=3D"" id=3D"eventtarget-activation-behavior">activation behav=
ior</dfn> algorithm. The
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget-=
activation-behavior" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget-activation-behavior">activat=
ion behavior</a> algorithm is passed an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=
=91=A3=E2=93=AA">event</a>, as indicated in the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispatch=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">dispatc=
h</a> algorithm.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">This exists because user agents perform =
certain actions for certain
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">EventTarg=
et</a></code> objects, e.g., the <code><a data-link-type=3D"element" href=
=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/image-maps.html#the-area-element=
" id=3D"ref-for-the-area-element">area</a></code> element, in response to s=
ynthetic <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://w3c.=
github.io/pointerevents/#dom-mouseevent" id=3D"ref-for-dom-mouseevent">Mous=
eEvent</a></code>
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A0">events</a> whose <code cl=
ass=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
dom-event-type" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-type=E2=91=A6">type</a></code> attr=
ibute is <code>click</code>. Web compatibility prevented it
from being removed and it is now the enshrined way of defining an activatio=
n of something. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#biblio-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</a>

</p>
   <p>Each <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4=
">EventTarget</a></code> object that has <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget-activation-behavior" id=3D"ref-for=
-eventtarget-activation-behavior=E2=91=A0">activation behavior</a>, can add=
itionally
have both (not either) a <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"EventTa=
rget" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"eventtarget-legacy-pre-a=
ctivation-behavior">legacy-pre-activation behavior</dfn> algorithm
and a <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"EventTarget" data-dfn-type=
=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"eventtarget-legacy-canceled-activation-beha=
vior">legacy-canceled-activation behavior</dfn> algorithm.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">These algorithms only exist for checkbox=
 and radio <code><a data-link-type=3D"element" href=3D"https://html.spec.wh=
atwg.org/multipage/input.html#the-input-element" id=3D"ref-for-the-input-el=
ement">input</a></code> elements and
are not to be used for anything else. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</a=
>

</p>
   <dl class=3D"domintro">
    <dt><code><var>target</var> =3D new <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-typ=
e=3D"constructor" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-eventtarget-even=
ttarget" id=3D"ref-for-dom-eventtarget-eventtarget=E2=91=A0">EventTarget</a=
>();</code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Creates a new <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A5">EventTarget</a></code> object, which can be used by developer=
s to <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-event-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispatch=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">di=
spatch</a> and
 listen for <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A1">events</a>.

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>target</var> . <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=
=3D"method" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-eventtarget-addeventli=
stener" id=3D"ref-for-dom-eventtarget-addeventlistener=E2=91=A2">addEventLi=
stener</a>(<var>type</var>, <var>callback</var> [, <var>options</var>])</co=
de>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Appends an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A2">event listener</a> for <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=
=A3=E2=91=A2">events</a> whose <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-type" id=3D"ref-for-dom-ev=
ent-type=E2=91=A7">type</a></code> attribute value is
  <var>type</var>. The <var>callback</var> argument sets the <a data-link-t=
ype=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-listener-callback" i=
d=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A2">callback</a>
  that will be invoked when the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A3=E2=
=91=A3">event</a> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-event-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispatch=E2=91=
=A1=E2=91=A1">dispatched</a>.

  </p>
     <p>The <var>options</var> argument sets listener-specific options. For=
 compatibility this can be a
  boolean, in which case the method behaves exactly as if the value was spe=
cified as
  <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-eventlisteneroptions-capture" id=
=3D"ref-for-dom-eventlisteneroptions-capture">capture</a></code>.

  </p>
     <p>When set to true, <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl">=
<a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-eventlis=
teneroptions-capture" id=3D"ref-for-dom-eventlisteneroptions-capture=E2=91=
=A0">capture</a></code> prevents
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-list=
ener-callback" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A3">callback</a>=
 from being invoked when the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A3=E2=91=
=A4">event</a>=E2=80=99s
  <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#dom-event-eventphase" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-eventphase=E2=91=A3=
">eventPhase</a></code> attribute value is <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link=
-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-bubbling_phase=
" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-bubbling_phase=E2=91=A2">BUBBLING_PHASE</a></code=
>. When false (or not present),
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-list=
ener-callback" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A4">callback</a>=
 will not be invoked when <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A5"=
>event</a>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-eventphase" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-=
eventphase=E2=91=A4">eventPhase</a></code>
  attribute value is <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-capturing_phase" id=3D"ref-for-dom-e=
vent-capturing_phase=E2=91=A2">CAPTURING_PHASE</a></code>. Either way, <a d=
ata-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-listener-c=
allback" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A5">callback</a>
  will be invoked if <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A6">even=
t</a>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-eventphase" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-event=
phase=E2=91=A5">eventPhase</a></code> attribute value is <code class=3D"idl=
"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-=
at_target" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-at_target=E2=91=A2">AT_TARGET</a></code>=
.

  </p>
     <p>When set to true, <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl">=
<a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-addevent=
listeneroptions-passive" id=3D"ref-for-dom-addeventlisteneroptions-passive=
=E2=91=A0">passive</a></code> indicates that the
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-list=
ener-callback" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A6">callback</a>=
 will not cancel the event by invoking
  <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#dom-event-preventdefault" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-preventdefault=
=E2=91=A5">preventDefault()</a></code>. This is used to enable performance =
optimizations described in
  <a href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#observing-event-listeners">=C2=A7=
=E2=80=AF2.8 Observing event listeners</a>.

  </p>
     <p>When set to true, <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl">=
<a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-addevent=
listeneroptions-once" id=3D"ref-for-dom-addeventlisteneroptions-once">once<=
/a></code> indicates that the
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-list=
ener-callback" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A7">callback</a>=
 will only be invoked once after which the event listener will
  be removed.

  </p>
     <p>If an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A2">Abor=
tSignal</a></code> is passed for <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=
=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom=
-addeventlisteneroptions-signal" id=3D"ref-for-dom-addeventlisteneroptions-=
signal">signal</a></code>,
  then the event listener will be removed when signal is aborted.

  </p>
     <p>The <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
