   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"flatten" data-algorithm-for=
=3D"Event">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Event" data-dfn-type=
=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-flatten-options">flatten</dfn> <var=
>options</var>, run these
steps:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>options</var> is a boolean, then return <var>options</var>=
.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>options</var>["<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-eventlisteneroptions-capt=
ure" id=3D"ref-for-dom-eventlisteneroptions-capture=E2=91=A1">capture</a></=
code>"].
