=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"event-flatten-more">flatten more</dfn> <var=
>options</var>, run these
steps:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>capture</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-flatten-options" id=3D"ref-for=
-concept-flatten-options">flattening</a> <var>options</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
