://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-dictionary" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-dictionary">di=
ctionary</a>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>Set <var>once</var> to <var>options</var>["<code class=3D"idl"><=
a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-addeventl=
isteneroptions-once" id=3D"ref-for-dom-addeventlisteneroptions-once=E2=91=
=A0">once</a></code>"].

   </p>
