   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"EventTarget" =
data-dfn-type=3D"constructor" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"EventTarget()|con=
structor()" id=3D"dom-eventtarget-eventtarget"><code>new EventTarget()</cod=
e></dfn>
constructor steps are to do nothing.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Because of the defaults stated elsewhere=
, the returned <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A0=E2=
