et-legacy-canceled-activation-behavior" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget-legacy-ca=
nceled-activation-behavior">legacy-canceled-activation behavior</a>.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">In the future we could allow custom <a d=
ata-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#get-the-parent" =
id=3D"ref-for-get-the-parent=E2=91=A1">get the parent</a> algorithms. If th=
