author-created <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A7">EventTarget</a></code>s do not participate in a tree structure.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"default passive value">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=
=3D"" id=3D"default-passive-value">default passive value</dfn>, given an ev=
ent type <var>type</var> and an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"id=
l" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtar=
get=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">EventTarget</a></code>
<var>eventTarget</var>, is determined as follows:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Return true if all of the following are true:

