s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-uievents" title=3D"UI Events">[UIEVENTS]</a=
>

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p><var>eventTarget</var> is a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-typ=
e=3D"idl" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.h=
tml#window" id=3D"ref-for-window=E2=91=A2">Window</a></code> object, or is =
a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-no=
de" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A3">node</a> whose <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document" id=3D"=
ref-for-concept-node-document">node document</a>
   is <var>eventTarget</var>, or is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A4=
">node</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A0">n=
ode document</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
