/dom.html#the-body-element-2" id=3D"ref-for-the-body-element-2">body elemen=
t</a> is <var>eventTarget</var>. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</a>
