-script-resource" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-script-resource">script resource</a>=E2=
=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io/ServiceWorker/#dfn=
-has-ever-been-evaluated-flag" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-has-ever-been-evaluated-fl=
ag">has ever been evaluated flag</a> is set, and <var>listener</var>=E2=80=
=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-liste=
ner-type" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-type=E2=91=A0">type</a> matches the =
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-event-type" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-type=E2=91=A8">type</a></co=
de> attribute value of any of the
