-service-worker-events" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-service-worker-events">service wo=
rker events</a>, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://console.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#report-a-warning-to-the-console" id=3D"ref-for-report-a-warni=
