g.org/#event-listener-type" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-type=E2=91=A2">typ=
e</a> is <var>listener</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-liste=
