emove-an-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-remove-an-event-listener">Remove an =
event listener</a> with <var>eventTarget</var> and <var>listener</var>.
 =20
      </li></ol>
    </li></ol>
    <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#add-an-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-add-an-eve=
nt-listener">add an event listener</a> concept exists to ensure <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.ht=
ml#event-handlers" id=3D"ref-for-event-handlers">event handlers</a> use
the same code path. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#biblio-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</a>
</p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"addEventListener(type, callba=
ck, options)" data-algorithm-for=3D"EventTarget">
    <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"EventTarget" data-dfn-t=
ype=3D"method" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"addEventListener(type, callback,=
 options)|addEventListener(type, callback)" id=3D"dom-eventtarget-addeventl=
istener"><code>addEventListener(<var>type</var>, <var>callback</var>, <var>=
options</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>capture</var>, <var>passive</var>, <var>once</var>, and <=
var>signal</var> be the
 result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#e=
vent-flatten-more" id=3D"ref-for-event-flatten-more">flattening more</a> <v=
ar>options</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#add=
-an-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-add-an-event-listener=E2=91=A0">Add an ev=
ent listener</a> with <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec=
.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">this</a> and an <a=
 data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-=
listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">event lis=
tener</a> whose
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-liste=
ner-type" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-type=E2=91=A4">type</a> is <var>type=
</var>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#even=
t-listener-callback" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A2">callback</a> is
 <var>callback</var>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#event-listener-capture" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-capture=E2=
=91=A4">capture</a> is <var>capture</var>,
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-liste=
ner-passive" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-passive=E2=91=A0">passive</a> is =
<var>passive</var>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#event-listener-once" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-once">once</a> is
 <var>once</var>, and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#event-listener-signal" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-signal=E2=91=
=A1">signal</a> is <var>signal</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"remove an event listener">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"remove-an-event-listener">remove an event listener</dfn>, given an <=
code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">EventTarge=
t</a></code> object
<var>eventTarget</var> and an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-liste=
ner=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">event listener</a> <var>listener</var>, run these st=
eps:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>eventTarget</var> is a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"idl" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io/ServiceWorker/#serviceworkerglobal=
scope" id=3D"ref-for-serviceworkerglobalscope=E2=91=A0">ServiceWorkerGlobal=
Scope</a></code> object and its
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io/ServiceWorker/#ser=
viceworkerglobalscope-service-worker" id=3D"ref-for-serviceworkerglobalscop=
e-service-worker=E2=91=A0">service worker</a>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io/ServiceWorker/#dfn=
-set-of-event-types-to-handle" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-set-of-event-types-to-hand=
le">set of event types to handle</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-contain" id=3D"ref-for-list-contain=E2=91=
=A0">contains</a>
 <var>listener</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#event-listener-type" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-type=
=E2=91=A5">type</a>, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://console=
.spec.whatwg.org/#report-a-warning-to-the-console" id=3D"ref-for-report-a-w=
arning-to-the-console=E2=91=A0">report a warning to the console</a>
 that this might not give the expected results. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-service-workers" title=3D"Ser=
vice Workers Nightly">[SERVICE-WORKERS]</a>

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>listener</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-listener-removed" id=3D"ref-for-even=
t-listener-removed">removed</a> to true and
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-remo=
ve" id=3D"ref-for-list-remove">remove</a> <var>listener</var> from <var>eve=
ntTarget</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget=
-event-listener-list" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget-event-listener-list=E2=91=
=A3">event listener list</a>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
    <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">HTML needs this to define event handler=
s. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio=
-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</a>
</p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"remove all event listeners">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"remove-all-event-listeners">remove all event listeners</dfn>, given =
an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#eventtarget" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">EventT=
arget</a></code> object
<var>eventTarget</var>: <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#list-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A0">for each</=
a> <var>listener</var> of <var>eventTarget</var>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget-=
event-listener-list" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget-event-listener-list=E2=91=A4=
">event listener list</a>: <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#remove-an-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-remove-an-event-list=
ener=E2=91=A0">remove an event listener</a> with
<var>eventTarget</var> and <var>listener</var>.

</p>
    <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">HTML needs this to define <code>documen=
t.open()</code>. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#biblio-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</a>
</p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"removeEventListener(type, cal=
lback, options)" data-algorithm-for=3D"EventTarget">
    <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"EventTarget" data-dfn-t=
ype=3D"method" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"removeEventListener(type, callba=
ck, options)|removeEventListener(type, callback)" id=3D"dom-eventtarget-rem=
oveeventlistener"><code>removeEventListener(<var>type</var>, <var>callback<=
/var>, <var>options</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>capture</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-flatten-options" id=3D"ref-for=
-concept-flatten-options=E2=91=A0">flattening</a> <var>options</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget-event-lis=
tener-list" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget-event-listener-list=E2=91=A5">event l=
istener list</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatw=
g.org/#list-contain" id=3D"ref-for-list-contain=E2=91=A1">contains</a> an
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-eve=
nt-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">event =
listener</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#event-listener-type" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-type=E2=91=A6">typ=
e</a> is <var>type</var>,
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-liste=
ner-callback" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">call=
back</a> is <var>callback</var>, and
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-liste=
ner-capture" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-capture=E2=91=A5">capture</a> is =
<var>capture</var>, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#remove-an-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-remove-an-event-listen=
er=E2=91=A1">remove an event listener</a>
 with <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#thi=
s" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">this</a> and that <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-listener" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">event listener</a>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
    <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The event listener list will not contai=
n multiple event listeners with equal
<var>type</var>, <var>callback</var>, and <var>capture</var>, as <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#add-an-event-listener"=
 id=3D"ref-for-add-an-event-listener=E2=91=A1">add an event listener</a>
prevents that.
</p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"dispatchEvent(event)" data-al=
gorithm-for=3D"EventTarget">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"EventTarget"=
 data-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-eventtarget-dispatchev=
ent"><code>dispatchEvent(<var>event</var>)</code></dfn> method steps
are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dispatch-flag" id=3D"ref-for-dispatch-flag=E2=91=
=A1">dispatch flag</a> is set, or if its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#initialized-flag" id=3D"ref-for-initialized-fl=
ag=E2=91=A1">initialized flag</a> is not
 set, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org=
/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A7">throw</a> an "<code class=3D=
"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" href=3D"https://we=
bidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror" id=3D"ref-for-invalidstateerror">I=
nvalidStateError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" =
href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl=
-DOMException=E2=91=A7">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Initialize <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-=
link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-istrusted"=
 id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-istrusted=E2=91=A5">isTrusted</a></code> attribute=
 to false.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispa=
tch=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">dispatching</a> <var>event</var> to <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=
=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2">this</a>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"2.8" id=3D"observing-event-l=
isteners"><span class=3D"secno">2.8. </span><span class=3D"content">Observi=
ng event listeners</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#observing-event-listeners"></a></h3>
   <p>In general, developers do not expect the presence of an <a data-link-=
type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-listener" i=
d=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">event listener</a> t=
o be observable.
The impact of an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A1=
=E2=91=A2">event listener</a> is determined by its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-listener-callback" id=3D"ref-f=
or-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">callback</a>. That is, a deve=
loper
adding a no-op <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#concept-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=A1=E2=
=91=A3">event listener</a> would not expect it to have any side effects.

</p>
   <p>Unfortunately, some event APIs have been designed such that implement=
ing them efficiently
requires observing <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-listener=E2=91=
=A1=E2=91=A4">event listeners</a>. This can make the presence of listeners =
observable in
that even empty listeners can have a dramatic performance impact on the beh=
avior of the application.
For example, touch and wheel events which can be used to block asynchronous=
 scrolling. In some cases
this problem can be mitigated by specifying the event to be <code class=3D"=
idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-eve=
nt-cancelable" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-cancelable=E2=91=A6">cancelable</a><=
/code> only when there is
at least one non-<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-addeventlisteneroptions-passive" id=3D"ref-for=
-dom-addeventlisteneroptions-passive=E2=91=A3">passive</a></code> listener.=
 For example,
non-<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#dom-addeventlisteneroptions-passive" id=3D"ref-for-dom-addevent=
listeneroptions-passive=E2=91=A4">passive</a></code> <code class=3D"idl"><a=
 data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io/touch-events/#idl-def=
-touchevent" id=3D"ref-for-idl-def-touchevent=E2=91=A0">TouchEvent</a></cod=
e> listeners must block scrolling, but if all
listeners are <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-addeventlisteneroptions-passive" id=3D"ref-for-do=
m-addeventlisteneroptions-passive=E2=91=A5">passive</a></code> then scrolli=
ng can be allowed to start
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/in=
frastructure.html#in-parallel" id=3D"ref-for-in-parallel">in parallel</a> b=
y making the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://=
w3c.github.io/touch-events/#idl-def-touchevent" id=3D"ref-for-idl-def-touch=
event=E2=91=A1">TouchEvent</a></code> uncancelable (so that calls to
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-event-preventdefault" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-preventdefault=E2=
=91=A7">preventDefault()</a></code> are ignored). So code dispatching an ev=
ent is able to observe the absence
of non-<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#dom-addeventlisteneroptions-passive" id=3D"ref-for-dom-addev=
entlisteneroptions-passive=E2=91=A6">passive</a></code> listeners, and use =
that to clear the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-cancelable" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-can=
celable=E2=91=A7">cancelable</a></code>
property of the event being dispatched.

</p>
   <p>Ideally, any new event APIs are defined such that they do not need th=
is property. (Use
<a href=3D"https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues">whatwg/dom</a> for discuss=
ion.)

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"legacy-obtain service worker =
fetch event listener callbacks">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"legacy-obtain-service-worker-fetch-event-listener-callbacks">legacy-=
obtain service worker fetch event listener callbacks</dfn> given a
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io=
/ServiceWorker/#serviceworkerglobalscope" id=3D"ref-for-serviceworkerglobal=
scope=E2=91=A1">ServiceWorkerGlobalScope</a></code> <var>global</var>, run =
these steps. They return a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.=
spec.whatwg.org/#list" id=3D"ref-for-list=E2=91=A4">list</a> of
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#callbackdef-eventlistener" id=3D"ref-for-callbackdef-eventlistener=
=E2=91=A3">EventListener</a></code> objects.

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>callbacks</var> be =C2=AB =C2=BB.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#l=
ist-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A1">For each</a> <var>listene=
r</var> of <var>global</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#eventtarget=
-event-listener-list" id=3D"ref-for-eventtarget-event-listener-list=E2=91=
=A6">event listener list</a>: if <var>listener</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link=
-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-listener-type" id=
=3D"ref-for-event-listener-type=E2=91=A7">type</a> is
 "<code>fetch</code>" and <var>listener</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-listener-callback" id=
=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">callback</a> is non-=
null,
 then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list=
-append" id=3D"ref-for-list-append=E2=91=A2">append</a> <var>listener</var>=
=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#e=
vent-listener-callback" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A6">callback</a> to
 <var>callbacks</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>callbacks</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"2.9" id=3D"dispatching-event=
s"><span class=3D"secno">2.9. </span><span class=3D"content">Dispatching ev=
