ist-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A6">For each</a> <var>listene=
r</var> of <var>listeners</var>, whose
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-list=
ener-removed" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-removed=E2=91=A1">removed</a> is=
 false:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>If <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-t=
ype=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-type" id=3D"ref-=
for-dom-event-type=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">type</a></code> attribute value is no=
t <var>listener</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-lis=
tener-type" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-type=E2=91=A8">type</a>, then <a d=
ata-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#iteration-cont=
inue" id=3D"ref-for-iteration-continue=E2=91=A0">continue</a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Set <var>found</var> to true.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>phase</var> is "<code>capturing</code>" and <var>listene=
r</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-lis=
tener-capture" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-capture=E2=91=A6">capture</a> i=
s false, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#iteration-continue" id=3D"ref-for-iteration-continue=E2=91=A1">continue=
</a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>phase</var> is "<code>bubbling</code>" and <var>listener=
</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-lis=
tener-capture" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-capture=E2=91=A7">capture</a> i=
s true, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#iteration-continue" id=3D"ref-for-iteration-continue=E2=91=A2">continue<=
/a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>listener</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-listener-once" id=3D"ref-for-event-l=
istener-once=E2=91=A0">once</a> is true, then
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#remove-an=
-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-remove-an-event-listener=E2=91=A2">remove an=
 event listener</a> given <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a=
 data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-curr=
enttarget" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-currenttarget=E2=91=A7">currentTarget</a=
></code> attribute value
   and <var>listener</var>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Let <var>global</var> be <var>listener</var> <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-listener-callback" id=
=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">callback</a>=E2=80=
=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-as=
sociated-realm" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-associated-realm">associated realm</a>=E2=
=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/mult=
ipage/webappapis.html#concept-realm-global" id=3D"ref-for-concept-realm-glo=
bal">global object</a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Let <var>currentEvent</var> be undefined.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>global</var> is a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
=3D"idl" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.ht=
ml#window" id=3D"ref-for-window=E2=91=A5">Window</a></code> object:

    </p>
        <ol>
         <li>
          <p>Set <var>currentEvent</var> to <var>global</var>=E2=80=99s <a =
data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#window-current-=
event" id=3D"ref-for-window-current-event=E2=91=A0">current event</a>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p>If <var>invocationTargetInShadowTree</var> is false, then set =
<var>global</var>=E2=80=99s
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#window-=
current-event" id=3D"ref-for-window-current-event=E2=91=A1">current event</=
a> to <var>event</var>.
    </p>
        </li></ol>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>listener</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-listener-passive" id=3D"ref-for-even=
t-listener-passive=E2=91=A1">passive</a> is true, then set
   <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#in-passive-listener-flag" id=3D"ref-for-in-passive-listen=
er-flag=E2=91=A0">in passive listener flag</a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>global</var> is a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
=3D"idl" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.ht=
ml#window" id=3D"ref-for-window=E2=91=A6">Window</a></code> object, then
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io/long-animation-f=
rames/#record-timing-info-for-event-listener" id=3D"ref-for-record-timing-i=
nfo-for-event-listener">record timing info for event listener</a> given <va=
r>event</var> and <var>listener</var>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org=
/#call-a-user-objects-operation" id=3D"ref-for-call-a-user-objects-operatio=
n">Call a user object=E2=80=99s operation</a> with <var>listener</var>=E2=
=80=99s
    <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-li=
stener-callback" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">c=
allback</a>, "<code>handleEvent</code>", =C2=AB <var>event</var> =C2=BB, an=
d
    <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-currenttarget" id=3D"ref-f=
or-dom-event-currenttarget=E2=91=A8">currentTarget</a></code> attribute val=
ue. If this throws an exception
    <var>exception</var>:

    </p>
        <ol>
         <li>
          <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org=
/multipage/webappapis.html#report-an-exception" id=3D"ref-for-report-an-exc=
eption">Report</a> <var>exception</var> for <var>listener</var>=E2=80=99s
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#event-l=
istener-callback" id=3D"ref-for-event-listener-callback=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">=
callback</a>=E2=80=99s corresponding JavaScript object=E2=80=99s
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-=
associated-realm" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-associated-realm=E2=91=A0">associated r=
ealm</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.what=
wg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-realm-global" id=3D"ref-for-concep=
t-realm-global=E2=91=A0">global object</a>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p>Set <var>legacyOutputDidListenersThrowFlag</var> if given.

      </p>
          <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The <var>legacyOutputDidListeners=
ThrowFlag</var> is only used by Indexed
      Database API. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#biblio-indexeddb" title=3D"Indexed Database API">[INDEXEDDB]</a>
    </p>
        </li></ol>
       </li><li>
        <p>Unset <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#in-passive-listener-flag" id=3D"ref-for-in=
-passive-listener-flag=E2=91=A1">in passive listener flag</a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>global</var> is a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
=3D"idl" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.ht=
ml#window" id=3D"ref-for-window=E2=91=A7">Window</a></code> object, then se=
t <var>global</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#window-cu=
rrent-event" id=3D"ref-for-window-current-event=E2=91=A2">current event</a>=
 to <var>currentEvent</var>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#stop-immediate-propagation-flag" id=3D"ref-for=
-stop-immediate-propagation-flag=E2=91=A2">stop immediate propagation flag<=
/a> is set, then
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#iterati=
on-break" id=3D"ref-for-iteration-break=E2=91=A0">break</a>.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>found</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"2.10" id=3D"firing-events"><=
span class=3D"secno">2.10. </span><span class=3D"content">Firing events</sp=
an><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#firing-event=
s"></a></h3>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"fire an event">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"concept-event-fire">fire an event</dfn> named <var>e</var> at <var>t=
arget</var>,
optionally using an <var>eventConstructor</var>, with a description of how =
IDL attributes are to be
initialized, and a <var>legacy target override flag</var>, run these steps:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>eventConstructor</var> is not given, then let <var>eventCo=
nstructor</var> be
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#event" id=3D"ref-for-event=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">Event</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>event</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-create" id=3D"ref-for-conc=
ept-event-create=E2=91=A1">creating an event</a> given
 <var>eventConstructor</var>, in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-realm" =
id=3D"ref-for-concept-relevant-realm">relevant realm</a> of <var>target</va=
r>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Initialize <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-=
link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-type" id=
=3D"ref-for-dom-event-type=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">type</a></code> attribute to =
<var>e</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Initialize any other IDL attributes of <var>event</var> as describ=
ed in the invocation of this
  algorithm.

  </p>
      <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">This also allows for the <code class=
=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom=
-event-istrusted" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-istrusted=E2=91=A7">isTrusted</a>=
</code> attribute to be set to false.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispa=
tch=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">dispatching</a> <var>event</var> at <var>target</var=
>, with
 <var>legacy target override flag</var> set if set.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Fire in the context of DOM is short for
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t-create" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-create=E2=91=A2">creating</a>, initia=
lizing, and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-event-dispatch" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-dispatch=E2=91=A1=E2=91=
=A5">dispatching</a> an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A1">e=
vent</a>.
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t-fire" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-fire=E2=91=A0">Fire an event</a> makes =
that process easier to write down.

</p>
   <div class=3D"example" id=3D"firing-events-example">
    <a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#firing-even=
ts-example"></a>
=20
    <p>If the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A2">event</a> n=
eeds its <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-bubbles" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-bubbles=E2=91=
=A6">bubbles</a></code> or <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-cancelable" id=3D"ref-for-dom-=
event-cancelable=E2=91=A8">cancelable</a></code> attribute initialized,
 one could write "<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-event-fire" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-fire=E2=91=A1">fire a=
n event</a> named <code>submit</code> at <var>target</var> with its
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#dom-event-cancelable" id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-cancelable=E2=91=A0=
=E2=93=AA">cancelable</a></code> attribute initialized to true".

 </p>
    <p>Or, when a custom constructor is needed, "<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-fire" id=3D"ref-for-conc=
ept-event-fire=E2=91=A2">fire an event</a> named <code>click</code> at
 <var>target</var> using <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://w3c.github.io/pointerevents/#dom-mouseevent" id=3D"ref-for-dom-=
mouseevent=E2=91=A1">MouseEvent</a></code> with its <code class=3D"idl"><a =
data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io/uievents/#dom-uievent-=
detail" id=3D"ref-for-dom-uievent-detail">detail</a></code> attribute initi=
alized to 1".

 </p>
    <p>Occasionally the return value is important:

 </p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>doAction</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-fire" id=3D"ref-for-con=
cept-event-fire=E2=91=A3">firing an event</a> named
  <code>like</code> at <var>target</var>.

  </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>doAction</var> is true, then =E2=80=A6
 </p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"2.11" id=3D"action-versus-oc=
currence"><span class=3D"secno">2.11. </span><span class=3D"bs-old-id" id=
=3D"action-versus-occurance"></span><span class=3D"content">Action versus o=
ccurrence</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/=
#action-versus-occurrence"></a></h3>
   <p>An <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A3">event</a> signif=
ies an occurrence, not an action. Phrased differently, it
represents a notification from an algorithm and can be used to influence th=
e future course
of that algorithm (e.g., through invoking <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-=
type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-preventdefault"=
 id=3D"ref-for-dom-event-preventdefault=E2=91=A8">preventDefault()</a></cod=
e>). <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A4">Events</a> must not =
be
used as actions or initiators that cause some algorithm to start running. T=
hat is not what
they are for.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">This is called out here specifically bec=
ause previous
iterations of the DOM had a concept of "default actions" associated with <a=
 data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event"=
 id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A5">events</a>
that gave folks all the wrong ideas. <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event=E2=91=
=A4=E2=91=A6">Events</a> do not represent or cause actions, they
can only be used to influence an ongoing one.



</p>
   <h2 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"3" id=3D"aborting-ongoing-ac=
tivities"><span class=3D"secno">3. </span><span class=3D"content">Aborting =
ongoing activities</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#aborting-ongoing-activities"></a></h2>
   <p>Though promises do not have a built-in aborting mechanism, many APIs =
using them require abort
semantics. <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#abortcontroller" id=3D"ref-for-abortcontroller">AbortCon=
troller</a></code> is meant to support these requirements by providing an
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-abortcontroller-abort" id=3D"ref-for-dom-abortcontroller-abort=
=E2=91=A0">abort()</a></code> method that toggles the state of a correspond=
ing <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A3">AbortSignal</a=
></code> object.
The API which wishes to support aborting can accept an <code class=3D"idl">=
<a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal"=
 id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A4">AbortSignal</a></code> object, and use=
 its state to
determine how to proceed.

</p>
   <p>APIs that rely upon <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortcontroller" id=3D"ref-for-abortcontr=
oller=E2=91=A0">AbortController</a></code> are encouraged to respond to <co=
de class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#dom-abortcontroller-abort" id=3D"ref-for-dom-abortcontroller-abort=E2=
=91=A1">abort()</a></code>
by rejecting any unsettled promise with the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-lin=
k-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-=
for-abortsignal=E2=91=A5">AbortSignal</a></code>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-abort-reason" id=
=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-abort-reason">abort reason</a>.

</p>
   <div class=3D"example" id=3D"aborting-ongoing-activities-example">
    <a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#aborting-on=
going-activities-example"></a>
=20
    <p>A hypothetical <code>doAmazingness({ ... })</code> method could acce=
pt an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A6">AbortSignal<=
/a></code> object
 to support aborting as follows:

 </p>
<pre><code class=3D"highlight lang-javascript"><c- a=3D"">const</c-> contro=
ller <c- o=3D"">=3D</c-> <c- ow=3D"">new</c-> AbortController<c- p=3D"">();=
</c->
<c- a=3D"">const</c-> signal <c- o=3D"">=3D</c-> controller<c- p=3D"">.</c-=
>signal<c- p=3D"">;</c->

startSpinner<c- p=3D"">();</c->

