ithm-for=3D"AbortController">
    <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"AbortController" data-d=
fn-type=3D"constructor" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"AbortController()|const=
ructor()" id=3D"dom-abortcontroller-abortcontroller"><code>new AbortControl=
ler()</code></dfn>
constructor steps are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>signal</var> be a new <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-=
abortsignal=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">AbortSignal</a></code> object.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-=
link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortcontroller-sign=
al" id=3D"ref-for-abortcontroller-signal">signal</a> to <var>signal</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"AbortControll=
er" data-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-abortcontroller-=
signal"><code>signal</code></dfn> getter steps are to return
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D=
"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortcontroller-signal" id=3D"re=
f-for-abortcontroller-signal=E2=91=A0">signal</a>.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"abort(reason)" data-algorithm=
-for=3D"AbortController">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"AbortControl=
ler" data-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"abort(reason)|abo=
rt()" id=3D"dom-abortcontroller-abort"><code>abort(<var>reason</var>)</code=
></dfn> method steps are
to <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortcont=
roller-signal-abort" id=3D"ref-for-abortcontroller-signal-abort">signal abo=
rt</a> on <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/=
#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">this</a> with <var>reason</var=
> if it is given.
</p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"signal abort" data-algorithm-=
for=3D"AbortController">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"AbortController" data-=
dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"abortcontroller-signal-abort">signa=
l abort</dfn> on an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortcontroller" id=3D"ref-for-abortcontroller=
=E2=91=A4">AbortController</a></code>
<var>controller</var> with an optional <var>reason</var>, <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-signal-abort" id=
=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-signal-abort">signal abort</a> on
<var>controller</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#abortcontroller-signal" id=3D"ref-for-abortcontroller-s=
ignal=E2=91=A1">signal</a> with <var>reason</var> if it is given.
</p>
   </div>
