</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-abort-algorithms" id=3D"ref-for-abor=
tsignal-abort-algorithms">abort algorithms</a> enable APIs with complex
requirements to react in a reasonable way to <code class=3D"idl"><a data-li=
nk-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-abortcontroller-ab=
ort" id=3D"ref-for-dom-abortcontroller-abort=E2=91=A4">abort()</a></code>. =
For example, a given API=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-=
abort-reason" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-abort-reason=E2=91=A7">abort reason=
</a> might need to be propagated to a cross-thread environment, such as a
service worker.

</p>
