 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>signal</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-abort-reason" id=3D"ref-for-aborts=
ignal-abort-reason=E2=91=A8">abort reason</a> to <var>reason</var> if it is=
 given;
 otherwise to a new "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-ty=
pe=3D"exception" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#aborterror" id=3D"=
ref-for-aborterror=E2=91=A1">AbortError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a =
data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMExcep=
tion" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">DOMException</a></c=
ode>.

