#concept-relevant-global" id=3D"ref-for-concept-relevant-global=E2=91=A0">r=
elevant global object</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/mul=
tipage/timers-and-user-prompts.html#run-steps-after-a-timeout" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-run-steps-after-a-timeout">Run steps after a timeout</a> given <var>globa=
l</var>, "<code>AbortSignal-timeout</code>",
  <var>milliseconds</var>, and the following step:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/m=
ultipage/webappapis.html#queue-a-global-task" id=3D"ref-for-queue-a-global-=
task">Queue a global task</a> on the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/timers-and-user-prompts.html#timer-task-=
source" id=3D"ref-for-timer-task-source">timer task source</a> given <var>g=
lobal</var> to
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsign=
al-signal-abort" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-signal-abort=E2=91=A0">signal ab=
ort</a> given <var>signal</var> and a new
   "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" =
href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#timeouterror" id=3D"ref-for-timeout=
error=E2=91=A0">TimeoutError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-t=
ype=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D=
"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">DOMException</a></code>.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
      <p>For the duration of this timeout, if <var>signal</var> has any eve=
nt listeners registered for
  its <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#eventdef-abortsignal-abort" id=3D"ref-for-eventdef-abortsigna=
l-abort">abort</a></code> event, there must be a strong reference from <var=
