   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"AbortSignal" =
data-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-abortsignal-onabort"=
><code>onabort</code></dfn> attribute is an
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/we=
bappapis.html#event-handler-idl-attributes" id=3D"ref-for-event-handler-idl=
-attributes">event handler IDL attribute</a> for the <dfn class=3D"dfn-pane=
led" data-dfn-for=3D"AbortSignal" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=
=3D"abortsignal-onabort"><code>onabort</code></dfn>
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/we=
bappapis.html#event-handlers" id=3D"ref-for-event-handlers=E2=91=A0">event =
handler</a>, whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.what=
wg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#event-handler-event-type" id=3D"ref-for-ev=
ent-handler-event-type">event handler event type</a> is
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"AbortSignal" data-dfn-t=
ype=3D"event" data-export=3D"" id=3D"eventdef-abortsignal-abort"><code>abor=
t</code></dfn>.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Changes to an <code class=3D"idl"><a dat=
a-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D=
"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A6">AbortSignal</a></code> object repre=
sent the wishes of the corresponding
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#abortcontroller" id=3D"ref-for-abortcontroller=E2=91=A7">AbortContr=
oller</a></code> object, but an API observing the <code class=3D"idl"><a da=
ta-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=
=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A7">AbortSignal</a></code> object ca=
n choose to ignore
them. For instance, if the operation has already completed.

</p>
