   <p>An <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A8">=
AbortSignal</a></code> object is <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D=
"AbortSignal" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"abortsignal-abor=
ted">aborted</dfn> when its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-=
abort-reason" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-abort-reason=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">abo=
rt reason</a> is not undefined.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"add" data-algorithm-for=3D"Ab=
ortSignal">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"AbortSignal" data-dfn-=
type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"abortsignal-add">add</dfn> an algorithm=
