data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMExcep=
tion" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">DOMException</a></c=
ode>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>dependentSignalsToAbort</var> be a new <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list" id=3D"ref-for-list=E2=
=91=A0=E2=93=AA">list</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#l=
ist-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A7">For each</a> <var>depende=
ntSignal</var> of <var>signal</var>=E2=80=99s
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsigna=
l-dependent-signals" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-dependent-signals">dependent=
 signals</a>:

