        <ol>
         <li>
          <p>Set <var>dependentSignal</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"=
dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-abort-reason" id=3D"r=
ef-for-abortsignal-abort-reason=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">abort reason</a> to <var=
>signal</var>=E2=80=99s
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsi=
gnal-abort-reason" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-abort-reason=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4=
">abort reason</a>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#list-append" id=3D"ref-for-list-append=E2=91=A6">Append</a> <var>depende=
ntSignal</var> to
     <var>dependentSignalsToAbort</var>.
    </p>
        </li></ol>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
