-the-abort-steps" id=3D"ref-for-run-the-abort-steps">Run the abort steps</a=
> for <var>signal</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#l=
ist-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A8">For each</a> <var>depende=
ntSignal</var> of <var>dependentSignalsToAbort</var>,
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#run-the-abo=
rt-steps" id=3D"ref-for-run-the-abort-steps=E2=91=A0">run the abort steps</=
a> for <var>dependentSignal</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
