ist-empty" id=3D"ref-for-list-empty">Empty</a> <var>signal</var>=E2=80=99s =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-=
abort-algorithms" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-abort-algorithms=E2=91=A3">abor=
t algorithms</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-event-fire" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-fire=E2=91=A4">Fire an event</=
a> named <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#eventdef-abortsignal-abort" id=3D"ref-for-eventdef-abortsi=
gnal-abort=E2=91=A0">abort</a></code> at <var>signal</var>.
</p>
