   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"create a dependent abort sign=
al">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"create-a-dependent-abort-signal">create a dependent abort signal</df=
n> from a list of <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A3=
=E2=91=A3">AbortSignal</a></code> objects
<var>signals</var>, using <var>signalInterface</var>, which must be either =
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A4">AbortSign=
al</a></code> or an
interface that inherits from it, and a <var>realm</var>:

</p>
