     <li>
      <p>Let <var>resultSignal</var> be a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#new" id=3D"ref-for-new">new</a> object imp=
lementing
 <var>signalInterface</var> using <var>realm</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#l=
ist-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">For each</a> <va=
r>signal</var> of <var>signals</var>: if <var>signal</var> is
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal=
-aborted" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-aborted=E2=91=A8">aborted</a>, then set=
 <var>resultSignal</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-abort-reason" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-=
abort-reason=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">abort reason</a> to
 <var>signal</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-abort-reason" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-abort-=
reason=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">abort reason</a> and return <var>resultSignal</va=
r>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>resultSignal</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-dependent" id=3D"ref-for-abo=
rtsignal-dependent">dependent</a> to true.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#l=
ist-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">For each</a> <va=
r>signal</var> of <var>signals</var>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>If <var>signal</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-dependent" id=3D"ref-for-abortsig=
nal-dependent=E2=91=A0">dependent</a> is false:

    </p>
        <ol>
         <li>
          <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#set-append" id=3D"ref-for-set-append=E2=91=A1">Append</a> <var>signal</v=
ar> to <var>resultSignal</var>=E2=80=99s
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsi=
gnal-source-signals" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-source-signals">source signa=
ls</a>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#set-append" id=3D"ref-for-set-append=E2=91=A2">Append</a> <var>resultSig=
nal</var> to <var>signal</var>=E2=80=99s
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsi=
gnal-dependent-signals" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-dependent-signals=E2=91=
=A0">dependent signals</a>.
    </p>
        </li></ol>
       </li><li>
        <p>Otherwise, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.=
whatwg.org/#list-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">for=
 each</a> <var>sourceSignal</var> of <var>signal</var>=E2=80=99s
    <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsig=
nal-source-signals" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-source-signals=E2=91=A0">sour=
ce signals</a>:

    </p>
        <ol>
         <li>
          <p>Assert: <var>sourceSignal</var> is not <a data-link-type=3D"df=
n" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-aborted" id=3D"ref-for-=
abortsignal-aborted=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">aborted</a> and not
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsi=
gnal-dependent" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-dependent=E2=91=A1">dependent</a>=
.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#set-append" id=3D"ref-for-set-append=E2=91=A3">Append</a> <var>sourceSig=
nal</var> to <var>resultSignal</var>=E2=80=99s
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsi=
gnal-source-signals" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-source-signals=E2=91=A1">sou=
rce signals</a>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#set-append" id=3D"ref-for-set-append=E2=91=A4">Append</a> <var>resultSig=
nal</var> to <var>sourceSignal</var>=E2=80=99s
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsi=
gnal-dependent-signals" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-dependent-signals=E2=91=
=A1">dependent signals</a>.
    </p>
        </li></ol>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>resultSignal</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <h4 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"3.2.1" id=3D"abort-signal-ga=
rbage-collection"><span class=3D"secno">3.2.1. </span><span class=3D"conten=
t">Garbage collection</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#abort-signal-garbage-collection"></a></h4>
   <p>A non-<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
abortsignal-aborted" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-aborted=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">a=
borted</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#a=
bortsignal-dependent" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-dependent=E2=91=A2">depende=
nt</a> <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A5">Ab=
ortSignal</a></code> object must not be
garbage collected while its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-source-signals" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-sourc=
e-signals=E2=91=A2">source signals</a> is non-empty and it has registered e=
vent
listeners for its <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#eventdef-abortsignal-abort" id=3D"ref-for-eventde=
f-abortsignal-abort=E2=91=A1">abort</a></code> event or its <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-abort-algorithm=
s" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-abort-algorithms=E2=91=A4">abort algorithms</a=
> is non-empty.


</p>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"3.3" id=3D"abortcontroller-a=
pi-integration"><span class=3D"secno">3.3. </span><span class=3D"content">U=
sing <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#abortcontroller" id=3D"ref-for-abortcontroller=E2=91=A8">Abort=
Controller</a></code> and <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=
=91=A3=E2=91=A6">AbortSignal</a></code> objects in
APIs</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abor=
tcontroller-api-integration"></a></h3>
   <p>Any web platform API using promises to represent operations that can =
be aborted must adhere to
the following:

</p>
   <ul class=3D"brief">
    <li>Accept <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A3=E2=
=91=A7">AbortSignal</a></code> objects through a <code>signal</code> dictio=
nary member.
=20
    </li><li>Convey that the operation got aborted by rejecting the promise=
 with <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A8">Abo=
rtSignal</a></code> object=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal=
-abort-reason" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-abort-reason=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">ab=
ort reason</a>.
=20
    </li><li>Reject immediately if the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-typ=
e=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-a=
bortsignal=E2=91=A4=E2=93=AA">AbortSignal</a></code> is already <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-aborted" id=
=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-aborted=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">aborted</a>, otherwise:
=20
    </li><li>Use the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#abortsignal-abort-algorithms" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-abort-algo=
rithms=E2=91=A5">abort algorithms</a> mechanism to observe changes to the <=
code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#abortsignal" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A0">AbortSigna=
l</a></code>
 object and do so in a manner that does not lead to clashes with other obse=
rvers.

   </li></ul>
   <div class=3D"example" id=3D"aborting-ongoing-activities-spec-example">
    <a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#aborting-on=
going-activities-spec-example"></a>
=20
    <p>The method steps for a promise-returning method <code>doAmazingness(=
<var>options</var>)</code>
 could be as follows:

 </p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>global</var> be <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:/=
/webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A0">this</=
a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org=
/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-global" id=3D"ref-for-concept-r=
elevant-global=E2=91=A1">relevant global object</a>.

  </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>p</var> be <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webi=
dl.spec.whatwg.org/#a-new-promise" id=3D"ref-for-a-new-promise">a new promi=
se</a>.

  </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>options</var>["<code>signal</code>"] <a data-link-type=3D"=
dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-exists" id=3D"ref-for-map-e=
xists=E2=91=A1">exists</a>:

   </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>Let <var>signal</var> be <var>options</var>["<code>signal</code>=
"].

    </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>signal</var> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-aborted" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-abort=
ed=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">aborted</a>, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#reject" id=3D"ref-for-reject">reject</a> <va=
r>p</var> with <var>signal</var>=E2=80=99s
    <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsig=
nal-abort-reason" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-abort-reason=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8"=
>abort reason</a> and return <var>p</var>.

    </p>
       </li><li>
        <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#a=
bortsignal-add" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-add=E2=91=A0">Add the following a=
bort steps</a> to <var>signal</var>:

     </p>
        <ol>
         <li>
          <p>Stop doing amazing things.

      </p>
         </li><li>
          <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#reject" id=3D"ref-for-reject=E2=91=A0">Reject</a> <var>p</var> with <va=
r>signal</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-abort-reason" id=3D"ref-for-abortsignal-abort-reas=
on=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">abort reason</a>.
     </p>
        </li></ol>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>Run these steps <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spe=
c.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#in-parallel" id=3D"ref-for-in-pa=
rallel=E2=91=A0">in parallel</a>:

   </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>Let <var>amazingResult</var> be the result of doing some amazing=
 things.

    </p>
       </li><li>
        <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/m=
ultipage/webappapis.html#queue-a-global-task" id=3D"ref-for-queue-a-global-=
task=E2=91=A0">Queue a global task</a> on the amazing task source given <va=
r>global</var> to <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.wha=
twg.org/#resolve" id=3D"ref-for-resolve">resolve</a> <var>p</var>
    with <var>amazingResult</var>.
   </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>p</var>.
 </p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <p>APIs not using promises should still adhere to the above as much as p=
ossible.



</p>
   <h2 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4" id=3D"nodes"><span class=
=3D"secno">4. </span><span class=3D"content">Nodes</span><a class=3D"self-l=
ink" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodes"></a></h2>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.1" id=3D"introduction-to-t=
he-dom"><span class=3D"secno">4.1. </span><span class=3D"content">Introduct=
ion to "The DOM"</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#introduction-to-the-dom"></a></h3>
   <p>In its original sense, "The DOM" is an API for
accessing and manipulating documents (in particular, HTML and XML
documents). In this specification, the term "document" is used for any
markup-based resource, ranging from short static documents to long essays o=
r
reports with rich multimedia, as well as to fully-fledged interactive
applications.</p>
   <p>Each such document is represented as a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-n=
ode-tree">node tree</a>. Some of the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=
=E2=93=AA">nodes</a> in a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">tree</a> can have <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" i=
d=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A6">children</a>, while others are al=
ways leaves.

</p>
   <p>To illustrate, consider this HTML document:</p>
<pre class=3D"highlight lang-markup"><c- cp=3D"">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</c->
<c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">html</c-> <c- e=3D"">class</c-><c- o=3D"">=
=3D</c-><c- s=3D"">e</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
 <c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">head</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;&lt;</c-><c- f=3D""=
>title</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->Aliens?<c- p=3D"">&lt;/</c-><c- f=3D"">title=
</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;&lt;/</c-><c- f=3D"">head</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
 <c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">body</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->Why yes.<c- p=
=3D"">&lt;/</c-><c- f=3D"">body</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
<c- p=3D"">&lt;/</c-><c- f=3D"">html</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c->
</pre>
   <p>It is represented as follows:</p>
   <ul class=3D"domTree">
    <li>
    =20
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-do=
cument" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A1">Document</a>
 =20
     <ul>
      <li class=3D"t10"><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#concept-doctype" id=3D"ref-for-concept-doctype">Doctype</a>: <c=
ode>html</code>
  =20
      </li><li class=3D"t1">
       <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element">Element</a></code>: <code>ht=
ml</code> <span class=3D"t2"><code class=3D"attribute name">class</code>=3D=
"<code class=3D"attribute value">e</code>"</span>
   =20
       <ul>
        <li class=3D"t1">
        =20
      <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A0">Element</a></code>: =
<code>head</code>
     =20
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"t1">
          =20
        <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A1">Element</a></code>=
: <code>title</code>
       =20
           <ul>
            <li class=3D"t3"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text">Text</a></co=
de>: <span>Aliens?</span>
       =20
           </li></ul>
         </li></ul>
        </li><li class=3D"t3"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A0">Te=
xt</a></code>: <span>=E2=8F=8E=E2=90=A3</span>
    =20
        </li><li class=3D"t1">
        =20
      <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A2">Element</a></code>: =
<code>body</code>
     =20
         <ul>
          <li class=3D"t3"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A1">Text<=
/a></code>: <span>Why yes.=E2=8F=8E</span>
     =20
         </li></ul>
       </li></ul>
     </li></ul>
   </li></ul>
   <p>Note that, due to the magic that is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#html-parser" id=3D"ref=
-for-html-parser">HTML parsing</a>, not all
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-whit=
espace" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-whitespace=E2=91=A3">ASCII whitespace</a> were =
turned into <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A2">Text</a></code> <a d=
ata-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">nodes</a>, but the general conc=
ept is
clear. Markup goes in, a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">tr=
ee</a> of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">nodes</a> comes o=
ut.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The most excellent
<a href=3D"https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/">Live DO=
M Viewer</a>
can be used to explore this matter in more detail.


</p>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.2" id=3D"node-trees"><span=
 class=3D"secno">4.2. </span><span class=3D"content">Node tree</span><a cla=
ss=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#node-trees"></a></h3>
   <p><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=
=3D"concept-node">Nodes</dfn> are objects that <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#implements" id=3D"ref-for-implements"=
>implement</a> <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#node" id=3D"ref-for-node">Node</a></code>.
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">Nodes</a> <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-participate" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-participate=E2=91=A3">participate</a> in a <a data=
-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree" id=3D=
"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">tree</a>, which is known as the
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-node-tree">node tree</dfn>.

</p>
   <div class=3D"note" role=3D"note">
    <p>In practice you deal with more specific objects.

 </p>
    <p>Objects that <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#implements" id=3D"ref-for-implements=E2=91=A0">implement</a> <co=
de class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#node" id=3D"ref-for-node=E2=91=A0">Node</a></code> also implement an i=
nherited interface: <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document" id=3D"ref-for-document">Document</a><=
/code>,
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#documenttype" id=3D"ref-for-documenttype">DocumentType</a></code>,=
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#documentfragment" id=3D"ref-for-documentfragment">DocumentFragment=
</a></code>, <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A3">Element</a></=
code>, <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#characterdata" id=3D"ref-for-characterdata">CharacterData</a=
></code>, or <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#attr" id=3D"ref-for-attr">Attr</a></code>.

 </p>
    <p>Objects that implement <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documentfragment" id=3D"ref-for-docum=
entfragment=E2=91=A0">DocumentFragment</a></code> sometimes implement <code=
 class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#shadowroot" id=3D"ref-for-shadowroot=E2=91=A0">ShadowRoot</a></code>.

 </p>
    <p>Objects that implement <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=
=A4">Element</a></code> also typically implement an inherited interface, su=
ch as
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://html.spec.wh=
atwg.org/multipage/text-level-semantics.html#htmlanchorelement" id=3D"ref-f=
or-htmlanchorelement">HTMLAnchorElement</a></code>.

 </p>
    <p>Objects that implement <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#characterdata" id=3D"ref-for-characte=
rdata=E2=91=A0">CharacterData</a></code> also implement an inherited interf=
ace: <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A3">Text</a></code>,
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#processinginstruction" id=3D"ref-for-processinginstruction">Proces=
singInstruction</a></code>, or <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#comment" id=3D"ref-for-comment">Comm=
ent</a></code>.

 </p>
    <p>Objects that implement <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A4">Te=
xt</a></code> sometimes implement <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"=
idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#cdatasection" id=3D"ref-for-cdata=
section">CDATASection</a></code>.

 </p>
    <p>Thus, every <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">node</a>=
=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org=
/#dfn-primary-interface" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-primary-interface">primary inter=
face</a> is one of: <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document" id=3D"ref-for-document=E2=91=A0">Docu=
ment</a></code>, <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documenttype" id=3D"ref-for-documenttype=E2=91=A0"=
>DocumentType</a></code>,
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#documentfragment" id=3D"ref-for-documentfragment=E2=91=A1">Documen=
tFragment</a></code>, <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#shadowroot" id=3D"ref-for-shadowroot=E2=91=A1=
">ShadowRoot</a></code>, <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A5">E=
lement</a></code> or an inherited interface of <code class=3D"idl"><a data-=
link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-f=
or-element=E2=91=A6">Element</a></code>,
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#attr" id=3D"ref-for-attr=E2=91=A0">Attr</a></code>, <code class=3D=
"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#text" =
id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A5">Text</a></code>, <code class=3D"idl"><a data-l=
ink-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#cdatasection" id=3D"r=
ef-for-cdatasection=E2=91=A0">CDATASection</a></code>, <code class=3D"idl">=
<a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#processingin=
struction" id=3D"ref-for-processinginstruction=E2=91=A0">ProcessingInstruct=
ion</a></code>, or <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#comment" id=3D"ref-for-comment=E2=91=A0">Comment=
</a></code>.
</p>
   </div>
   <p>For brevity, this specification refers to an object that <a data-link=
-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#implements" id=3D"ref=
-for-implements=E2=91=A1">implements</a> <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-t=
ype=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#node" id=3D"ref-for-node=
=E2=91=A1">Node</a></code> and an
inherited interface <code><var>NodeInterface</var></code>, as a
<code><var>NodeInterface</var></code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A4">node</a>.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A0">node tree</a> is c=
onstrained as follows, expressed as a relationship between a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">node</a> and its potential =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A7">children</a>:

</p>
   <dl>
    <dt><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#document" id=3D"ref-for-document=E2=91=A1">Document</a></co=
de>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>In <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-tree-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=A4">tree order</a=
>:
  </p>
     <ol>
      <li>
       <p>Zero or more <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#processinginstruction" id=3D"ref-for-proce=
ssinginstruction=E2=91=A1">ProcessingInstruction</a></code> or <code class=
=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#com=
ment" id=3D"ref-for-comment=E2=91=A1">Comment</a></code> <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">nodes</a>.
   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>Optionally one <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documenttype" id=3D"ref-for-documenttype=
=E2=91=A1">DocumentType</a></code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A7">node</a>.
   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>Zero or more <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#processinginstruction" id=3D"ref-for-proce=
ssinginstruction=E2=91=A2">ProcessingInstruction</a></code> or <code class=
=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#com=
ment" id=3D"ref-for-comment=E2=91=A2">Comment</a></code> <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">nodes</a>.
   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>Optionally one <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A7">E=
lement</a></code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">node</a>.
   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>Zero or more <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#processinginstruction" id=3D"ref-for-proce=
ssinginstruction=E2=91=A3">ProcessingInstruction</a></code> or <code class=
=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#com=
ment" id=3D"ref-for-comment=E2=91=A3">Comment</a></code> <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">nodes</a>.
  </p>
     </li></ol>
    </dd><dt><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documentfragment" id=3D"ref-for-documentfragment=E2=91=
=A2">DocumentFragment</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dt><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A8">Element</a></=
code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Zero or more <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A0=E2=93=
=AA">Element</a></code> or <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#characterdata" id=3D"ref-for-characterda=
ta=E2=91=A1">CharacterData</a></code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=
=E2=91=A1">nodes</a>.

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documenttype" id=3D"ref-for-documenttype=E2=91=A2">Doc=
umentType</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dt><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#characterdata" id=3D"ref-for-characterdata=E2=91=A2">C=
haracterData</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dt><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#attr" id=3D"ref-for-attr=E2=91=A1">Attr</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>No <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A8">children</a>.
</p>
   </dd></dl>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#attr" id=3D"ref-for-attr=E2=91=
=A2">Attr</a></code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2">nodes<=
/a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-=
tree-participate" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-participate=E2=91=A4">particip=
ate</a> in a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/=
#concept-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">tree</a> for h=
istorical
reasons; they never have a (non-null) <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-p=
arent=E2=91=A4">parent</a> or any <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=
=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">children</a> and are
therefore alone in a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">tree</=
a>.

</p>
   <p>To determine the <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Node" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-node-length">length</dfn>=
 of a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">node</a>
<var>node</var>, run these steps:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>If <var>node</var> is a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"id=
l" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documenttype" id=3D"ref-for-documen=
ttype=E2=91=A3">DocumentType</a></code> or <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link=
-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#attr" id=3D"ref-for-attr=
=E2=91=A3">Attr</a></code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">=
node</a>, then return 0.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>If <var>node</var> is a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"id=
l" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#characterdata" id=3D"ref-for-charac=
terdata=E2=91=A3">CharacterData</a></code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=
=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">node</a>, then return <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-cd-=
data" id=3D"ref-for-concept-cd-data">data</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-length" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-string-length=E2=91=A2">length</a>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Return the number of <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D=
"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">children</a>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A6">node</a> is conside=
red <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Node" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" =
data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-node-empty">empty</dfn> if its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-length" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-length">length</a> is 0.


</p>
   <h4 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.2.1" id=3D"document-trees"=
><span class=3D"secno">4.2.1. </span><span class=3D"content">Document tree<=
/span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document-=
trees"></a></h4>
   <p>A <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" i=
d=3D"concept-document-tree">document tree</dfn> is a <a data-link-type=3D"d=
fn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-node-tree=E2=91=A1">node tree</a> whose
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-root=E2=91=A7">root</a> is a <a data-link=
-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document" id=3D"=
ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A2">document</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"document-element">document element</dfn> of a <a data-link-type=3D"d=
fn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document" id=3D"ref-for-co=
ncept-document=E2=91=A3">document</a> is the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-ele=
ment=E2=91=A4">element</a>
whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-tree-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A5">parent</a> is th=
at <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-d=
ocument" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A4">document</a>, if it exist=
s; otherwise null.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Per the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-n=
ode-tree=E2=91=A2">node tree</a> constraints, there can be only one such
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A5">element</a>.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A7">node</a> is <dfn cl=
ass=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"in-a-docum=
ent-tree">in a document tree</dfn> if its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=
-root=E2=91=A8">root</a> is a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
ment" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A5">document</a>.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A8">node</a> is <dfn cl=
ass=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"in-a-docum=
ent">in a document</dfn> if it is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#in-a-document-tree" id=3D"ref-for-in-a-document-tree"=
>in a document tree</a>.
<span class=3D"note">The term <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#in-a-document" id=3D"ref-for-in-a-document">in a document=
</a> is no longer supposed to be used. It indicates that
the standard using it has not been updated to account for <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-tree" id=3D"re=
f-for-concept-shadow-tree=E2=91=A1">shadow trees</a>.</span>


</p>
   <h4 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.2.2" id=3D"shadow-trees"><=
span class=3D"secno">4.2.2. </span><span class=3D"content">Shadow tree</spa=
n><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#shadow-trees"=
></a></h4>
   <p>A <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" i=
d=3D"concept-shadow-tree">shadow tree</dfn> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-conce=
pt-node-tree=E2=91=A3">node tree</a> whose
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-root=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">root</a> is a <a =
data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-=
root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-root=E2=91=A5">shadow root</a>.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-shadow-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-root=E2=91=A6">shadow root</a=
> is always attached to another <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=
=91=A4">node tree</a> through its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
mentfragment-host" id=3D"ref-for-concept-documentfragment-host">host</a>. A=
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-sha=
dow-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-tree=E2=91=A2">shadow tree</a> is th=
erefore never alone. The
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A5">node tree</a> of a <a data=
-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-root=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-root=E2=91=A7">shadow root</a>=E2=80=99s <a =
data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-documen=
tfragment-host" id=3D"ref-for-concept-documentfragment-host=E2=91=A0">host<=
/a> is sometimes
referred to as the <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-ex=
port=3D"" id=3D"concept-light-tree">light tree</dfn>.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-=
tree=E2=91=A3">shadow tree</a>=E2=80=99s corresponding <a data-link-type=3D=
"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-light-tree" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-concept-light-tree">light tree</a> can be a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concep=
t-shadow-tree=E2=91=A4">shadow tree</a>
itself.

</p>
   <p id=3D"in-a-shadow-including-document">A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=
=E2=91=A2=E2=93=AA">node</a> is <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D=
"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"connected">connected</dfn> if its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shad=
ow-including-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-including-root">shadow-incl=
uding root</a> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A6">document=
</a>.

</p>
   <h5 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.2.2.1" id=3D"shadow-tree-s=
lots"><span class=3D"secno">4.2.2.1. </span><span class=3D"content">Slots</=
span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#shadow-tre=
e-slots"></a></h5>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-shadow-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-tree=E2=91=A5">shadow tree</a=
> contains zero or more <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A6">elemen=
ts</a> that are
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" data-lt=
=3D"slot" id=3D"concept-slot">slots</dfn>.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A0"=
>slot</a> can only be created through HTML=E2=80=99s <code><a data-link-typ=
e=3D"element" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html=
#the-slot-element" id=3D"ref-for-the-slot-element">slot</a></code> element.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A1">slot</a> has an associated <=
dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"slot" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-=
export=3D"" id=3D"slot-name">name</dfn> (a string). Unless stated
otherwise it is the empty string.

</p>
   <p>Use these <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#concept-element-attributes-change-ext" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-at=
tributes-change-ext">attribute change steps</a> to update a <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slot" id=3D"ref-for=
-concept-slot=E2=91=A2">slot</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slot-name" id=3D"ref-for-slot-name">name</=
a>:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>If <var>element</var> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A3">s=
lot</a>, <var>localName</var> is <code>name</code>, and
  <var>namespace</var> is null:

  </p>
     <ol>
      <li>
       <p>If <var>value</var> is <var>oldValue</var>, then return.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>If <var>value</var> is null and <var>oldValue</var> is the empty =
string, then return.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>If <var>value</var> is the empty string and <var>oldValue</var> i=
s null, then return.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>If <var>value</var> is null or the empty string, then set <var>el=
ement</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slot-name=
" id=3D"ref-for-slot-name=E2=91=A0">name</a> to the empty string.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>Otherwise, set <var>element</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"=
dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slot-name" id=3D"ref-for-slot-nam=
e=E2=91=A1">name</a> to <var>value</var>.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>Run <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#assign-slotables-for-a-tree" id=3D"ref-for-assign-slotables-for-a-tree">a=
ssign slottables for a tree</a> with <var>element</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-root=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">root</a>.
  </p>
     </li></ol>
   </li></ol>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The first <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=
=E2=91=A4">slot</a> in a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-tree=E2=91=
=A6">shadow tree</a>, in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=A5"=
>tree order</a>, whose
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slot-name" i=
d=3D"ref-for-slot-name=E2=91=A2">name</a> is the empty string, is sometimes=
 known as the "default slot".

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A5">slot</a> has an associated <=
dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"slot" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-=
export=3D"" id=3D"slot-assigned-nodes">assigned nodes</dfn> (a list of
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slot=
able" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slotable=E2=91=A1">slottables</a>). Unless stat=
ed otherwise it is empty.

</p>
   <h5 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.2.2.2" id=3D"light-tree-sl=
otables"><span class=3D"secno">4.2.2.2. </span><span class=3D"content">Slot=
tables</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#li=
ght-tree-slotables"></a></h5>
   <p><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">Element</a>=
</code> and <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A6">Text</a></code> <a d=
ata-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A0">nodes</a> are
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" data-lt=
=3D"slottable" id=3D"concept-slotable">slottables</dfn>.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A6"=
>slot</a> can be a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-slotable" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slotable=E2=91=A2">slottable=
</a>.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-slotable" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slotable=E2=91=A3">slottable</a> has an=
 associated <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"slottable" data-dfn-=
type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"slotable-name">name</dfn> (a
string). Unless stated otherwise it is the empty string.

</p>
   <p>Use these <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#concept-element-attributes-change-ext" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-at=
tributes-change-ext=E2=91=A0">attribute change steps</a> to update a <a dat=
a-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slotable" =
id=3D"ref-for-concept-slotable=E2=91=A4">slottable</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slotable-name" id=3D"r=
ef-for-slotable-name">name</a>:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>If <var>localName</var> is <code>slot</code> and <var>namespace</va=
r> is null:

  </p>
     <ol>
      <li>
       <p>If <var>value</var> is <var>oldValue</var>, then return.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>If <var>value</var> is null and <var>oldValue</var> is the empty =
string, then return.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>If <var>value</var> is the empty string and <var>oldValue</var> i=
s null, then return.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>If <var>value</var> is null or the empty string, then set <var>el=
ement</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slotable-=
name" id=3D"ref-for-slotable-name=E2=91=A0">name</a> to the empty string.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>Otherwise, set <var>element</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"=
dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slotable-name" id=3D"ref-for-slot=
able-name=E2=91=A1">name</a> to <var>value</var>.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>If <var>element</var> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slotable-assigned" id=3D"ref-for-slotable-assigned=
=E2=91=A1">assigned</a>, then run <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#assign-slotables" id=3D"ref-for-assign-slotables">ass=
ign slottables</a>
   for <var>element</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slotable-assigned-slot" id=3D"ref-for-slotable-assi=
gned-slot">assigned slot</a>.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>Run <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#assign-a-slot" id=3D"ref-for-assign-a-slot">assign a slot</a> for <var>el=
ement</var>.
  </p>
     </li></ol>
   </li></ol>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-slotable" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slotable=E2=91=A5">slottable</a> has an=
 associated
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"slottable" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn"=
 data-export=3D"" id=3D"slotable-assigned-slot">assigned slot</dfn> (null o=
r a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-=
slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A7">slot</a>).
Unless stated otherwise it is null. A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slotable" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slotable=
=E2=91=A6">slottable</a> is
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"slottable" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn"=
 data-export=3D"" id=3D"slotable-assigned">assigned</dfn> if its <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slotable-assigned-slot=
" id=3D"ref-for-slotable-assigned-slot=E2=91=A0">assigned slot</a> is
non-null.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-slotable" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slotable=E2=91=A7">slottable</a> has an=
 associated <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"slottable" data-dfn-=
type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"slottable-manual-slot-assignment">manua=
l slot assignment</dfn> (null
or a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A8">slot</a>). Unless stated otherw=
ise, it is null.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slotable" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slotable=
=E2=91=A8">slottable</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slottable-manual-slot-assignment" id=3D"ref-for-slot=
table-manual-slot-assignment">manual slot assignment</a> can be implemented=
 using a weak
reference to the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">slot</a>, =
because this variable is not directly accessible from script.

</p>
   <h5 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.2.2.3" id=3D"finding-slots=
-and-slotables"><span class=3D"secno">4.2.2.3. </span><span class=3D"conten=
t">Finding slots and slottables</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#finding-slots-and-slotables"></a></h5>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"find a slot">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D=
"" id=3D"find-a-slot">find a slot</dfn> for a given <a data-link-type=3D"df=
n" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slotable" id=3D"ref-for-con=
cept-slotable=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">slottable</a> <var>slottable</var> and an =
optional
boolean <var>open</var> (default false):

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>slottable</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept=
-tree-parent=E2=91=A6">parent</a> is null, then return null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>shadow</var> be <var>slottable</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent" i=
d=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A7">parent</a>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ele=
ment-shadow-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-shadow-root">shadow root</a=
>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>shadow</var> is null, then return null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>open</var> is true and <var>shadow</var>=E2=80=99s <a data=
-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#shadowroot-mode" id=
=3D"ref-for-shadowroot-mode=E2=91=A2">mode</a> is not
 "<code>open</code>", then return null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>shadow</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#shadowroot-slot-assignment" id=3D"ref-for-shado=
wroot-slot-assignment">slot assignment</a> is "<code>manual</code>", then
 return the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">slot</a> in <va=
r>shadow</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=
=E2=91=A2">descendants</a> whose
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/s=
cripting.html#manually-assigned-nodes" id=3D"ref-for-manually-assigned-node=
s">manually assigned nodes</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://in=
fra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-contain" id=3D"ref-for-list-contain=E2=91=A2">con=
tains</a> <var>slottable</var>, if any; otherwise
 null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return the first <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#concept-slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">s=
lot</a> in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-tree-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=A6">tree order</a=
> in <var>shadow</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tre=
e-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A3">descendants</=
a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slo=
t-name" id=3D"ref-for-slot-name=E2=91=A3">name</a> is <var>slottable</var>=
=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slotable-na=
me" id=3D"ref-for-slotable-name=E2=91=A2">name</a>, if any; otherwise null.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"find slottables">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"find-slotables">find slottables</dfn> for a given <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slot" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-slot=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">slot</a>
<var>slot</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>result</var> be =C2=AB =C2=BB.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>root</var> be <var>slot</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root" id=3D"ref-=
for-concept-tree-root=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">root</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>root</var> is not a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-=
root=E2=91=A8">shadow root</a>, then return <var>result</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>host</var> be <var>root</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-documentfragment-host=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-documentfragment-host=E2=91=A1">host</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>root</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#shadowroot-slot-assignment" id=3D"ref-for-shadowr=
oot-slot-assignment=E2=91=A0">slot assignment</a> is "<code>manual</code>":

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/=
#list-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">For each</a> <=
a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slota=
ble" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slotable=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">slottable</a> <var>s=
lottable</var> of <var>slot</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage=
/scripting.html#manually-assigned-nodes" id=3D"ref-for-manually-assigned-no=
des=E2=91=A0">manually assigned nodes</a>, if <var>slottable</var>=E2=80=99=
s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A8">parent</a> is
   <var>host</var>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#list-append" id=3D"ref-for-list-append=E2=91=A7">append</a> <var>=
slottable</var> to <var>result</var>.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>Otherwise, for each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slotable" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slotable=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A1">slottable</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A1">child</a> <var>slottable</var> of
  <var>host</var>, in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#concept-tree-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=A7">tr=
ee order</a>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>Let <var>foundSlot</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"d=
fn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#find-a-slot" id=3D"ref-for-find-a-=
slot">finding a slot</a> given
   <var>slottable</var>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>foundSlot</var> is <var>slot</var>, then <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-append" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-list-append=E2=91=A8">append</a>
   <var>slottable</var> to <var>result</var>.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>result</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"find flattened slottables">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"find-flattened-slotables">find flattened slottables</dfn> for a give=
n
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slot=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">slot</a> <var>slot</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>result</var> be =C2=AB =C2=BB.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>slot</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-roo=
t=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">root</a> is not a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shado=
w-root=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">shadow root</a>, then return
 <var>result</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>slottables</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"df=
n" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#find-slotables" id=3D"ref-for-find-=
slotables">finding slottables</a> given
 <var>slot</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>slottables</var> is the empty list, then append each <a da=
ta-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slotable"=
 id=3D"ref-for-concept-slotable=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">slottable</a>
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tre=
e-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">child</a> of <=
var>slot</var>, in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-tree-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=A8">tree =
order</a>, to <var>slottables</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>For each <var>node</var> of <var>slottables</var>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>If <var>node</var> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A4">slot</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#concept-tree-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-root=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A3">root</a> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#concept-shadow-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-root=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A0">shadow root</a>:

    </p>
        <ol>
         <li>
          <p>Let <var>temporaryResult</var> be the result of <a data-link-t=
ype=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#find-flattened-slotables" =
id=3D"ref-for-find-flattened-slotables">finding flattened slottables</a> gi=
ven
     <var>node</var>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p>Append each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-slotable" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slotable=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A3">slottable</a> in <var>temporaryResult</var>, in order, to
     <var>result</var>.
    </p>
        </li></ol>
       </li><li>
        <p>Otherwise, append <var>node</var> to <var>result</var>.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>result</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
