-nodes=E2=91=A0">assigned nodes</a> to <var>slottables</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>For each <var>slottable</var> of <var>slottables</var>: set <var>s=
lottable</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slotable-as=
signed-slot" id=3D"ref-for-slotable-assigned-slot=E2=91=A1">assigned slot</=
a> to <var>slot</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
