ode" data-link-type=3D"exception" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#h=
ierarchyrequesterror" id=3D"ref-for-hierarchyrequesterror">HierarchyRequest=
Error</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMExcepti=
on=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
