-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">throw</a> a "<code class=
=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" href=3D"https:/=
/webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#notfounderror" id=3D"ref-for-notfounderror">NotFou=
ndError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"h=
ttps://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMExcep=
tion=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>node</var> is not a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
