 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>node</var> is a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"i=
dl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documentfragment" id=3D"ref-for-do=
cumentfragment=E2=91=A5">DocumentFragment</a></code> <a data-link-type=3D"d=
fn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concep=
t-node=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A0">node</a>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>If <var>node</var> has more than one <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" h=
ref=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
element=E2=91=A7">element</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A3">child</a> or has a
   <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A8">Text</a></code> <a data-link-=
type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-f=
or-concept-node=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A1">node</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
tree-child=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">child</a>, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A4">throw</a> a
   "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" =
href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#hierarchyrequesterror" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-hierarchyrequesterror=E2=91=A4">HierarchyRequestError</a></code>" <code c=
lass=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">DOM=
Exception</a></code>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>node</var> has no <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=
=91=A8">element</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A5">child</a>, then return.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>node</var> is a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"i=
dl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documentfragment" id=3D"ref-for-do=
cumentfragment=E2=91=A6">DocumentFragment</a></code> or <code class=3D"idl"=
><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element" id=
=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">Element</a></code> <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-node=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A2">node</a>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>If any of the following are true:

    </p>
        <ul>
         <li>
          <p><var>parent</var> has an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=
=91=A0=E2=93=AA">element</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A6">child</a> that
     <var>childrenToExclude</var> does not <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-contain" id=3D"ref-for-list-contain=
=E2=91=A3">contain</a>;

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p><var>child</var> is non-null and a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" h=
ref=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
doctype=E2=91=A1">doctype</a> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-following" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-fol=
lowing=E2=91=A1">following</a> <var>child</var>;
     or

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p><var>child</var> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype" id=3D"ref-for-concept-doctype=E2=91=
=A2">doctype</a> that <var>childrenToExclude</var> does not
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-=
contain" id=3D"ref-for-list-contain=E2=91=A4">contain</a>,
    </p>
        </li></ul>
        <p>then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatw=
g.org/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">throw</a> a "<=
code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" href=
=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#hierarchyrequesterror" id=3D"ref-for-hi=
erarchyrequesterror=E2=91=A5">HierarchyRequestError</a></code>" <code class=
=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#=
idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">DOMExce=
ption</a></code>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Return.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#a=
ssert" id=3D"ref-for-assert=E2=91=A1">Assert</a>: <var>node</var> is a <a d=
ata-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype"=
 id=3D"ref-for-concept-doctype=E2=91=A3">doctype</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If any of the following are true:

  </p>
      <ul>
       <li>
        <p><var>parent</var> has a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype" id=3D"ref-for-concept-doctype=E2=91=
=A4">doctype</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7=
">child</a> that
   <var>childrenToExclude</var> does not <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-contain" id=3D"ref-for-list-contain=E2=
=91=A5">contain</a>;

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p><var>child</var> is non-null and an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-e=
lement=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">element</a> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-preceding" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
tree-preceding=E2=91=A2">preceding</a>
   <var>child</var>; or

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p><var>child</var> is null and <var>parent</var> has an <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D=
"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">element</a>
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-t=
ree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">child</a> th=
at <var>childrenToExclude</var> does not <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-contain" id=3D"ref-for-list-contain=E2=
=91=A6">contain</a>,
  </p>
      </li></ul>
      <p>then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.=
org/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">throw</a> a "<co=
de class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" href=3D=
"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#hierarchyrequesterror" id=3D"ref-for-hiera=
rchyrequesterror=E2=91=A6">HierarchyRequestError</a></code>" <code class=3D=
"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl=
-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2">DOMExcepti=
on</a></code>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"pre-insert">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"concept-node-pre-insert">pre-insert</dfn> a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
node=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A3">node</a> <var>node</var>
into a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conce=
pt-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A4">node</a> <var>parent=
</var> before null or <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A5">node<=
/a> <var>child</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-node-ensure-pre-insertion-validity" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-ensure-=
pre-insertion-validity">Ensure pre-insert validity</a> given <var>node</var=
>, <var>parent</var>,
 <var>child</var>, and =C2=AB =C2=BB.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>referenceChild</var> be <var>child</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>referenceChild</var> is <var>node</var>, then set <var>ref=
erenceChild</var> to
 <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-next-sibling" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-next-s=
ibling">next sibling</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-node-insert" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-insert">Insert</a> <var>node</=
var> into <var>parent</var> before <var>referenceChild</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>node</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"insertion steps">
    <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#other=
-applicable-specifications" id=3D"ref-for-other-applicable-specifications=
=E2=91=A0">Specifications</a> may define
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-node-insert-ext">insertion steps</dfn> for all or some <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for=
-concept-node=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A6">nodes</a>. The
algorithm is passed <var>insertedNode</var>, as indicated in the <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-insert" i=
d=3D"ref-for-concept-node-insert=E2=91=A0">insert</a> algorithm
below. These steps must not modify the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tr=
ee=E2=91=A6">node tree</a> that <var>insertedNode</var>
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-participate" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-participate=E2=91=A5">participates=
</a> in, create <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.=
org/multipage/document-sequences.html#browsing-context" id=3D"ref-for-brows=
ing-context">browsing contexts</a>,
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-even=
t-fire" id=3D"ref-for-concept-event-fire=E2=91=A5">fire events</a>, or othe=
rwise execute JavaScript. These steps may
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/we=
bappapis.html#queue-a-global-task" id=3D"ref-for-queue-a-global-task=E2=91=
=A1">queue tasks</a> to do these things asynchronously, however.
</p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"example" id=3D"example-foo-what-do-i-put-here">
    <a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#example-foo=
-what-do-i-put-here"></a>
=20
    <p>While the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-node-insert-ext" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-insert-ext">insert=
ion steps</a> cannot execute JavaScript (among other things), they will
 indeed have script-observable consequences. Consider the below example:

 </p>
<pre class=3D"highlight lang-javascript"><code><c- a=3D"">const</c-> h1 <c-=
 o=3D"">=3D</c-> document<c- p=3D"">.</c->querySelector<c- p=3D"">(</c-><c-=
 t=3D"">'h1'</c-><c- p=3D"">);</c->

<c- a=3D"">const</c-> fragment <c- o=3D"">=3D</c-> <c- ow=3D"">new</c-> Doc=
umentFragment<c- p=3D"">();</c->
<c- a=3D"">const</c-> script <c- o=3D"">=3D</c-> fragment<c- p=3D"">.</c->a=
ppendChild<c- p=3D"">(</c->document<c- p=3D"">.</c->createElement<c- p=3D""=
>(</c-><c- t=3D"">'script'</c-><c- p=3D"">));</c->
<c- a=3D"">const</c-> style <c- o=3D"">=3D</c-> fragment<c- p=3D"">.</c->ap=
pendChild<c- p=3D"">(</c->document<c- p=3D"">.</c->createElement<c- p=3D"">=
(</c-><c- t=3D"">'style'</c-><c- p=3D"">));</c->

script<c- p=3D"">.</c->innerText<c- o=3D"">=3D</c-> <c- t=3D"">'console.log=
(getComputedStyle(h1).color)'</c-><c- p=3D"">;</c-> <c- c1=3D"">// Logs 'rg=
b(255, 0, 0)'</c->
style<c- p=3D"">.</c->innerText <c- o=3D"">=3D</c-> <c- t=3D"">'h1 {color: =
rgb(255, 0, 0);}'</c-><c- p=3D"">;</c->

document<c- p=3D"">.</c->body<c- p=3D"">.</c->append<c- p=3D"">(</c->fragme=
nt<c- p=3D"">);</c->
</code></pre>
    <p>The script in the above example logs <code class=3D"highlight lang-j=
avascript"><c- t=3D"">'rgb(255, 0, 0)'</c-></code> because
 the following happen in order:

 </p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>The <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/=
#concept-node-insert" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-insert=E2=91=A1">insert</a=
> algorithm runs, which will insert the <code><a data-link-type=3D"element"=
 href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#script" id=
=3D"ref-for-script">script</a></code> and <code>
  <a data-link-type=3D"element" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multip=
age/semantics.html#the-style-element" id=3D"ref-for-the-style-element">styl=
e</a></code> elements in order.

   </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>The HTML Standard=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-insert-ext" id=3D"ref-for-concept-n=
ode-insert-ext=E2=91=A0">insertion steps</a> run for the <code><a data-link=
-type=3D"element" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.=
html#script" id=3D"ref-for-script=E2=91=A0">script</a></code> element; they=
 do
    nothing. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#biblio-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</a>

    </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>The HTML Standard=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-insert-ext" id=3D"ref-for-concept-n=
ode-insert-ext=E2=91=A1">insertion steps</a> run for the <code>
    <a data-link-type=3D"element" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/mult=
ipage/semantics.html#the-style-element" id=3D"ref-for-the-style-element=E2=
=91=A0">style</a></code> element; they immediately apply its style rules to=
 the
    document. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#biblio-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</a>

    </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>The HTML Standard=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-post-connection-ext" id=3D"ref-for-=
concept-node-post-connection-ext">post-connection steps</a> run for the <co=
de><a data-link-type=3D"element" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multi=
page/scripting.html#script" id=3D"ref-for-script=E2=91=A1">script</a></code=
> element; they run
    the script, which immediately observes the style rules that were applie=
d in the above step.
    <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#bibli=
o-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</a>
   </p>
      </li></ol>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"post-connection steps">
    <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#other=
-applicable-specifications" id=3D"ref-for-other-applicable-specifications=
=E2=91=A1">Specifications</a> may also define
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-node-post-connection-ext">post-connection steps</dfn> for all or some
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A7">nodes</a>. The algorithm is=
 passed <var>connectedNode</var>, as indicated in the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-insert" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-insert=E2=91=A2">insert</a> algorithm b=
elow.

</p>
    <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The purpose of the <a data-link-type=3D=
"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-post-connection-ext=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-post-connection-ext=E2=91=A0">post-connection =
steps</a> is to provide an opportunity for
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A8">nodes</a> to perform any co=
nnection-related operations that modify the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-n=
ode-tree=E2=91=A7">node tree</a>
that <var>connectedNode</var> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-participate" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-part=
icipate=E2=91=A6">participates</a> in, create <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#browsin=
g-context" id=3D"ref-for-browsing-context=E2=91=A0">browsing contexts</a>,
or otherwise execute JavaScript. These steps allow a batch of <a data-link-=
type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-f=
or-concept-node=E2=91=A4=E2=93=AA">nodes</a> to be
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-insert" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-insert=E2=91=A3">inserted</a> <em>atomi=
cally</em> with respect to script, with all major side effects
occurring <em>after</em> the batch insertions into the <a data-link-type=3D=
"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for=
-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A8">node tree</a> is complete. This ensures
that all pending <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">=
