       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>parent</var> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element-shadow-host" id=3D"ref-for-element-shadow-=
host">shadow host</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-root=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A1">shadow root</a>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#shadowroo=
t-slot-assignment" id=3D"ref-for-shadowroot-slot-assignment=E2=91=A1">slot =
