     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-node-remove" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-remove=E2=91=A3">Remove</a> al=
l <var>parent</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=
=91=A2=E2=91=A0">children</a>, in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=
=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">tree order</a>,
 with <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#remove=
-suppressobservers" id=3D"ref-for-remove-suppressobservers=E2=91=A1"><i>sup=
pressObservers</i></a> set to true.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>node</var> is non-null, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-insert" id=3D"ref-for-concep=
t-node-insert=E2=91=A7">insert</a> <var>node</var> into
 <var>parent</var> before null with <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#insert-suppressobservers" id=3D"ref-for-insert-supp=
ressobservers=E2=91=A0"><i>suppressObservers</i></a> set to true.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If either <var>addedNodes</var> or <var>removedNodes</var> <a data=
-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-is-empty" id=
=3D"ref-for-list-is-empty=E2=91=A2">is not empty</a>,
 then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#queue-=
a-tree-mutation-record" id=3D"ref-for-queue-a-tree-mutation-record=E2=91=A4=
">queue a tree mutation record</a> for <var>parent</var> with <var>addedNod=
es</var>,
 <var>removedNodes</var>, null, and null.
</p>
    </li></ol>
    <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">This algorithm does not make any checks=
 with regards to the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">node tree</a> con=
straints. Specification authors need to use it wisely.
</p>
   </div>
   <hr>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"pre-remove">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"concept-node-pre-remove">pre-remove</dfn> a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
node=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A7">node</a> <var>child</var>
from a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conce=
pt-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A8">node</a> <var>parent=
</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>child</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-=
parent=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">parent</a> is not <var>parent</var>, then <a data=
-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw" id=3D=
"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">throw</a> a
 "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" hr=
ef=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#notfounderror" id=3D"ref-for-notfound=
error=E2=91=A1">NotFoundError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-=
type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=
=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A2=E2=93=AA">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-node-remove" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-remove=E2=91=A4">Remove</a> <v=
ar>child</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>child</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"removing steps">
    <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#other=
-applicable-specifications" id=3D"ref-for-other-applicable-specifications=
=E2=91=A4">Specifications</a> may define
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-node-remove-ext">removing steps</dfn> for all or some <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-=
concept-node=E2=91=A7=E2=93=AA">nodes</a>. The
algorithm is passed a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A0">node<=
/a> <var>removedNode</var>, a boolean
<var>isSubtreeRoot</var>, and a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A7=E2=91=
=A1">node</a> <var>oldAncestor</var> as indicated
in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conce=
pt-node-remove" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-remove=E2=91=A5">remove</a> algo=
rithm below.
</p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"remove">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"concept-node-remove">remove</dfn> a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=
=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A2">node</a> <var>node</var>, with an
optional boolean <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"remove" data-df=
n-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"remove-suppressobservers"><var>supp=
ressObservers</var></dfn> (default false):

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>parent</var> be <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent" id=3D"=
ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">parent</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Assert: <var>parent</var> is non-null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Run the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#live-range-pre-remove-steps" id=3D"ref-for-live-range-pre-remove-steps=
=E2=91=A0">live range pre-remove steps</a>, given <var>node</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>For each <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator=E2=91=A0=
">NodeIterator</a></code> object <var>iterator</var> whose
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tra=
versal-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-traversal-root=E2=91=A0">root</a>=E2=80=
=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A8">node document=
</a> is <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-nod=
e-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">node doc=
ument</a>: run the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#nodeiterator-pre-removing-steps" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator-pre-remo=
ving-steps=E2=91=A0"><code>NodeIterator</code> pre-remove steps</a> given
 <var>node</var> and <var>iterator</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>oldPreviousSibling</var> be <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a =
data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-pr=
evious-sibling" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-previous-sibling=E2=91=A3">previ=
ous sibling</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>oldNextSibling</var> be <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data=
-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-next-s=
ibling" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-next-sibling=E2=91=A3">next sibling</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#l=
ist-remove" id=3D"ref-for-list-remove=E2=91=A2">Remove</a> <var>node</var> =
from its <var>parent</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-chi=
ld=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A1">children</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>node</var> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#slotable-assigned" id=3D"ref-for-slotable-assigned=E2=91=
=A3">assigned</a>, then run <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#assign-slotables" id=3D"ref-for-assign-slotables=E2=91=A3">=
assign slottables</a> for
 <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#slotable-assigned-slot" id=3D"ref-for-slotable-assigned-slot=
=E2=91=A3">assigned slot</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>parent</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-r=
oot=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">root</a> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-=
root=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">shadow root</a>, and
 <var>parent</var> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#concept-slot" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">slo=
t</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
slot-assigned-nodes" id=3D"ref-for-slot-assigned-nodes=E2=91=A4">assigned n=
odes</a> is the empty list,
 then run <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#si=
gnal-a-slot-change" id=3D"ref-for-signal-a-slot-change=E2=91=A3">signal a s=
lot change</a> for <var>parent</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>node</var> has an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-inclusive-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-con=
cept-tree-inclusive-descendant=E2=91=A1">inclusive descendant</a> that is a=
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-slo=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-slot=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">slot</a>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>Run <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#assign-slotables-for-a-tree" id=3D"ref-for-assign-slotables-for-a-tree=
=E2=91=A4">assign slottables for a tree</a> with <var>parent</var>=E2=80=99=
s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-root=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">root</a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Run <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#assign-slotables-for-a-tree" id=3D"ref-for-assign-slotables-for-a-tree=
=E2=91=A5">assign slottables for a tree</a> with <var>node</var>.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>Run the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-node-remove-ext" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-remove-ext=E2=91=
=A0">removing steps</a> with <var>node</var>, true, and <var>parent</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>isParentConnected</var> be <var>parent</var>=E2=80=99s <a=
 data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#connected" id=
=3D"ref-for-connected=E2=91=A4">connected</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>node</var> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-custom" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-cu=
stom=E2=91=A1">custom</a> and <var>isParentConnected</var> is true, then
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/=
custom-elements.html#enqueue-a-custom-element-callback-reaction" id=3D"ref-=
for-enqueue-a-custom-element-callback-reaction=E2=91=A1">enqueue a custom e=
lement callback reaction</a> with <var>node</var>, callback name
  "<code>disconnectedCallback</code>", and =C2=AB =C2=BB.

  </p>
      <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">It is intentional for now that <a dat=
a-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-cu=
stom" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-custom=E2=91=A2">custom</a> <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"=
ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">elements</a> do
  not get <var>parent</var> passed. This might change in the future if ther=
e is a need.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>For each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-shadow-including-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-inc=
luding-descendant">shadow-including descendant</a> <var>descendant</var> of=
 <var>node</var>, in
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-sh=
adow-including-tree-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-including-tree-orde=
r=E2=91=A2">shadow-including tree order</a>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>Run the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-node-remove-ext" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-remove-ext=E2=91=
=A1">removing steps</a> with <var>descendant</var>, false, and <var>parent<=
/var>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>descendant</var> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-custom" id=3D"ref-for-concept-el=
ement-custom=E2=91=A3">custom</a> and <var>isParentConnected</var>
   is true, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg=
.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#enqueue-a-custom-element-callback-react=
ion" id=3D"ref-for-enqueue-a-custom-element-callback-reaction=E2=91=A2">enq=
ueue a custom element callback reaction</a> with <var>descendant</var>,
   callback name "<code>disconnectedCallback</code>", and =C2=AB =C2=BB.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>For each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-inclusive=
-ancestor=E2=91=A1">inclusive ancestor</a> <var>inclusiveAncestor</var> of
 <var>parent</var>, and then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infr=
a.spec.whatwg.org/#list-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A5">for each</a> <var>registered</var> of
 <var>inclusiveAncestor</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#registered-observer-list" id=3D"ref-for-registe=
red-observer-list">registered observer list</a>, if <var>registered</var>=
=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#registered-=
observer-options" id=3D"ref-for-registered-observer-options">options</a>["<=
code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#dom-mutationobserverinit-subtree" id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationobserver=
init-subtree">subtree</a></code>"] is true, then
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-appe=
nd" id=3D"ref-for-list-append=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">append</a> a new <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#transient-registered-=
observer" id=3D"ref-for-transient-registered-observer">transient registered=
 observer</a> whose
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#registered-=
observer-observer" id=3D"ref-for-registered-observer-observer">observer</a>=
 is <var>registered</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#registered-=
observer-observer" id=3D"ref-for-registered-observer-observer=E2=91=A0">obs=
erver</a>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#r=
egistered-observer-options" id=3D"ref-for-registered-observer-options=E2=91=
=A0">options</a> is
 <var>registered</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#registered-observer-options" id=3D"ref-for-registered-=
observer-options=E2=91=A1">options</a>, and
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#transient-r=
egistered-observer-source" id=3D"ref-for-transient-registered-observer-sour=
ce">source</a> is <var>registered</var> to <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#registered-=
observer-list" id=3D"ref-for-registered-observer-list=E2=91=A0">registered =
observer list</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>suppressObservers</var> is false, then <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#queue-a-tree-mutation-record"=
 id=3D"ref-for-queue-a-tree-mutation-record=E2=91=A5">queue a tree mutation=
 record</a> for
 <var>parent</var> with =C2=AB =C2=BB, =C2=AB <var>node</var> =C2=BB, <var>=
oldPreviousSibling</var>, and
 <var>oldNextSibling</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Run the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-node-children-changed-ext" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-children=
-changed-ext=E2=91=A0">children changed steps</a> for <var>parent</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <h4 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.2.4" id=3D"interface-nonel=
ementparentnode"><span class=3D"secno">4.2.4. </span><span class=3D"content=
">Mixin <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#nonelementparentnode" id=3D"ref-for-nonelementparentnode">N=
onElementParentNode</a></code></span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-nonelementparentnode"></a></h4>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Web compatibility prevents the <code cla=
ss=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#d=
om-nonelementparentnode-getelementbyid" id=3D"ref-for-dom-nonelementparentn=
ode-getelementbyid">getElementById()</a></code>
method from being exposed on <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A5">elements</a> (and therefore on <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-typ=
e=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#parentnode" id=3D"ref-for-pa=
rentnode">ParentNode</a></code>).

</p>
<pre class=3D"def highlight idl"><c- b=3D"">interface</c-> <c- b=3D"">mixin=
</c-> <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-type=3D"interface" data-=
