 <var>nodes</var> and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec=
.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A8">this</a>=E2=80=99s=
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-nod=
e-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">node doc=
ument</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A5=E2=93=AA">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent" =
id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">parent</a> is <var>par=
ent</var>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-node-replace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-replace">replace</a> <a dat=
a-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref=
-for-this=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A0">this</a> with
  <var>node</var> within <var>parent</var>.

  </p>
      <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A1">Th=
is</a> could have been inserted into <var>node</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Otherwise, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-node-pre-insert" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-pre-insert=E2=
=91=A3">pre-insert</a> <var>node</var> into <var>parent</var> before
 <var>viableNextSibling</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"remove()" data-algorithm-for=
=3D"ChildNode">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"ChildNode" d=
ata-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-childnode-remove"><code>=
remove()</code></dfn> method steps are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A2">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent" =
id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">parent</a> is null, th=
en return.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-node-remove" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-remove=E2=91=A6">Remove</a> <a=
 data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D=
"ref-for-this=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A3">this</a>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <h4 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.2.9" id=3D"mixin-slotable"=
><span class=3D"secno">4.2.9. </span><span class=3D"content">Mixin <code cl=
ass=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
