   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"assignedSlot" data-algorithm-=
for=3D"Slottable">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Slottable" d=
ata-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-slotable-assignedslot=
"><code>assignedSlot</code></dfn>
getter steps are to return the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#find-a-slot" id=3D"ref-for-find-a-slot=E2=91=
=A1">find a slot</a> given <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl=
.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A4">this</a> and =
true.
</p>
   </div>
   <h4 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.2.10" id=3D"old-style-coll=
ections"><span class=3D"secno">4.2.10. </span><span class=3D"content">Old-s=
tyle collections: <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodelist" id=3D"ref-for-nodelist=E2=91=A0">NodeLi=
st</a></code> and <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=
=91=A1">HTMLCollection</a></code></span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#old-style-collections"></a></h4>
   <p>A <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" i=
d=3D"concept-collection">collection</dfn> is an object that represents a li=
st of
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A2">nodes</a>. A <a data-link-t=
ype=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-collection" id=3D"=
ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=A0">collection</a> can be either
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"collection" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn=
" data-export=3D"" data-local-lt=3D"live" data-lt=3D"live collection" id=3D=
"concept-collection-live">live</dfn>
or <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"collection" data-dfn-type=3D"=
dfn" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"static collection" id=3D"concept-collectio=
n-static">static</dfn>.
Unless otherwise stated, a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=
=A1">collection</a> must be <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#concept-collection-live" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection-l=
ive">live</a>.</p>
   <p>If a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=A2">collection</a=
> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-collection-live" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection-live=E2=91=A0">live</a>,=
 then the attributes and methods
on that object must operate on the actual underlying data, not a snapshot o=
f
the data.</p>
   <p>When a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/=
#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=A3">collection<=
/a> is created, a
filter and a root are associated with it.</p>
   <p>The <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=A4">collection</a>=
 then
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"collection" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn=
" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"represented by the collection" id=3D"represen=
ted-by-the-collection">represents</dfn>
a view of the subtree rooted at the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collectio=
n=E2=91=A5">collection=E2=80=99s</a> root, containing only nodes that match=
 the
given filter. The view is linear. In the absence of specific requirements t=
o the contrary, the nodes
within the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=A6">collection</a=
> must be sorted in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-tree-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A4">tree order</a>.</p>
   <h5 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.2.10.1" id=3D"interface-no=
delist"><span class=3D"secno">4.2.10.1. </span><span class=3D"content">Inte=
rface <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#nodelist" id=3D"ref-for-nodelist=E2=91=A1">NodeList</a></code=
></span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interfa=
ce-nodelist"></a></h5>
   <p>A <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#nodelist" id=3D"ref-for-nodelist=E2=91=A2">NodeList</a></co=
de> object is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=A7">collecti=
on</a> of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A3">nodes</a>.

</p>
<pre class=3D"def highlight idl">[<a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"e=
xtended-attribute" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#Exposed" id=3D"r=
ef-for-Exposed=E2=91=A0"><c- g=3D"">Exposed</c-></a>=3D<c- n=3D"">Window</c=
->]
<c- b=3D"">interface</c-> <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-type=
=3D"interface" data-export=3D"" id=3D"nodelist"><code><c- g=3D"">NodeList</=
c-></code></dfn> {
  <c- b=3D"">getter</c-> <a data-link-type=3D"idl-name" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#node" id=3D"ref-for-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0"><c- n=3D"">No=
de</c-></a>? <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"method" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-nodelist-item" id=3D"ref-for-dom-nodelist-item">=
<c- g=3D"">item</c-></a>(<a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"interface"=
 href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-unsigned-long" id=3D"ref-for-i=
dl-unsigned-long=E2=91=A0"><c- b=3D"">unsigned</c-> <c- b=3D"">long</c-></a=
> <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"NodeList/item(index)"=
 data-dfn-type=3D"argument" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-nodelist-item-index-=
index"><code><c- g=3D"">index</c-></code></dfn>);
  <c- b=3D"">readonly</c-> <c- b=3D"">attribute</c-> <a class=3D"idl-code" =
data-link-type=3D"interface" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-un=
signed-long" id=3D"ref-for-idl-unsigned-long=E2=91=A1"><c- b=3D"">unsigned<=
/c-> <c- b=3D"">long</c-></a> <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"attri=
bute" data-readonly=3D"" data-type=3D"unsigned long" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#dom-nodelist-length" id=3D"ref-for-dom-nodelist-length"><c- =
g=3D"">length</c-></a>;
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-ite=
rable" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-iterable"><c- b=3D"">iterable</c-></a>&lt;<a data-=
link-type=3D"idl-name" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#node" id=3D"ref=
-for-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1"><c- n=3D"">Node</c-></a>&gt;;
};
</pre>
   <dl class=3D"domintro">
    <dt><var>collection</var> . <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"id=
l" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-nodelist-length" id=3D"ref-for-=
dom-nodelist-length=E2=91=A0">length</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dd>Returns the number of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A8=E2=
=91=A4">nodes</a> in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=A8"=
>collection</a>.

=20
    </dd><dt><var>element</var> =3D <var>collection</var> . <code class=3D"=
idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-nod=
elist-item" id=3D"ref-for-dom-nodelist-item=E2=91=A0">item(index)</a></code=
>
=20
    </dt><dt><var>element</var> =3D <var>collection</var>[<var>index</var>]
=20
    </dt><dd>Returns the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A5">no=
de</a> with index <var>index</var> from the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
collection=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">collection</a>. The
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-nod=
e" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A6">nodes</a> are sorted in <a=
 data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-o=
rder" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">tree order</a>.

   </dd></dl>
   <p>The object=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl=
.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-supported-property-indices" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-support=
ed-property-indices">supported property indices</a> are the numbers in the =
range zero to one less than
the number of nodes <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#represented-by-the-collection" id=3D"ref-for-represented-by-the-col=
lection">represented by the collection</a>. If there are no such
elements, then there are no <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webid=
l.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-supported-property-indices" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-suppor=
ted-property-indices=E2=91=A0">supported property indices</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"NodeList" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-nodelist-length"><code>=
length</code></dfn> attribute must return the number of nodes
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#represented-=
by-the-collection" id=3D"ref-for-represented-by-the-collection=E2=91=A0">re=
presented by the collection</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"NodeList" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-nodelist-item"><code>item(=
<var>index</var>)</code></dfn> method must return the
<var>index</var><sup>th</sup> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A8=E2=91=
=A7">node</a> in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A0">collection</a>. If there is no
<var>index</var><sup>th</sup> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A8=E2=91=
=A8">node</a> in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A1">collection</a>, then the method must
return null.


</p>
   <h5 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.2.10.2" id=3D"interface-ht=
mlcollection"><span class=3D"secno">4.2.10.2. </span><span class=3D"content=
