d-long" id=3D"ref-for-idl-unsigned-long=E2=91=A3"><c- b=3D"">unsigned</c-> =
<c- b=3D"">long</c-></a> <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=
=3D"HTMLCollection/item(index)" data-dfn-type=3D"argument" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"dom-htmlcollection-item-index-index"><code><c- g=3D"">index</c-></co=
de></dfn>);
  <c- b=3D"">getter</c-> <a data-link-type=3D"idl-name" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A7"><c- n=
=3D"">Element</c-></a>? <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D=
"HTMLCollection" data-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"named=
Item(name)" id=3D"dom-htmlcollection-nameditem"><code><c- g=3D"">namedItem<=
/c-></code></dfn>(<a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"interface" href=
=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMString" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMStr=
ing=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5"><c- b=3D"">DOMString</c-></a> <dfn class=3D"dfn-pane=
led idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"HTMLCollection/namedItem(name)" data-dfn-type=
