"><code><c- g=3D"">name</c-></code></dfn>);
};
</pre>
   <p>An <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A3">HTM=
LCollection</a></code> object is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=
=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">collection</a> of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=
=91=A2=E2=91=A2">elements</a>.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-ht=
mlcollection=E2=91=A4">HTMLCollection</a></code> is a historical artifact w=
e cannot rid the web of.
While developers are of course welcome to keep using it, new API standard d=
esigners ought not to use
it (use <code>sequence&lt;T&gt;</code> in IDL instead).

</p>
   <dl class=3D"domintro">
    <dt><var>collection</var> . <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"id=
l" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-htmlcollection-length" id=3D"re=
f-for-dom-htmlcollection-length=E2=91=A0">length</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
  Returns the number of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A2=E2=91=
=A3">elements</a> in
  the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">collectio=
n</a>.

=20
    </dd><dt><var>element</var> =3D <var>collection</var> . <code class=3D"=
idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-htm=
lcollection-item" id=3D"ref-for-dom-htmlcollection-item=E2=91=A0">item(inde=
x)</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dt><var>element</var> =3D <var>collection</var>[<var>index</var>]
=20
    </dt><dd>
  Returns the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A4">element=
</a> with index
  <var>index</var> from the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A4">collection</a>.
  The <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A5">elements</a> ar=
e sorted in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-tree-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">tre=
e order</a>.

=20
    </dd><dt><var>element</var> =3D <var>collection</var> . <code class=3D"=
idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-htm=
lcollection-nameditem" id=3D"ref-for-dom-htmlcollection-nameditem">namedIte=
m(name)</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dt><var>element</var> =3D <var>collection</var>[<var>name</var>]
=20
    </dt><dd>
  Returns the first <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A6">e=
lement</a> with <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#concept-id" id=3D"ref-for-concept-id=E2=91=A1">ID</a> or name <var>name=
</var>
  from the collection.

   </dd></dl>
   <p>The object=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl=
.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-supported-property-indices" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-support=
ed-property-indices=E2=91=A1">supported property indices</a> are the number=
s in the range zero to one less than
the number of elements <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#represented-by-the-collection" id=3D"ref-for-represented-by-the-=
collection=E2=91=A1">represented by the collection</a>. If there are no suc=
h
elements, then there are no <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webid=
l.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-supported-property-indices" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-suppor=
ted-property-indices=E2=91=A2">supported property indices</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"HTMLCollectio=
n" data-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-htmlcollection-le=
ngth"><code>length</code></dfn> getter steps are to return the
number of nodes <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#represented-by-the-collection" id=3D"ref-for-represented-by-the-collect=
ion=E2=91=A2">represented by the collection</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"HTMLCollectio=
n" data-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-htmlcollection-item"=
><code>item(<var>index</var>)</code></dfn> method steps are to
return the <var>index</var><sup>th</sup> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=
=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A7">element</a> in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collec=
tion=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">collection</a>. If there
is no <var>index</var><sup>th</sup> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=
=91=A2=E2=91=A8">element</a> in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collectio=
n=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">collection</a>, then the method
must return null.

</p>
   <p>The <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/=
#dfn-supported-property-names" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-supported-property-names">=
supported property names</a> are the values from the list returned by these=
 steps:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>Let <var>result</var> be an empty list.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>For each <var>element</var> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#represented-by-the-collection" id=3D"ref-for-repres=
ented-by-the-collection=E2=91=A3">represented by the collection</a>, in
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">tree order</a=
>:

  </p>
     <ol>
      <li>
       <p>If <var>element</var> has an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-id" id=3D"ref-for-concept-id=E2=91=A2">I=
D</a> which is not in <var>result</var>,
   append <var>element</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-id" id=3D"ref-for-concept-id=E2=91=A3">I=
D</a> to <var>result</var>.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>If <var>element</var> is in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespac=
e">HTML namespace</a> and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#concept-element-attribute-has" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-=
attribute-has">has</a>
   a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-named-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-named-attribute"><code>name</code> =
attribute</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-attribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-value">val=
ue</a> is neither
   the empty string nor is in <var>result</var>, append <var>element</var>=
=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-n=
amed-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-named-attribute=E2=91=A0"><code>name<=
/code> attribute</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-attribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-value=E2=
=91=A0">value</a> to
   <var>result</var>.
  </p>
     </li></ol>
    </li><li>
     <p>Return <var>result</var>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"HTMLCollectio=
n" data-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-htmlcollection-named=
item-key"><code>namedItem(<var>key</var>)</code></dfn> method steps are:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>If <var>key</var> is the empty string, return null.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Return the first <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A3=E2=93=
=AA">element</a> in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#concept-collection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A7">collection</a> for which at least one of
  the following is true:

  </p>
     <ul>
      <li>it has an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-id" id=3D"ref-for-concept-id=E2=91=A4">ID</a> which is <var=
>key</var>;

  =20
      </li><li>it is in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra=
.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A0">HT=
ML namespace</a> and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-element-attribute-has" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attri=
bute-has=E2=91=A0">has</a> a
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-n=
amed-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-named-attribute=E2=91=A1"><code>name<=
/code> attribute</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-val=
ue=E2=91=A1">value</a> is
   <var>key</var>;
 =20
     </li></ul>
     <p>or null if there is no such <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=
=91=A3=E2=91=A0">element</a>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.3" id=3D"mutation-observer=
s"><span class=3D"secno">4.3. </span><span class=3D"content">Mutation obser=
vers</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#muta=
tion-observers"></a></h3>
   <p>Each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/m=
ultipage/webappapis.html#similar-origin-window-agent" id=3D"ref-for-similar=
-origin-window-agent=E2=91=A0">similar-origin window agent</a> has a
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"m=
utation-observer-compound-microtask-queued-flag">mutation observer microtas=
k queued</dfn>
(a boolean), which is initially false. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</=
a>

</p>
   <p>Each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/m=
ultipage/webappapis.html#similar-origin-window-agent" id=3D"ref-for-similar=
-origin-window-agent=E2=91=A1">similar-origin window agent</a> also has
