-ordered-set=E2=91=A5">set</a> of zero or more
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#mutationobserver" id=3D"ref-for-mutationobserver">MutationObserver<=
/a></code> objects), which is initially empty.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"queue a mutation observer mic=
rotask">
    <p>To
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"q=
ueue-a-mutation-observer-compound-microtask">queue a mutation observer micr=
otask</dfn>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://tc39.es/ecma262/#=
surrounding-agent" id=3D"ref-for-surrounding-agent">surrounding agent</a>=
=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#m=
utation-observer-compound-microtask-queued-flag" id=3D"ref-for-mutation-obs=
erver-compound-microtask-queued-flag">mutation observer microtask queued</a=
> is true, then
