 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://tc39.es/ecma262/=
#surrounding-agent" id=3D"ref-for-surrounding-agent=E2=91=A0">surrounding a=
gent</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#mutation-observer-compound-microtask-queued-flag" id=3D"ref-for-muta=
tion-observer-compound-microtask-queued-flag=E2=91=A0">mutation observer mi=
crotask queued</a> to true.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/mul=
tipage/webappapis.html#queue-a-microtask" id=3D"ref-for-queue-a-microtask">=
Queue</a> a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/=
