ist-empty" id=3D"ref-for-list-empty=E2=91=A0">Empty</a> the <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://tc39.es/ecma262/#surrounding-agent" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-surrounding-agent=E2=91=A3">surrounding agent</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-=
