      <p>Let <var>signalSet</var> be a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-clone" id=3D"ref-for-list-clone=E2=91=A1"=
>clone</a> of the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://tc39.es/ecma262=
/#surrounding-agent" id=3D"ref-for-surrounding-agent=E2=91=A4">surrounding =
agent</a>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#signal-slot=
-list" id=3D"ref-for-signal-slot-list=E2=91=A0">signal slots</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#l=
ist-empty" id=3D"ref-for-list-empty=E2=91=A1">Empty</a> the <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://tc39.es/ecma262/#surrounding-agent" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-surrounding-agent=E2=91=A5">surrounding agent</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-=
type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#signal-slot-list" id=3D"r=
ef-for-signal-slot-list=E2=91=A1">signal slots</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#l=
ist-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">For each</a> <va=
r>mo</var> of <var>notifySet</var>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>Let <var>records</var> be a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-clone" id=3D"ref-for-list-clone=E2=91=A2"=
>clone</a> of <var>mo</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-m=
o-queue" id=3D"ref-for-concept-mo-queue">record queue</a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/=
#list-empty" id=3D"ref-for-list-empty=E2=91=A2">Empty</a> <var>mo</var>=E2=
=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-mo-queue" id=3D"ref-for-concept-mo-queue=E2=91=A0">record queue</a>.

