ec.whatwg.org/#dictdef-mutationobserverinit" id=3D"ref-for-dictdef-mutation=
observerinit">MutationObserverInit</a></code> dictionary).

</p>
   <p>A <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D""=
 id=3D"transient-registered-observer">transient registered observer</dfn> i=
