   <p>A <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#mutationobserver" id=3D"ref-for-mutationobserver=E2=91=A3">=
MutationObserver</a></code> object can be used to observe mutations to the =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">tree</a> of
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A3">nodes</a>.

</p>
   <p>Each <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#mutationobserver" id=3D"ref-for-mutationobserver=E2=91=
=A4">MutationObserver</a></code> object has these associated concepts:

</p>
   <ul class=3D"brief">
    <li>A <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"MutationObserver" data=
-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"concept-mo-callback">callback</d=
fn> set on creation.
=20
    </li><li>A <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"MutationObserver"=
 data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"mutationobserver-node-list"=
>node list</dfn> (a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#list" id=3D"ref-for-list=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">list</a> of weak refe=
rences to
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-nod=
e" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A4">nodes</a>), which=
 is initially empty.
=20
    </li><li>A <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"MutationObserver"=
 data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"concept-mo-queue">record qu=
eue</dfn> (a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#queue" id=3D"ref-for-queue">queue</a> of
 zero or more <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#mutationrecord" id=3D"ref-for-mutationrecord=E2=91=A1=
">MutationRecord</a></code> objects), which is initially empty.

   </li></ul>
   <dl class=3D"domintro">
    <dt><code><var>observer</var> =3D new <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-=
type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-mutationobserver-muta=
tionobserver" id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationobserver-mutationobserver=E2=91=A0"=
>MutationObserver(callback)</a></code></code>
=20
    </dt><dd>Constructs a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#mutationobserver" id=3D"ref-for-mutationo=
bserver=E2=91=A5">MutationObserver</a></code> object and sets its <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-mo-callback" =
