 <var>callback</var>. The <var>callback</var> is invoked with a list of <co=
de class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#mutationrecord" id=3D"ref-for-mutationrecord=E2=91=A2">MutationRecord<=
/a></code> objects
 as first argument and the constructed <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-typ=
e=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#mutationobserver" id=3D"ref-=
