   <h4 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.3.2" id=3D"queueing-a-muta=
tion-record"><span class=3D"secno">4.3.2. </span><span class=3D"content">Qu=
euing a mutation record</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#queueing-a-mutation-record"></a></h4>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"queue a mutation record">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D=
"" id=3D"queue-a-mutation-record">queue a mutation record</dfn> of <var>typ=
e</var> for <var>target</var> with
<var>name</var>, <var>namespace</var>, <var>oldValue</var>, <var>addedNodes=
</var>,
<var>removedNodes</var>, <var>previousSibling</var>, and <var>nextSibling</=
var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>interestedObservers</var> be an empty <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ordered-map" id=3D"ref-for-=
ordered-map">map</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>nodes</var> be the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for-con=
cept-tree-inclusive-ancestor=E2=91=A2">inclusive ancestors</a> of <var>targ=
et</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>For each <var>node</var> of <var>nodes</var>, and then <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-iterate" id=3D"r=
ef-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2">for each</a>
  <var>registered</var> of <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"d=
fn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#registered-observer-list" id=3D"re=
f-for-registered-observer-list=E2=91=A6">registered observer list</a>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>Let <var>options</var> be <var>registered</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#registere=
d-observer-options" id=3D"ref-for-registered-observer-options=E2=91=A4">opt=
ions</a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If none of the following are true

    </p>
        <ul class=3D"brief">
         <li><var>node</var> is not <var>target</var> and
     <var>options</var>["<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-mutationobserverinit-subtree" id=3D"re=
f-for-dom-mutationobserverinit-subtree=E2=91=A2">subtree</a></code>"] is fa=
lse

    =20
         </li><li><var>type</var> is "<code>attributes</code>" and
     <var>options</var>["<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-mutationobserverinit-attributes" id=3D=
"ref-for-dom-mutationobserverinit-attributes=E2=91=A7">attributes</a></code=
>"] either does not <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#map-exists" id=3D"ref-for-map-exists=E2=91=A7">exist</a>
     or is false

    =20
         </li><li><var>type</var> is "<code>attributes</code>",
     <var>options</var>["<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-mutationobserverinit-attributefilter" =
id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationobserverinit-attributefilter=E2=91=A3">attributeF=
ilter</a></code>"] <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.wha=
twg.org/#map-exists" id=3D"ref-for-map-exists=E2=91=A8">exists</a>, and
     <var>options</var>["<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-mutationobserverinit-attributefilter" =
id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationobserverinit-attributefilter=E2=91=A4">attributeF=
ilter</a></code>"] does not <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra=
.spec.whatwg.org/#list-contain" id=3D"ref-for-list-contain=E2=91=A7">contai=
n</a>
     <var>name</var> or <var>namespace</var> is non-null

    =20
         </li><li><var>type</var> is "<code>characterData</code>" and
     <var>options</var>["<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-mutationobserverinit-characterdata" id=
=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationobserverinit-characterdata=E2=91=A5">characterData<=
/a></code>"] either does not
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-e=
xists" id=3D"ref-for-map-exists=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">exist</a> or is false

    =20
         </li><li><var>type</var> is "<code>childList</code>" and
     <var>options</var>["<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-mutationobserverinit-childlist" id=3D"=
ref-for-dom-mutationobserverinit-childlist=E2=91=A1">childList</a></code>"]=
 is false
   =20
        </li></ul>
        <p>then:

    </p>
        <ol>
         <li>
          <p>Let <var>mo</var> be <var>registered</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#registered-observer-o=
bserver" id=3D"ref-for-registered-observer-observer=E2=91=A5">observer</a>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p>If <var>interestedObservers</var>[<var>mo</var>] does not <a d=
ata-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-exists" id=
=3D"ref-for-map-exists=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">exist</a>, then
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-s=
et" id=3D"ref-for-map-set">set</a> <var>interestedObservers</var>[<var>mo</=
var>] to null.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p>If either <var>type</var> is "<code>attributes</code>" and
     <var>options</var>["<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-mutationobserverinit-attributeoldvalue=
" id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationobserverinit-attributeoldvalue=E2=91=A3">attrib=
uteOldValue</a></code>"] is true, or <var>type</var> is
     "<code>characterData</code>" and
     <var>options</var>["<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-mutationobserverinit-characterdataoldv=
alue" id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationobserverinit-characterdataoldvalue=E2=91=A3=
">characterDataOldValue</a></code>"] is true, then
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-s=
et" id=3D"ref-for-map-set=E2=91=A0">set</a> <var>interestedObservers</var>[=
<var>mo</var>] to <var>oldValue</var>.
    </p>
        </li></ol>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#m=
ap-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-map-iterate=E2=91=A0">For each</a> <var>observer<=
/var> =E2=86=92 <var>mappedOldValue</var> of
  <var>interestedObservers</var>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>Let <var>record</var> be a new <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-=
type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#mutationrecord" id=3D"ref=
-for-mutationrecord=E2=91=A3">MutationRecord</a></code> object with its <co=
de class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#dom-mutationrecord-type" id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationrecord-type">type</=
a></code>
   set to <var>type</var>, <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-mutationrecord-target" id=3D"ref-for=
-dom-mutationrecord-target">target</a></code> set to <var>target</var>,
   <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#dom-mutationrecord-attributename" id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationreco=
rd-attributename">attributeName</a></code> set to <var>name</var>, <code cl=
ass=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
dom-mutationrecord-attributenamespace" id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationrecord-att=
ributenamespace">attributeNamespace</a></code>
   set to <var>namespace</var>, <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"id=
l" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-mutationrecord-oldvalue" id=3D"=
ref-for-dom-mutationrecord-oldvalue">oldValue</a></code> set to <var>mapped=
OldValue</var>,
   <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#dom-mutationrecord-addednodes" id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationrecord-=
addednodes">addedNodes</a></code> set to <var>addedNodes</var>,
   <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#dom-mutationrecord-removednodes" id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationrecor=
d-removednodes">removedNodes</a></code> set to <var>removedNodes</var>,
   <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#dom-mutationrecord-previoussibling" id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationre=
cord-previoussibling">previousSibling</a></code> set to <var>previousSiblin=
g</var>, and
   <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#dom-mutationrecord-nextsibling" id=3D"ref-for-dom-mutationrecord=
-nextsibling">nextSibling</a></code> set to <var>nextSibling</var>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/=
#queue-enqueue" id=3D"ref-for-queue-enqueue">Enqueue</a> <var>record</var> =
to <var>observer</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-m=
o-queue" id=3D"ref-for-concept-mo-queue=E2=91=A5">record queue</a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/=
#set-append" id=3D"ref-for-set-append=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">Append</a> <var>ob=
server</var> to the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://tc39.es/ecma2=
62/#surrounding-agent" id=3D"ref-for-surrounding-agent=E2=91=A6">surroundin=
g agent</a>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#mutation-=
observer-list" id=3D"ref-for-mutation-observer-list=E2=91=A1">pending mutat=
ion observers</a>.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#que=
ue-a-mutation-observer-compound-microtask" id=3D"ref-for-queue-a-mutation-o=
bserver-compound-microtask=E2=91=A0">Queue a mutation observer microtask</a=
>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"queue a tree mutation record"=
>
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D=
"" id=3D"queue-a-tree-mutation-record">queue a tree mutation record</dfn> f=
or <var>target</var> with <var>addedNodes</var>,
<var>removedNodes</var>, <var>previousSibling</var>, and <var>nextSibling</=
