   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#node" id=3D"ref-for-node=E2=91=
=A2=E2=91=A8">Node</a></code> is an abstract interface that is used by all =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">nodes</a>. You can=
not
get a direct instance of it.

</p>
   <p>Each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">node</a=
> has an associated
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Node" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data=
-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-node-document">node document</dfn>, set upon cre=
ation, that is a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
ment" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">document</a>.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">node</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-nod=
e-document=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">node document</a> can be changed by the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-adopt" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-adopt=E2=91=A1">adopt</a> algorithm.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">node</a>=
=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#g=
et-the-parent" id=3D"ref-for-get-the-parent=E2=91=A4">get the parent</a> al=
gorithm, given an <var>event</var>, returns the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">node</a>=E2=80=99s=
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slotable-as=
signed-slot" id=3D"ref-for-slotable-assigned-slot=E2=91=A4">assigned slot</=
a>, if <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conce=
pt-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">node</a> is=
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#slotable-as=
signed" id=3D"ref-for-slotable-assigned=E2=91=A4">assigned</a>; otherwise
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">node</a>=E2=80=99s=
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tre=
e-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">parent</a>.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2">node</a> also has a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#registered-observer-list" id=3D"ref-for-re=
gistered-observer-list=E2=91=A7">registered observer list</a>.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"create a node">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"create-a-node">create a node</dfn> that implements an interface <var=
>interface</var>, given a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
ment" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">document</a> <var>d=
ocument</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#a=
ssert" id=3D"ref-for-assert=E2=91=A5">Assert</a>: <var>interface</var> is n=
either <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#document" id=3D"ref-for-document=E2=91=A7">Document</a></cod=
e> nor an interface that
 inherits from <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document" id=3D"ref-for-document=E2=91=A8">Document<=
/a></code>. <span class=3D"note">To create a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-do=
cument=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">document</a>, use
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-do=
cument" id=3D"ref-for-create-a-document">create a document</a> instead.</sp=
an>

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return a new <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1=E2=91=
=A3">node</a> that <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#implements" id=3D"ref-for-implements=E2=91=A2">implements</a> <va=
r>interface</var>, in
 <var>document</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://ht=
ml.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-realm" id=3D"=
ref-for-concept-relevant-realm=E2=91=A0">relevant realm</a>, with its <a da=
ta-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-docu=
ment" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">node document<=
/a> set to
 <var>document</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
