   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"normalize()" data-algorithm-f=
or=3D"Node">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Node" data-d=
fn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-node-normalize"><code>normali=
ze()</code></dfn> method steps are to run these steps for
each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-tree-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">=
descendant</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#exclusive-text-node" id=3D"ref-for-exclusive-text-node=E2=91=A4">exclusi=
ve <code>Text</code> node</a> <var>node</var> of
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A0">this</a>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>length</var> be <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-length" id=3D"=
ref-for-concept-node-length=E2=91=A2">length</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
