     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>data</var> be the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-concatenate" id=3D"ref-for-string-concaten=
ate=E2=91=A0">concatenation</a> of the
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-cd-=
data" id=3D"ref-for-concept-cd-data=E2=91=A6">data</a> of <var>node</var>=
=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#contiguous-=
exclusive-text-nodes" id=3D"ref-for-contiguous-exclusive-text-nodes=E2=91=
=A0">contiguous exclusive <code>Text</code> nodes</a> (excluding itself), i=
n <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">tree order</a=
>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-cd-replace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-cd-replace=E2=91=A2">Replace data</a=
> of <var>node</var> with <var>length</var>, 0, and <var>data</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>currentNode</var> be <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-next-sibl=
ing" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-next-sibling=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">next siblin=
g</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
