rt offset</a> is <var>currentNode</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-t=
ree-index" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-index=E2=91=A5">index</a>: set its <a=
 data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-=
start-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-node=E2=91=A4">start node</a>=
 to <var>node</var> and its
