ange-start-offset" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-offset=E2=91=A5">start=
 offset</a> to <var>length</var>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>For each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A6">live=
 range</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
