>end node</a> is <var>currentNode</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-t=
ree-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">parent</a>=
