-range-end-offset" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-offset=E2=91=A4">end off=
set</a> is <var>currentNode</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-t=
