   <dl class=3D"domintro">
    <dt><code><var>node</var> . <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"met=
hod" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-node-clonenode" id=3D"ref-for=
-dom-node-clonenode=E2=91=A0">cloneNode</a>([<var>subtree</var> =3D false])=
</code>
=20
    </dt><dd>Returns a copy of <var>node</var>. If
 <var>subtree</var> is true, the copy also includes the
 <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descenda=
nt=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">descendants</a>.

=20
    </dd><dt><code><var>node</var> . <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=
=3D"method" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-node-isequalnode" id=
=3D"ref-for-dom-node-isequalnode=E2=91=A0">isEqualNode</a>(<var>otherNode</=
var>)</code>
