iedName</var></dfn>
for a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A8">node</a> <va=
r>root</var> is the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=
=91=A5">HTMLCollection</a></code> returned by the following
algorithm:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>If <var>qualifiedName</var> is U+002A (*), then return an <code cla=
ss=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#h=
tmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A6">HTMLCollection</a></c=
ode> rooted at
 <var>root</var>, whose filter matches only <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-con=
cept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">descendant</a> <a data-link-type=3D=
"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-element=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A6">elements</a>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Otherwise, if <var>root</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" h=
ref=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-co=
ncept-node-document=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A7">node document</a> is an <a data-link=
-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#html-document" id=3D"ref=
-for-html-document">HTML document</a>,
  return an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A7">=
HTMLCollection</a></code> rooted at <var>root</var>, whose filter matches t=
he following
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">des=
cendant</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A7">elements<=
/a>:

  </p>
     <ul>
      <li>
       <p>Whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#concept-element-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace=E2=
=91=A4">namespace</a> is the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infr=
a.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A1">H=
TML namespace</a> and whose
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-e=
lement-qualified-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-qualified-name">qualif=
ied name</a> is <var>qualifiedName</var>, in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-lowercase" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-low=
ercase">ASCII lowercase</a>.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>Whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#concept-element-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace=E2=
=91=A5">namespace</a> is <em>not</em> the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespac=
e=E2=91=A2">HTML namespace</a> and whose
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-e=
lement-qualified-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-qualified-name=E2=91=
=A0">qualified name</a> is <var>qualifiedName</var>.
  </p>
     </li></ul>
    </li><li>
     <p>Otherwise, return an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcoll=
ection=E2=91=A8">HTMLCollection</a></code> rooted at <var>root</var>, whose=
 filter matches
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tre=
e-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">desc=
endant</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A8">elements</=
a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-element-qualified-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-qualified-name=
=E2=91=A1">qualified name</a> is
 <var>qualifiedName</var>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p>When invoked with the same argument, and as long as <var>root</var>=
=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A8">node docu=
ment</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-document-type" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-type=E2=91=A0"=
>type</a> has not changed, the same
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">HTM=
LCollection</a></code> object may be returned as returned by an earlier cal=
l.

</p>
   <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-getelementsbytagnamens">list of elements with namespace <var>namespace=
</var> and local name <var>localName</var></dfn>
for a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3=E2=93=AA">node</a> <va=
r>root</var> is the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A0">HTMLCollection</a></code> returned by the following
algorithm:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>If <var>namespace</var> is the empty string, then set it to null.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>If both <var>namespace</var> and <var>localName</var> are U+002A (*=
), then return an
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">HT=
MLCollection</a></code> rooted at <var>root</var>, whose filter matches <a =
data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-de=
scendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">descenda=
nt</a>
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ele=
ment" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A4=E2=93=AA">elements</a>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>If <var>namespace</var> is U+002A (*), then return an <code class=
=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htm=
lcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">HTMLCollection=
</a></code> rooted at
 <var>root</var>, whose filter matches <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-t=
ree-descendant=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">descendant</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept=
-element=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A0">elements</a> whose
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ele=
ment-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-local-name=E2=91=A2">local n=
ame</a> is <var>localName</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>If <var>localName</var> is U+002A (*), then return an <code class=
=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htm=
lcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">HTMLCollection=
</a></code> rooted at
 <var>root</var>, whose filter matches <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-t=
ree-descendant=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">descendant</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept=
-element=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A1">elements</a> whose
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ele=
ment-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace=E2=91=A6">namespace=
</a> is <var>namespace</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Return an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A4">HTMLCollection</a></code> rooted at <var>root</var>, whose=
 filter matches
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tre=
e-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">desc=
endant</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A2">elements</=
a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-element-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace=E2=91=A7">n=
amespace</a> is
 <var>namespace</var> and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#concept-element-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-loc=
al-name=E2=91=A3">local name</a> is <var>localName</var>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p>When invoked with the same arguments, the same <code class=3D"idl"><a=
 data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection=
" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">HTMLCollection</a></code>=
 object may be returned as
returned by an earlier call.

</p>
   <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-getelementsbyclassname">list of elements with class names <var>classNa=
mes</var></dfn>
for a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A0">node</a> <va=
r>root</var> is the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A6">HTMLCollection</a></code> returned by the following
algorithm:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
  Let <var>classes</var> be the result of running the
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-or=
dered-set-parser" id=3D"ref-for-concept-ordered-set-parser">ordered set par=
ser</a> on
  <var>classNames</var>.

=20
    </li><li>
  If <var>classes</var> is the empty set, return an empty
  <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">H=
TMLCollection</a></code>.

=20
    </li><li>
     <p>Return an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A8">HTMLCollection</a></code> rooted at <var>root</var>, whose=
 filter matches
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">des=
cendant</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A3">elements<=
/a> that have all their <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#concept-class" id=3D"ref-for-concept-class">classes</a> in
  <var>classes</var>.

  </p>
     <p>The comparisons for the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-class" id=3D"ref-for-concept-class=E2=91=A0">cl=
asses</a> must be done in an
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-ca=
se-insensitive" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-case-insensitive">ASCII case-insensitiv=
e</a> manner if <var>root</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
node-document=E2=91=A2=E2=93=AA">node document</a>=E2=80=99s
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-do=
cument-mode" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-mode=E2=91=A0">mode</a> is "<co=
de>quirks</code>"; otherwise in an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-is" id=3D"ref-for-string-is">identical to</=
a>
  manner.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p>When invoked with the same argument, the same <code class=3D"idl"><a =
data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection"=
 id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">HTMLCollection</a></code> =
object may be returned as
returned by an earlier call.


</p>
