   <p><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#document" id=3D"ref-for-document=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">Document<=
/a></code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A1">nodes</=
a> are simply
known as <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" =
data-lt=3D"document" id=3D"concept-document">documents</dfn>.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">document</a=
>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A2=E2=91=
=A0">node document</a> is itself.

</p>
   <p>Each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A6">document=
</a> has an associated
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" =
data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-document-encoding">encoding</dfn> (an <a dat=
a-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#encoding" id=
=3D"ref-for-encoding">encoding</a>),
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" =
data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-document-content-type">content type</dfn> (a=
 string),
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" =
data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-document-url">URL</dfn> (a <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url" id=3D"ref-for-co=
ncept-url">URL</a>),
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" =
data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-document-origin">origin</dfn> (an <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.htm=
l#concept-origin" id=3D"ref-for-concept-origin">origin</a>),
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" =
data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-document-type">type</dfn> ("<code>xml</code>=
" or "<code>html</code>"),
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" =
data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-document-mode">mode</dfn> ("<code>no-quirks<=
/code>", "<code>quirks</code>", or "<code>limited-quirks</code>"),
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" =
data-export=3D"" id=3D"document-allow-declarative-shadow-roots">allow decla=
rative shadow roots</dfn> (a boolean), and
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" =
data-export=3D"" id=3D"document-custom-element-registry">custom element reg=
istry</dfn> (null or a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#customeleme=
ntregistry" id=3D"ref-for-customelementregistry=E2=91=A5">CustomElementRegi=
stry</a></code> object).
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-en=
coding" title=3D"Encoding Standard">[ENCODING]</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-ur=
l" title=3D"URL Standard">[URL]</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-ht=
ml" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</a>

</p>
   <p>Unless stated otherwise, a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=
=A1=E2=91=A7">document</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-encoding" id=3D"ref-for-concept-d=
ocument-encoding=E2=91=A0">encoding</a> is the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#utf-8" =
id=3D"ref-for-utf-8">utf-8</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://en=
coding.spec.whatwg.org/#encoding" id=3D"ref-for-encoding=E2=91=A0">encoding=
</a>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-document-content-type" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-content-type=E2=91=
=A0">content type</a> is
"<code>application/xml</code>", <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-url" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-ur=
l=E2=91=A0">URL</a> is "<code>about:blank</code>",
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
ment-origin" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-origin=E2=91=A0">origin</a> is =
an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage=
/browsers.html#concept-origin-opaque" id=3D"ref-for-concept-origin-opaque">=
opaque origin</a>,
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
ment-type" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-type=E2=91=A1">type</a> is "<code=
>xml</code>", <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#concept-document-mode" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-mode=E2=91=A1">mode=
</a> is
"<code>no-quirks</code>", <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#document-allow-declarative-shadow-roots" id=3D"ref-for-docume=
nt-allow-declarative-shadow-roots=E2=91=A0">allow declarative shadow roots<=
/a> is false, and
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document-cus=
tom-element-registry" id=3D"ref-for-document-custom-element-registry=E2=91=
=A5">custom element registry</a> is null.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A8">document</a=
> is said to be an <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-ex=
port=3D"" id=3D"xml-document">XML document</dfn> if its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
ment-type" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-type=E2=91=A2">type</a> is "<code=
>xml</code>"; otherwise an <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn"=
 data-export=3D"" id=3D"html-document">HTML document</dfn>.
Whether a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A2=E2=93=AA">document<=
/a> is an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#ht=
ml-document" id=3D"ref-for-html-document=E2=91=A0">HTML document</a> or an =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#xml-document=
" id=3D"ref-for-xml-document">XML document</a> affects the
behavior of certain APIs.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A0">document</a=
> is said to be in
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-document-no-quirks">no-quirks mode</dfn> if its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
ment-mode" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-mode=E2=91=A2">mode</a> is "<code=
>no-quirks</code>",
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-document-quirks">quirks mode</dfn> if its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-mode" id=3D"ref-for-con=
cept-document-mode=E2=91=A3">mode</a>
is "<code>quirks</code>", and
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-document-limited-quirks">limited-quirks mode</dfn> if its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
ment-mode" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-mode=E2=91=A4">mode</a> is "<code=
>limited-quirks</code>".

</p>
   <div class=3D"note" role=3D"note">
    <p>The <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-document-mode" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-mode=E2=91=A5">mode</a=
> is only ever changed from the default for <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-do=
cument=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A1">documents</a>
 created by the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.=
org/multipage/parsing.html#html-parser" id=3D"ref-for-html-parser=E2=91=A0"=
>HTML parser</a> based on the presence, absence, or value of the DOCTYPE st=
ring,
 and by a new <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.or=
g/multipage/document-sequences.html#browsing-context" id=3D"ref-for-browsin=
g-context=E2=91=A2">browsing context</a> (initial "<code>about:blank</code>=
"). <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#bibli=
o-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</a>

 </p>
    <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conce=
pt-document-no-quirks" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-no-quirks">No-quirks =
mode</a> was originally known as "standards mode" and <a data-link-type=3D"=
dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-limited-quirks" =
id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-limited-quirks">limited-quirks mode</a>
 was once known as "almost standards mode". They have been renamed because =
their details are now
 defined by standards. (And because Ian Hickson vetoed their original names=
 on the basis that they
 are nonsensical.)
</p>
   </div>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A2">document</a=
>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
get-the-parent" id=3D"ref-for-get-the-parent=E2=91=A5">get the parent</a> a=
lgorithm, given an <var>event</var>, returns
null if <var>event</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-event-type" id=3D"ref-for-do=
m-event-type=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">type</a></code> attribute value is "<code>l=
oad</code>" or
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
ment" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A3">document</a> does n=
ot have a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/mu=
ltipage/document-sequences.html#concept-document-bc" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
document-bc">browsing context</a>; otherwise the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
ment" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A4">document</a>=E2=80=
=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipa=
ge/webappapis.html#concept-relevant-global" id=3D"ref-for-concept-relevant-=
global=E2=91=A2">relevant global object</a>.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"create a document">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"create-a-document">create a document</dfn> that implements an interf=
ace <var>interface</var>,
given a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://tc39.es/ecma262/#realm" i=
d=3D"ref-for-realm=E2=91=A0">realm</a> <var>realm</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#a=
ssert" id=3D"ref-for-assert=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">Assert</a>: <var>interface</=
var> is <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#document" id=3D"ref-for-document=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">Documen=
t</a></code> or an interface that inherits from
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#document" id=3D"ref-for-document=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">Document</a></=
code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return a new <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3=E2=91=
=A2">node</a> that <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#implements" id=3D"ref-for-implements=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">implement=
s</a> <var>interface</var>, in
 <var>realm</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <hr>
