" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-url" id=3D"ref-for-=
concept-document-url=E2=91=A1">URL</a>.

=20
    </dd><dt><code><var>document</var> . <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-t=
ype=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-document-compatmode" i=
