    </dt><dd>
  Returns the string "<code>BackCompat</code>" if <var>document</var>=E2=80=
=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-document-mode" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-mode=E2=91=A6">mode</a> is
  "<code>quirks</code>"; otherwise "<code>CSS1Compat</code>".

=20
    </dd><dt><code><var>document</var> . <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-t=
ype=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-document-characterset"=
 id=3D"ref-for-dom-document-characterset=E2=91=A0">characterSet</a></code><=
/code>
