    </dt><dd>Returns <var>document</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doc=
ument-encoding" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-encoding=E2=91=A1">encoding<=
/a>.

=20
    </dd><dt><code><var>document</var> . <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-t=
ype=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-document-contenttype" =
