    </dt><dd>Returns <var>document</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doc=
ument-content-type" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-content-type=E2=91=A1">c=
ontent type</a>.

   </dd></dl>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"constructor" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"Document()|construct=
or()" id=3D"dom-document-document"><code>new Document()</code></dfn> constr=
uctor
steps are to set <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.what=
wg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2">this</a>=E2=80=
=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-document-origin" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-origin=E2=91=A1">origin</a=
> to the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-document-origin" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-origin=E2=91=A2">origi=
n</a> of
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/we=
bappapis.html#current-global-object" id=3D"ref-for-current-global-object">c=
urrent global object</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#concept-document-win=
dow" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-window=E2=91=A0">associated <code>Docum=
ent</code></a>. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#biblio-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[HTML]</a>

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Unlike <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-=
type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domimplementation-cre=
atedocument" id=3D"ref-for-dom-domimplementation-createdocument">createDocu=
ment()</a></code>, this constructor does not
return an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#xmldocument" id=3D"ref-for-xmldocument">XMLDocument</a></=
code> object, but a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A6"=
>document</a> (<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document" id=3D"ref-for-document=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">=
Document</a></code> object).

</p>
   <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=
=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-implementation"><code>im=
plementation</code></dfn> getter steps are to return the
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#domimplementation" id=3D"ref-for-domimplementation=E2=91=A1">DOMImp=
lementation</a></code> object that is associated with <a data-link-type=3D"=
dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">this</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-url"><code>URL=
</code></dfn> and
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=
=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-documenturi"><code>docum=
entURI</code></dfn> getter steps are to return <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A1=E2=91=A4">this</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
ment-url" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-url=E2=91=A2">URL</a>, <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-serializer"=
 id=3D"ref-for-concept-url-serializer=E2=91=A0">serialized</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-compatmode"><c=
ode>compatMode</code></dfn> getter steps are to return
"<code>BackCompat</code>" if <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webi=
dl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">th=
is</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-document-mode" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-mode=E2=91=A7">m=
ode</a> is "<code>quirks</code>";
otherwise "<code>CSS1Compat</code>".

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-characterset">=
<code>characterSet</code></dfn>,
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=
=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-charset"><code>charset</=
code></dfn>, and
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=
=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-inputencoding"><code>inp=
utEncoding</code></dfn> getter steps are to return
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A6">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-encodi=
ng" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-encoding=E2=91=A2">encoding</a>=E2=80=99=
s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#name"=
 id=3D"ref-for-name">name</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-contenttype"><=
code>contentType</code></dfn> getter steps are to return
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A7">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-conten=
t-type" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-content-type=E2=91=A2">content type<=
/a>.

</p>
   <hr>
   <dl class=3D"domintro">
    <dt><var>document</var> . <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-document-doctype" id=3D"ref-for-d=
om-document-doctype=E2=91=A0">doctype</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dd>Returns the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype" id=3D"ref-for-concept-doctype=E2=91=A8">docty=
pe</a> or null if
 there is none.

=20
    </dd><dt><var>document</var> . <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-document-documentelement" id=
=3D"ref-for-dom-document-documentelement=E2=91=A0">documentElement</a></cod=
e>
=20
    </dt><dd>Returns the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#document-element" id=3D"ref-for-document-element=E2=91=A4">doc=
ument element</a>.

=20
    </dd><dt><code><var>collection</var> =3D <var>document</var> . <a class=
=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"method" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#dom-document-getelementsbytagname" id=3D"ref-for-dom-document-getelements=
bytagname=E2=91=A0">getElementsByTagName</a>(<var>qualifiedName</var>)</cod=
e>

=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>If <var>qualifiedName</var> is "<code>*</code>" returns an <code cl=
ass=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">HTMLCollect=
ion</a></code> of all
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2">des=
cendant</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A4">elements<=
/a>.

  </p>
     <p>Otherwise, returns an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcol=
lection=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">HTMLCollection</a></code> of all <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-descendant" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">descendant</a>
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-el=
ement" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A5">elements</a> whose =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent-qualified-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-qualified-name=E2=91=A2">=
qualified name</a> is <var>qualifiedName</var>.
  (Matches case-insensitively against <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=
=91=A4=E2=91=A6">elements</a> in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=
=91=A3">HTML namespace</a> within an
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#html-docum=
ent" id=3D"ref-for-html-document=E2=91=A1">HTML document</a>.)

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>collection</var> =3D <var>document</var> . <a class=
=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"method" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#dom-document-getelementsbytagnamens" id=3D"ref-for-dom-document-getelemen=
tsbytagnamens=E2=91=A0">getElementsByTagNameNS</a>(<var>namespace</var>, <v=
ar>localName</var>)</code>

=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>If <var>namespace</var> and <var>localName</var> are "<code>*</code=
>", returns an
  <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">H=
TMLCollection</a></code> of all <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-des=
cendant=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">descendant</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-elemen=
t=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A7">elements</a>.

  </p>
     <p>If only <var>namespace</var> is "<code>*</code>", returns an <code =
class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A6">HTMLColle=
ction</a></code> of all
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">des=
cendant</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A8">elements<=
/a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-element-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-local-name=E2=91=A4=
">local name</a> is
  <var>localName</var>.

  </p>
     <p>If only <var>localName</var> is "<code>*</code>", returns an <code =
class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A7">HTMLColle=
ction</a></code> of all
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A6">des=
cendant</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A5=E2=93=AA">elements<=
/a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-element-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace=E2=91=A8">=
namespace</a> is
  <var>namespace</var>.

  </p>
     <p>Otherwise, returns an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcol=
lection=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A8">HTMLCollection</a></code> of all <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-descendant" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A7">descendant</a>
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-el=
ement" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A0">elements</a> whose =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">n=
amespace</a> is <var>namespace</var> and
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-el=
ement-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-local-name=E2=91=A5">local =
name</a> is <var>localName</var>.

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>collection</var> =3D <var>document</var> . <a class=
=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"method" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#dom-document-getelementsbyclassname" id=3D"ref-for-dom-document-getelemen=
tsbyclassname=E2=91=A0">getElementsByClassName</a>(<var>classNames</var>)</=
code>
=20
    </dt><dt><code><var>collection</var> =3D <var>element</var> . <a class=
=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"method" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#dom-element-getelementsbyclassname" id=3D"ref-for-dom-element-getelements=
byclassname">getElementsByClassName</a>(<var>classNames</var>)</code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Returns an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=
=91=A2=E2=93=AA">HTMLCollection</a></code> of the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concep=
t-element=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A1">elements</a> in the object on which the method
 was invoked (a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#concept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A7">doc=
ument</a> or an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A2">eleme=
nt</a>) that have all the classes given by
 <var>classNames</var>. The <var>classNames</var> argument is interpreted a=
s a space-separated list
 of classes.
</p>
   </dd></dl>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-doctype"><code=
>doctype</code></dfn> getter steps are to return the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A3">child</a> of <a=
 data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D=
"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A8">this</a> that is a <a data-link-t=
ype=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype" id=3D"ref=
-for-concept-doctype=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">doctype</a>; otherwise null.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-documentelemen=
t"><code>documentElement</code></dfn> getter steps are to return
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2=E2=93=AA">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document-element" id=3D=
"ref-for-document-element=E2=91=A5">document element</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-getelementsbytagn=
ame"><code>getElementsByTagName(<var>qualifiedName</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are to return the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-getelementsbytagname" id=3D"ref-for-concept-gete=
lementsbytagname">list of elements with qualified name <var>qualifiedName</=
var></a>
for <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this"=
 id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A0">this</a>.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Thus, in an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#html-document" id=3D"ref-for-html-docume=
nt=E2=91=A2">HTML document</a>,
<code class=3D"highlight lang-javascript">document<c- p=3D"">.</c->getEleme=
ntsByTagName<c- p=3D"">(</c-><c- u=3D"">"FOO"</c-><c- p=3D"">)</c-></code> =
will match
<code>&lt;FOO&gt;</code> elements that are not in the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-names=
pace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A4">HTML namespace</a>, and <code>=
&lt;foo&gt;</code> elements that are in
the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-n=
amespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A5">HTML namespace</a>, but no=
t <code>&lt;FOO&gt;</code> elements
that are in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg=
.org/#html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A6">HTML namespace=
</a>.

</p>
   <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=
=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-getelementsbytagnamens"><co=
de>getElementsByTagNameNS(<var>namespace</var>, <var>localName</var>)</code=
></dfn>
method steps are to return the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-getelementsbytagnamens" id=3D"ref-for-concept-ge=
telementsbytagnamens">list of elements with namespace <var>namespace</var> =
and local
name <var>localName</var></a> for <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:/=
/webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2=E2=91=
=A1">this</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-document-getelementsbyclas=
sname"><code>getElementsByClassName(<var>classNames</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are to return the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-getelementsbyclassname" id=3D"ref-for-concept-ge=
telementsbyclassname">list of elements with class names <var>classNames</va=
r></a> for
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A2">this</a>.

</p>
   <div class=3D"example" id=3D"example-5ffcda00">
    <a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#example-5ff=
cda00"></a>
 Given the following XHTML fragment:

=20
<pre><code class=3D"highlight lang-html"><c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">div=
</c-> <c- e=3D"">id</c-><c- o=3D"">=3D</c-><c- s=3D"">"example"</c-><c- p=
=3D"">&gt;</c->
  <c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">p</c-> <c- e=3D"">id</c-><c- o=3D"">=3D</c=
-><c- s=3D"">"p1"</c-> <c- e=3D"">class</c-><c- o=3D"">=3D</c-><c- s=3D"">"=
aaa bbb"</c-><c- p=3D"">/&gt;</c->
  <c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">p</c-> <c- e=3D"">id</c-><c- o=3D"">=3D</c=
-><c- s=3D"">"p2"</c-> <c- e=3D"">class</c-><c- o=3D"">=3D</c-><c- s=3D"">"=
aaa ccc"</c-><c- p=3D"">/&gt;</c->
  <c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">p</c-> <c- e=3D"">id</c-><c- o=3D"">=3D</c=
-><c- s=3D"">"p3"</c-> <c- e=3D"">class</c-><c- o=3D"">=3D</c-><c- s=3D"">"=
bbb ccc"</c-><c- p=3D"">/&gt;</c->
<c- p=3D"">&lt;/</c-><c- f=3D"">div</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c-></code></pre>
    <p>A call to
 <code class=3D"highlight lang-javascript">document<c- p=3D"">.</c->getElem=
entById<c- p=3D"">(</c-><c- u=3D"">"example"</c-><c- p=3D"">).</c->getEleme=
ntsByClassName<c- p=3D"">(</c-><c- u=3D"">"aaa"</c-><c- p=3D"">)</c-></code=
>
 would return an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#htmlcollection" id=3D"ref-for-htmlcollection=E2=91=
=A2=E2=91=A0">HTMLCollection</a></code> with the two paragraphs
 <code>p1</code> and <code>p2</code> in it.</p>
    <p>A call to
 <code class=3D"highlight lang-javascript">getElementsByClassName<c- p=3D""=
>(</c-><c- u=3D"">"ccc&nbsp;bbb"</c-><c- p=3D"">)</c-></code>
 would only return one node, however, namely <code>p3</code>. A call to
 <code class=3D"highlight lang-javascript">document<c- p=3D"">.</c->getElem=
entById<c- p=3D"">(</c-><c- u=3D"">"example"</c-><c- p=3D"">).</c->getEleme=
ntsByClassName<c- p=3D"">(</c-><c- u=3D"">"bbb&nbsp;&nbsp;ccc&nbsp;"</c-><c=
- p=3D"">)</c-></code>
 would return the same thing.</p>
    <p>A call to
 <code class=3D"highlight lang-javascript">getElementsByClassName<c- p=3D""=
>(</c-><c- u=3D"">"aaa,bbb"</c-><c- p=3D"">)</c-></code>
 would return no nodes; none of the elements above are in the
 <code>aaa,bbb</code> class.</p>
   </div>
   <hr>
   <dl class=3D"domintro">
    <dt><code><var>element</var> =3D <var>document</var> . <a class=3D"idl-=
code" data-link-type=3D"method" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-do=
cument-createelement" id=3D"ref-for-dom-document-createelement=E2=91=A0">cr=
eateElement(localName [, options])</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Returns an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A3">el=
ement</a> with <var>localName</var> as <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concep=
t-element-local-name=E2=91=A6">local name</a>
  (if <var>document</var> is an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#html-document" id=3D"ref-for-html-document=E2=91=A3">HT=
ML document</a>, <var>localName</var> gets lowercased). The
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-el=
ement" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A4">element</a>=E2=80=
=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-element-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A0">namespace</a> is the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A7">HTML=
 namespace</a> when
  <var>document</var> is an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#html-document" id=3D"ref-for-html-document=E2=91=A4">HTML d=
ocument</a> or <var>document</var>=E2=80=99s
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-do=
cument-content-type" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-content-type=E2=91=A3">=
content type</a> is "<code>application/xhtml+xml</code>"; otherwise null.

  </p>
     <p>When supplied, <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a =
data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-elementcrea=
tionoptions-customelementregistry" id=3D"ref-for-dom-elementcreationoptions=
-customelementregistry">customElementRegistry</a></code> can be
  used to set the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#customelementregis=
try" id=3D"ref-for-customelementregistry=E2=91=A6">CustomElementRegistry</a=
></code>.

  </p>
     <p>When supplied, <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a =
data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-elementcrea=
tionoptions-is" id=3D"ref-for-dom-elementcreationoptions-is">is</a></code> =
can be used to create a
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/=
custom-elements.html#customized-built-in-element" id=3D"ref-for-customized-=
built-in-element">customized built-in element</a>.

  </p>
     <p>If <var>localName</var> is not a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-element-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-valid-=
element-local-name=E2=91=A1">valid element local name</a> an
  "<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#invalidcharactererror" id=3D"ref-for-invalidcharactererror=E2=
=91=A2">InvalidCharacterError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-=
type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=
=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A8">DOMException</a></code> wil=
l be thrown.

  </p>
     <p>When both <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-=
link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-elementcreationo=
ptions-customelementregistry" id=3D"ref-for-dom-elementcreationoptions-cust=
omelementregistry=E2=91=A0">customElementRegistry</a></code> and
  <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-elementcreationoptions-is" id=3D=
"ref-for-dom-elementcreationoptions-is=E2=91=A0">is</a></code> are supplied=
, a
  "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" h=
ref=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#notsupportederror" id=3D"ref-for-not=
supportederror=E2=91=A0">NotSupportedError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl">=
<a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMEx=
ception" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A3=E2=93=AA">DOMException</a>=
</code> will be thrown.

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>element</var> =3D <var>document</var> . <a class=3D=
"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"method" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#d=
om-document-createelementns" id=3D"ref-for-dom-document-createelementns=E2=
=91=A0">createElementNS(namespace, qualifiedName [, options])</a></code>

=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Returns an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A5">el=
ement</a> with <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#concept-element-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A1">namespace</a> <var>namespace</var>. Its
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-el=
ement-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace-prefix=E2=
=91=A4">namespace prefix</a> will be everything before U+003A (:) in
  <var>qualifiedName</var> or null. Its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-conce=
pt-element-local-name=E2=91=A7">local name</a> will be everything after
  U+003A (:) in <var>qualifiedName</var> or <var>qualifiedName</var>.

  </p>
     <p>When supplied, <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a =
data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-elementcrea=
tionoptions-customelementregistry" id=3D"ref-for-dom-elementcreationoptions=
-customelementregistry=E2=91=A1">customElementRegistry</a></code> can be
  used to set the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#customelementregis=
try" id=3D"ref-for-customelementregistry=E2=91=A7">CustomElementRegistry</a=
></code>.

  </p>
     <p>When supplied, <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a =
data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-elementcrea=
tionoptions-is" id=3D"ref-for-dom-elementcreationoptions-is=E2=91=A1">is</a=
></code> can be used to create a
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/=
custom-elements.html#customized-built-in-element" id=3D"ref-for-customized-=
built-in-element=E2=91=A0">customized built-in element</a>.

  </p>
     <p>If <var>qualifiedName</var> is not a (possibly-prefixed)
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-elem=
ent-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-valid-element-local-name=E2=91=A2">valid elem=
ent local name</a> an "<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidcharactererror" id=3D"ref-for-in=
validcharactererror=E2=91=A3">InvalidCharacterError</a></code>" <code class=
=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#=
idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A0">DOMExce=
ption</a></code> will be
  thrown.

  </p>
     <p>If one of the following conditions is true a "<code class=3D"idl"><=
a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" href=3D"https://webidl.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#namespaceerror" id=3D"ref-for-namespaceerror=E2=91=A3">Names=
paceError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D=
"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMExc=
eption=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A1">DOMException</a></code>
  will be thrown:

  </p>
     <ul>
      <li><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-element-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace-pre=
fix=E2=91=A5">Namespace prefix</a>
   is non-null and <var>namespace</var> is the empty string.
  =20
      </li><li><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#concept-element-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespac=
e-prefix=E2=91=A6">Namespace prefix</a>
   is "<code>xml</code>" and <var>namespace</var> is not the
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#xml-nam=
espace" id=3D"ref-for-xml-namespace=E2=91=A1">XML namespace</a>.
  =20
      </li><li><var>qualifiedName</var> or
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-e=
lement-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace-prefix=E2=
=91=A7">namespace prefix</a>
   is "<code>xmlns</code>" and <var>namespace</var> is not the
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#xmlns-n=
amespace" id=3D"ref-for-xmlns-namespace=E2=91=A4">XMLNS namespace</a>.
  =20
      </li><li><var>namespace</var> is the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#xmlns-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-xmlns-nam=
espace=E2=91=A5">XMLNS namespace</a> and
   neither <var>qualifiedName</var> nor
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-e=
lement-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace-prefix=E2=
=91=A8">namespace prefix</a>
   is "<code>xmlns</code>".
 =20
     </li></ul>
     <p>When both <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-=
link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-elementcreationo=
ptions-customelementregistry" id=3D"ref-for-dom-elementcreationoptions-cust=
omelementregistry=E2=91=A2">customElementRegistry</a></code> and
  <var>options</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-elementcreationoptions-is" id=3D=
"ref-for-dom-elementcreationoptions-is=E2=91=A2">is</a></code> are supplied=
, a
