ref=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#notsupportederror" id=3D"ref-for-not=
supportederror=E2=91=A1">NotSupportedError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl">=
<a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMEx=
ception" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A2">DOMException</a>=
</code> will be thrown.

 </p>
