   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"concept-element-interface">element interface</dfn> for any <var>name=
</var> and
<var>namespace</var> is <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A3=E2=
=91=A1">Element</a></code>, unless stated otherwise.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The HTML Standard will, e.g., define tha=
t for <code>html</code> and the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-names=
pace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A8">HTML namespace</a>, the <code =
class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.or=
g/multipage/semantics.html#htmlhtmlelement" id=3D"ref-for-htmlhtmlelement">=
HTMLHtmlElement</a></code> interface is used. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-html" title=3D"HTML Standard">[=
HTML]</a>

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"createElement(localName, opti=
ons)" data-algorithm-for=3D"Document">
    <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=
=3D"method" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"createElement(localName, options)|c=
reateElement(localName)" id=3D"dom-document-createelement"><code>createElem=
ent(<var>localName</var>, <var>options</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>localName</var> is not a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-element-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-valid=
-element-local-name=E2=91=A3">valid element local name</a>, then
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-thro=
w" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A6">throw</a> an "<code class=3D"=
idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" href=3D"https://web=
idl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidcharactererror" id=3D"ref-for-invalidcharactere=
rror=E2=91=A6">InvalidCharacterError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a dat=
a-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMExceptio=
n" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A5">DOMException</a></code=
>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A3">this</a> is an <a d=
ata-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#html-document" i=
d=3D"ref-for-html-document=E2=91=A5">HTML document</a>, then set <var>local=
Name</var> to
 <var>localName</var> in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#ascii-lowercase" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-lowercase=E2=91=A0">ASC=
II lowercase</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>registry</var> and <var>is</var> be the result of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#flatten-ele=
ment-creation-options" id=3D"ref-for-flatten-element-creation-options">flat=
tening element creation options</a> given <var>options</var> and <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for=
-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A4">this</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>namespace</var> be the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=
=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">HTML namespace</a>, if <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A2=E2=91=A5">this</a> is an
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#html-docume=
nt" id=3D"ref-for-html-document=E2=91=A6">HTML document</a> or <a data-link=
-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-t=
his=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A6">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-content-type" id=3D=
"ref-for-concept-document-content-type=E2=91=A4">content type</a> is
 "<code>application/xhtml+xml</code>"; otherwise null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-create-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-create-elem=
ent=E2=91=A0">creating an element</a> given <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A2=E2=91=A7">this</a>, <var>localName</var>,
 <var>namespace</var>, null, <var>is</var>, true, and <var>registry</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"internal createElementNS step=
s">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=
=3D"" id=3D"internal-createelementns-steps">internal <code>createElementNS<=
/code> steps</dfn>, given <var>document</var>,
<var>namespace</var>, <var>qualifiedName</var>, and <var>options</var>, are=
 as follows:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let (<var>namespace</var>, <var>prefix</var>, <var>localName</var>=
) be the result of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#validate-an=
d-extract" id=3D"ref-for-validate-and-extract">validating and extracting</a=
> <var>namespace</var> and
 <var>qualifiedName</var> given "<code>element</code>".

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>registry</var> and <var>is</var> be the result of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#flatten-ele=
ment-creation-options" id=3D"ref-for-flatten-element-creation-options=E2=91=
=A0">flattening element creation options</a> given <var>options</var> and <=
a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A8">this</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-create-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-create-elem=
ent=E2=91=A1">creating an element</a> given <var>document</var>,
 <var>localName</var>, <var>namespace</var>, <var>prefix</var>, <var>is</va=
r>, true, and
 <var>registry</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"createElementNS(namespace, qu=
alifiedName, options)" data-algorithm-for=3D"Document">
    <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=
=3D"method" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"createElementNS(namespace, qualifie=
dName, options)|createElementNS(namespace, qualifiedName)" id=3D"dom-docume=
nt-createelementns"><code>createElementNS(<var>namespace</var>, <var>qualif=
iedName</var>, <var>options</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are to return the result of running the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#internal-cre=
ateelementns-steps" id=3D"ref-for-internal-createelementns-steps">internal =
<code>createElementNS</code> steps</a>, given <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A3=E2=93=AA">this</a>, <var>namespace</var>,
<var>qualifiedName</var>, and <var>options</var>.
</p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"flatten element creation opti=
ons">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D=
"" id=3D"flatten-element-creation-options">flatten element creation options=
</dfn>, given a string or <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dictdef-elementcreationoptions" id=3D"ref=
-for-dictdef-elementcreationoptions=E2=91=A1">ElementCreationOptions</a></c=
ode>
dictionary <var>options</var> and a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=
=91=A2=E2=91=A8">document</a> <var>document</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>registry</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn"=
 href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#look-u=
p-a-custom-element-registry" id=3D"ref-for-look-up-a-custom-element-registr=
y">looking up a custom element registry</a>
 given <var>document</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>is</var> be null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>options</var> is a dictionary:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>If <var>options</var>["<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"=
idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-elementcreationoptions-is" id=
=3D"ref-for-dom-elementcreationoptions-is=E2=91=A3">is</a></code>"] <a data=
-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-exists" id=3D=
"ref-for-map-exists=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">exists</a>, then set
   <var>is</var> to it.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>options</var>["<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"=
idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-elementcreationoptions-custom=
elementregistry" id=3D"ref-for-dom-elementcreationoptions-customelementregi=
