=3D"dom-document-createnodeiterator"><code>createNodeIterator(<var>root</va=
r>, <var>whatToShow</var>, <var>filter</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>Let <var>iterator</var> be a new <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-t=
ype=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-nodeiterator=E2=91=A2">NodeIterator</a></code> object.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Set <var>iterator</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept=
-traversal-root=E2=91=A1">root</a> to <var>root</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Set <var>iterator</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator-reference" id=3D"ref-for-nodeite=
rator-reference">reference</a> to (<var>root</var>, true).

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Set <var>iterator</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-whattoshow" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-traversal-whattoshow">whatToShow</a> to <var>whatToShow</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Set <var>iterator</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-filter" id=3D"ref-for-conce=
pt-traversal-filter">filter</a> to <var>filter</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Return <var>iterator</var>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Document" data-dfn-type=
=3D"method" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"createTreeWalker(root, whatToShow, =
filter)|createTreeWalker(root, whatToShow)|createTreeWalker(root)" id=3D"do=
m-document-createtreewalker"><code>createTreeWalker(<var>root</var>, <var>w=
hatToShow</var>, <var>filter</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>Let <var>walker</var> be a new <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-typ=
e=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#treewalker" id=3D"ref-for-tr=
eewalker=E2=91=A0">TreeWalker</a></code> object.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Set <var>walker</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-t=
raversal-root=E2=91=A2">root</a> and <var>walker</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#treewalker-=
current" id=3D"ref-for-treewalker-current">current</a> to <var>root</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Set <var>walker</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-whattoshow" id=3D"ref-for-con=
cept-traversal-whattoshow=E2=91=A0">whatToShow</a> to <var>whatToShow</var>=
.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Set <var>walker</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-filter" id=3D"ref-for-concept=
-traversal-filter=E2=91=A0">filter</a> to <var>filter</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>Return <var>walker</var>.

   </li></ol>
