f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domimplementation-createdocumenttype"=
 id=3D"ref-for-dom-domimplementation-createdocumenttype=E2=91=A0">createDoc=
umentType(name, publicId, systemId)</a></code></code>

=20
    </dt><dd>
    =20
  Returns a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-doctype" id=3D"ref-for-concept-doctype=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">doctype</=
a>, with the given <var>name</var>, <var>publicId</var>, and <var>systemId<=
/var>.


     <p>If <var>name</var> is not a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-doctype-name" id=3D"ref-for-valid-doctype-nam=
e=E2=91=A0">valid doctype name</a>, an "<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidcharactererror" i=
d=3D"ref-for-invalidcharactererror=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">InvalidCharacterError=
</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://=
webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=
=91=A5=E2=91=A0">DOMException</a></code> is thrown.</p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>doc</var> =3D <var>document</var> . <code class=3D"=
idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-doc=
ument-implementation" id=3D"ref-for-dom-document-implementation=E2=91=A2">i=
mplementation</a></code> . <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"method" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domimplementation-createdocument" =
id=3D"ref-for-dom-domimplementation-createdocument=E2=91=A1">createDocument=
(<var>namespace</var>, <var>qualifiedName</var> [, <var>doctype</var> =3D n=
ull])</a></code>

=20
    </dt><dd>
    =20
  Returns an <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#xmldocument" id=3D"ref-for-xmldocument=E2=91=A1">XMLDo=
cument</a></code>, with a
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document-e=
lement" id=3D"ref-for-document-element=E2=91=A6">document element</a> whose
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-el=
ement-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-local-name=E2=91=A8">local =
name</a> is
  <var>qualifiedName</var> and whose
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-el=
ement-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2"=
>namespace</a> is
  <var>namespace</var> (unless <var>qualifiedName</var> is the
  empty string), and with <var>doctype</var>, if it is given, as its
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-do=
ctype" id=3D"ref-for-concept-doctype=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">doctype</a>.


     <p>This method throws the same exceptions as the <code class=3D"idl"><=
a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-document-=
createelementns" id=3D"ref-for-dom-document-createelementns=E2=91=A2">creat=
eElementNS()</a></code> method, when
  invoked with <var>namespace</var> and <var>qualifiedName</var>.</p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>doc</var> =3D <var>document</var> . <code class=3D"=
idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-doc=
ument-implementation" id=3D"ref-for-dom-document-implementation=E2=91=A3">i=
mplementation</a></code> . <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"method" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domimplementation-createhtmldocume=
nt" id=3D"ref-for-dom-domimplementation-createhtmldocument=E2=91=A0">create=
HTMLDocument([<var>title</var>])</a></code>

=20
    </dt><dd>
  Returns a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A7">documen=
t</a>, with a basic
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">tree</a> already construc=
