  <code><a data-link-type=3D"element" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/=
multipage/semantics.html#the-title-element" id=3D"ref-for-the-title-element=
">title</a></code> element, unless the <var>title</var>
  argument is omitted.

   </dd></dl>
   <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"DOMImplementation" data=
-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-domimplementation-createdoc=
umenttype"><code>createDocumentType(<var>name</var>, <var>publicId</var>, <=
var>systemId</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>If <var>name</var> is not a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-doctype-name" id=3D"ref-for-valid-doctype-nam=
e=E2=91=A1">valid doctype name</a>, then throw an "<code class=3D"idl"><a d=
ata-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidcharac=
tererror" id=3D"ref-for-invalidcharactererror=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">InvalidCha=
racterError</a></code>"
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.=
whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A5=E2=91=
=A1">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Return the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-doctype" id=3D"ref-for-create-a-doctype">creating=
 a doctype</a> given the associated <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=
=91=A3=E2=91=A8">document</a> of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A6">this</a>, <var>name</var>, <va=
r>publicId</var>, and <var>systemId</var>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"DOMImplementation" data=
-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"createDocument(namespace, =
qualifiedName, doctype)|createDocument(namespace, qualifiedName)" id=3D"dom=
-domimplementation-createdocument"><code>createDocument(<var>namespace</var=
>, <var>qualifiedName</var>, <var>doctype</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>Let <var>document</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-document" id=3D"ref-for-creat=
e-a-document=E2=91=A1">creating a document</a> that implements
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#xmldocument" id=3D"ref-for-xmldocument=E2=91=A2">XMLDocument</a></=
code>, given <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A7">this</a>=E2=80=99s=
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/w=
ebappapis.html#concept-relevant-realm" id=3D"ref-for-concept-relevant-realm=
=E2=91=A2">relevant realm</a>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Let <var>element</var> be null.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>If <var>qualifiedName</var> is not the empty string, then set <var>=
element</var> to the
 result of running the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#internal-createelementns-steps" id=3D"ref-for-internal-createele=
mentns-steps=E2=91=A0">internal <code>createElementNS</code> steps</a>, giv=
en
 <var>document</var>, <var>namespace</var>, <var>qualifiedName</var>, and a=
n empty dictionary.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>If <var>doctype</var> is non-null, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept=
-node-append=E2=91=A3">append</a> <var>doctype</var> to <var>document</var>=
.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>If <var>element</var> is non-null, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept=
-node-append=E2=91=A4">append</a> <var>element</var> to <var>document</var>=
.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p><var>document</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-origin" id=3D"ref-for-concept-do=
cument-origin=E2=91=A3">origin</a> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4=E2=
=91=A8">this</a>=E2=80=99s associated
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doc=
ument" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A4=E2=93=AA">document</a>=E2=80=
=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-document-origin" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-origin=E2=91=A4">origin</a=
>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p><var>document</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-content-type" id=3D"ref-for-conc=
ept-document-content-type=E2=91=A5">content type</a> is determined by <var>=
namespace</var>:

  </p>
     <dl class=3D"switch">
      <dt><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#=
html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">HTML namesp=
ace</a>
  =20
      </dt><dd><code>application/xhtml+xml</code>

  =20
      </dd><dt><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.=
org/#svg-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-svg-namespace">SVG namespace</a>
  =20
      </dt><dd><code>image/svg+xml</code>

  =20
      </dd><dt>Any other namespace
  =20
      </dt><dd><code>application/xml</code>
 =20
     </dd></dl>
    </li><li>
     <p>Return <var>document</var>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"DOMImplementation" data=
-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"createHTMLDocument(title)|=
createHTMLDocument()" id=3D"dom-domimplementation-createhtmldocument"><code=
>createHTMLDocument(<var>title</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>Let <var>doc</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-document" id=3D"ref-for-create-a-=
document=E2=91=A2">creating a document</a> that implements
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#document" id=3D"ref-for-document=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">Document</a></=
code>, given <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5=E2=93=AA">this</a>=E2=80=99s=
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/w=
ebappapis.html#concept-relevant-realm" id=3D"ref-for-concept-relevant-realm=
=E2=91=A3">relevant realm</a>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Set <var>doc</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-type" id=3D"ref-for-concept-docum=
ent-type=E2=91=A3">type</a> to "<code>html</code>" and
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doc=
ument-content-type" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-content-type=E2=91=A6">c=
ontent type</a> to "<code>text/html</code>".

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Let <var>doctype</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" h=
ref=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-doctype" id=3D"ref-for-create-=
a-doctype=E2=91=A0">creating a doctype</a> given <var>doc</var> and
 "<code>html</code>".

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-append=E2=91=A5">Append</a> <va=
r>doctype</var> to <var>doc</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-append=E2=91=A6">Append</a> the=
 result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-create-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-create-element=E2=91=A2">creat=
ing an element</a> given <var>doc</var>,
 "<code>html</code>", and the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://inf=
ra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A1">HTML namespace</a>, to <var>doc</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-append=E2=91=A7">Append</a> the=
 result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-create-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-create-element=E2=91=A3">creat=
ing an element</a> given <var>doc</var>,
 "<code>head</code>", and the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://inf=
ra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A2">HTML namespace</a>, to the <code><a data-link-type=3D"element" h=
ref=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-html-eleme=
nt" id=3D"ref-for-the-html-element">html</a></code> element created earlier=
.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>If <var>title</var> is given:

  </p>
     <ol>
      <li>
       <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-node-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-append=E2=91=A8">Append</a> t=
he result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/=
#concept-create-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-create-element=E2=91=A4">cre=
ating an element</a> given <var>doc</var>,
   "<code>title</code>", and the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://=
infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A3">HTML namespace</a>, to the <code><a data-link-type=3D"element=
" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-head-el=
ement" id=3D"ref-for-the-head-element">head</a></code> element created earl=
ier.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>Let <var>text</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-text-node" id=3D"ref-for-create=
-a-text-node=E2=91=A2">creating a text node</a> given <var>doc</var> and
   <var>title</var> (which could be the empty string).

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-node-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-append=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">App=
end</a> <var>text</var> to the <code><a data-link-type=3D"element" href=3D"=
https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-title-element" id=
=3D"ref-for-the-title-element=E2=91=A0">title</a></code> element created ea=
rlier.
  </p>
     </li></ol>
    </li><li>
     <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-append=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">Appen=
d</a> the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-create-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-create-element=E2=91=
=A5">creating an element</a> given <var>doc</var>,
 "<code>body</code>", and the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://inf=
ra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A4">HTML namespace</a>, to the <code><a data-link-type=3D"element" h=
ref=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-html-eleme=
nt" id=3D"ref-for-the-html-element=E2=91=A0">html</a></code> element create=
d earlier.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p><var>doc</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-origin" id=3D"ref-for-concept-documen=
t-origin=E2=91=A5">origin</a> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://=
webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A0=
">this</a>=E2=80=99s associated
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doc=
ument" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A0">document</a>=E2=80=
=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-document-origin" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document-origin=E2=91=A6">origin</a=
>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Return <var>doc</var>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"DOMImplementa=
tion" data-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-domimplementation=
-hasfeature"><code>hasFeature()</code></dfn> method steps are to
return true.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domimplementation-hasfeature=
" id=3D"ref-for-dom-domimplementation-hasfeature=E2=91=A0">hasFeature()</a>=
</code> originally would report whether the user agent
claimed to support a given DOM feature, but experience proved it was not ne=
arly as
reliable or granular as simply checking whether the desired objects, attrib=
utes, or
methods existed. As such, it is no longer to be used, but continues to exis=
t (and simply
returns true) so that old pages don=E2=80=99t stop working.


</p>
