   <p><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#documenttype" id=3D"ref-for-documenttype=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">D=
ocumentType</a></code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4=E2=91=
=A0">nodes</a> are simply known as
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" data-lt=
=3D"doctype" id=3D"concept-doctype">doctypes</dfn>.

</p>
   <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-doctype" id=3D"ref-for-concept-doctype=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">Doctypes</a> ha=
ve an associated
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"DocumentType" data-dfn-type=3D"d=
fn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-doctype-name">name</dfn> (a string),
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"DocumentType" data-dfn-type=3D"d=
fn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-doctype-publicid">public ID</dfn> (a str=
ing), and
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"DocumentType" data-dfn-type=3D"d=
fn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-doctype-systemid">system ID</dfn> (a str=
ing).

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"create a doctype">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"create-a-doctype">create a doctype</dfn> given a <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document" id=3D"ref-f=
or-concept-document=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A1">document</a> <var>document</var>, a =
string
<var>name</var>, and optionally a string <var>publicId</var> (default the e=
mpty string) and a string
<var>systemId</var> (default the empty string):

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>doctype</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-node" id=3D"ref-for-create-a-=
node=E2=91=A1">creating a node</a> that implements
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#documenttype" id=3D"ref-for-documenttype=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">Docume=
ntType</a></code>, given <var>document</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>doctype</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-d=
octype-name=E2=91=A3">name</a> to <var>name</var>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype-publicid" id=3D"ref-=
for-concept-doctype-publicid=E2=91=A1">public ID</a> to
 <var>publicId</var>, and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype-systemid" id=3D"ref-for-concept-doctype-syste=
mid=E2=91=A1">system ID</a> to <var>systemId</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>doctype</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"DocumentType"=
 data-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-documenttype-name">=
<code>name</code></dfn> getter steps are to return
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A1">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype-name" i=
d=3D"ref-for-concept-doctype-name=E2=91=A4">name</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"DocumentType"=
