<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A2">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype-publici=
d" id=3D"ref-for-concept-doctype-publicid=E2=91=A2">public ID</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"DocumentType"=
 data-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-documenttype-system=
