ef-for-Exposed=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA"><c- g=3D"">Exposed</c-></a>=3D<c- n=3D"">=
Window</c->]
<c- b=3D"">interface</c-> <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-type=
