   <dl class=3D"domintro">
    <dt><code><var>tree</var> =3D new <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-documentfragment-document=
fragment" id=3D"ref-for-dom-documentfragment-documentfragment=E2=91=A0">Doc=
umentFragment()</a></code></code>
=20
    </dt><dd>Returns a new <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documentfragment" id=3D"ref-for-document=
fragment=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">DocumentFragment</a></code> <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A1">node</a>.

   </dd></dl>
   <hr>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"exclusive DocumentFragment no=
de">
    <p>An <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"exclusive-documentfragment-node">exclusive <code class=3D"idl"><a da=
ta-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documentfragment"=
 id=3D"ref-for-documentfragment=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">DocumentFragment</a></co=
de> node</dfn> is a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documentfragment" id=3D"ref-for-documentfragmen=
t=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A6">DocumentFragment</a></code>
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A2">node</a> that is n=
ot a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#shadowroot" id=3D"ref-for-shadowroot=E2=91=A4">ShadowRoot</a><=
/code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conce=
pt-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A3">node</a>.
</p>
   </div>
   <p>A <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#documentfragment" id=3D"ref-for-documentfragment=E2=91=A1=
=E2=91=A7">DocumentFragment</a></code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A4">node</a> has an associated
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"DocumentFragment" data-dfn-type=
=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-documentfragment-host">host</dfn> (=
null or an
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A7">element</a> in a diff=
erent <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">node tree</=
a>). It is null unless otherwise stated.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"host-including inclusive ance=
stor">
    <p>An object <var>A</var> is a
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-tree-host-including-inclusive-ancestor">host-including inclusive ances=
tor</dfn>
of an object <var>B</var>, if either <var>A</var> is an <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-inclusive-ancest=
or" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor=E2=91=A3">inclusive ances=
tor</a> of <var>B</var>,
or if <var>B</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-root=E2=91=
=A1=E2=91=A6">root</a> has a non-null <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-documentfragment-host" id=3D"ref-for-conc=
ept-documentfragment-host=E2=91=A2">host</a> and
<var>A</var> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-tree-host-including-inclusive-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for-concept=
-tree-host-including-inclusive-ancestor=E2=91=A1">host-including inclusive =
ancestor</a> of <var>B</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-ro=
ot=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A7">root</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-docu=
mentfragment-host" id=3D"ref-for-concept-documentfragment-host=E2=91=A3">ho=
st</a>.
</p>
   </div>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-typ=
e=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#documentfragment" id=3D"ref-=
for-documentfragment=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A8">DocumentFragment</a></code> <a data=
-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D=
"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A5">node</a>=E2=80=99s <a dat=
a-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-documentfr=
agment-host" id=3D"ref-for-concept-documentfragment-host=E2=91=A4">host</a>
concept is useful for HTML=E2=80=99s <code><a data-link-type=3D"element" hr=
ef=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#the-template-el=
ement" id=3D"ref-for-the-template-element=E2=91=A0">template</a></code> ele=
ment and for <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/=
#concept-shadow-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-root=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">=
shadow roots</a>, and impacts the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-pre-insert" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-pre-insert=E2=91=A5">pre-insert</a>=
