tregistry=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3"><c- n=3D"">CustomElementRegistry</c-></a>? <df=
n class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"ShadowRootInit" data-dfn-t=
ype=3D"dict-member" data-export=3D"" data-type=3D"CustomElementRegistry?" i=
d=3D"dom-shadowrootinit-customelementregistry"><code><c- g=3D"">customEleme=
ntRegistry</c-></code></dfn>;
};
</pre>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dictdef-shadowrootinit" id=3D"re=
f-for-dictdef-shadowrootinit=E2=91=A0">ShadowRootInit</a></code> somewhat u=
nusually allows both <code>undefined</code> and
<code>null</code> to be passed to its <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-shadowrootinit-customelem=
entregistry" id=3D"ref-for-dom-shadowrootinit-customelementregistry">custom=
ElementRegistry</a></code> member to allow web
developers to pass a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#shadowroot" id=3D"ref-for-shadowroot=E2=91=A0=
=E2=93=AA">ShadowRoot</a></code> node instead of a dictionary to <code clas=
s=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#do=
m-element-attachshadow" id=3D"ref-for-dom-element-attachshadow=E2=91=A0">at=
tachShadow()</a></code>.

</p>
   <p><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A7">Element</a>=
</code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A1">nodes</a> =
are simply known as
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" data-lt=
=3D"element" id=3D"concept-element">elements</dfn>.

</p>
   <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A6=E2=93=AA">Elements</a> ha=
ve an associated:

</p>
   <dl>
    <dt><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-type=
=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-element-namespace">namespace</dfn>
=20
    </dt><dd>Null or a non-empty string.

=20
    </dd><dt><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-t=
ype=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-element-namespace-prefix">namesp=
ace prefix</dfn>
=20
    </dt><dd>Null or a non-empty string.

=20
    </dd><dt><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-t=
ype=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-element-local-name">local name</=
dfn>
=20
    </dt><dd>A non-empty string.

=20
    </dd><dt><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-t=
ype=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"element-custom-element-registry">custom =
element registry</dfn>
=20
    </dt><dd>Null or a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#customeleme=
ntregistry" id=3D"ref-for-customelementregistry=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">CustomEl=
ementRegistry</a></code> object.

=20
    </dd><dt><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-t=
ype=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-element-custom-element-state">cu=
stom element state</dfn>
=20
    </dt><dd>"<code>undefined</code>", "<code>failed</code>", "<code>uncust=
omized</code>",
 "<code>precustomized</code>", or "<code>custom</code>".

=20
    </dd><dt><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-t=
ype=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-element-custom-element-definitio=
n">custom element definition</dfn>
=20
    </dt><dd>Null or a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.=
whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#custom-element-definition" id=3D"=
ref-for-custom-element-definition">custom element definition</a>.

=20
    </dd><dt><dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-t=
ype=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-element-is-value"><code>is</code=
> value</dfn>
=20
    </dt><dd>Null or a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.=
whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#valid-custom-element-name" id=3D"=
ref-for-valid-custom-element-name">valid custom element name</a>.

   </dd></dl>
   <p>When an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A0">element=
</a> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-create-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-create-element=E2=91=A6">created<=
/a>, all of these values are
initialized.

</p>
   <p>An <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A1">element</a> =
whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-element-custom-element-state" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-custom-elemen=
t-state">custom element state</a> is
"<code>uncustomized</code>" or "<code>custom</code>" is said to be
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" d=
ata-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-element-defined">defined</dfn>. An <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D=
"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A2">element</a> whose
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent-custom-element-state" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-custom-element-stat=
e=E2=91=A0">custom element state</a> is "<code>custom</code>" is said to be
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" d=
ata-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-element-custom">custom</dfn>.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Whether or not an element is <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-defined=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-defined">defined</a> is used to determine t=
he
behavior of the <a class=3D"css" data-link-type=3D"maybe" href=3D"https://d=
rafts.csswg.org/selectors-4/#defined-pseudo" id=3D"ref-for-defined-pseudo">=
:defined</a> pseudo-class. Whether or not an element is <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-custom" id=3D=
"ref-for-concept-element-custom=E2=91=A5">custom</a> is
used to determine the behavior of the <a href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#mutation-algorithms">mutation algorithms</a>. The
"<code>failed</code>" and "<code>precustomized</code>" states are used to e=
nsure that if a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/cu=
stom-elements.html#custom-element-constructor" id=3D"ref-for-custom-element=
-constructor">custom element constructor</a> fails to execute correctly the=
 first time, it is not executed
again by an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/=
multipage/custom-elements.html#concept-upgrade-an-element" id=3D"ref-for-co=
ncept-upgrade-an-element=E2=91=A0">upgrade</a>.

</p>
   <div class=3D"example" id=3D"example-c5b21302">
    <a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#example-c5b=
21302"></a>
=20
    <p>The following code illustrates elements in each of these four states=
:

 </p>
