   </div>
   <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A3">Elements</a> al=
so have an associated
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" d=
ata-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-element-shadow-root">shadow root</dfn> (null =
or a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shad=
ow-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-shadow-root=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A5">shadow root</=
a>). It is null unless otherwise stated. An <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-ele=
ment=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A4">element</a> is a
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" d=
ata-export=3D"" id=3D"element-shadow-host">shadow host</dfn> if its <a data=
-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-sha=
dow-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-shadow-root=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">shad=
ow root</a> is non-null.

</p>
   <p>An <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A5">element</a>=
=E2=80=99s
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" d=
ata-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-element-qualified-name">qualified name</dfn> =
is its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-local-name=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA"=
>local name</a> if its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#concept-element-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-=
namespace-prefix=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">namespace prefix</a> is null; otherwise=
 its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-namespace-prefix=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A0">namespace prefix</a>, followed by "<code>:</code>", followed =
by its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-local-name=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0"=
>local name</a>.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"HTML-uppercased qualified nam=
e" data-algorithm-for=3D"Element">
    <p>An <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A6">element</a>=
=E2=80=99s <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-typ=
e=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"element-html-uppercased-qualified-name">=
HTML-uppercased qualified name</dfn> is the return
value of these steps:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>qualifiedName</var> be <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6=
=E2=91=A1">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-qualified-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-ele=
ment-qualified-name=E2=91=A3">qualified name</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A2">this</a> is in the =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-names=
pace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">HTML namespace</a> an=
d its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A5">nod=
e document</a> is an
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#html-docume=
nt" id=3D"ref-for-html-document=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">HTML document</a>, then =
return <var>qualifiedName</var> in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-uppercase" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-uppercase">AS=
CII uppercase</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>Return <var>qualifiedName</var>.

    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">User agents could optimize <a data-link-=
type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-qualified=
-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-qualified-name=E2=91=A4">qualified nam=
e</a> and
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element-html=
-uppercased-qualified-name" id=3D"ref-for-element-html-uppercased-qualified=
-name=E2=91=A1">HTML-uppercased qualified name</a> by storing them in inter=
nal slots.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"create an element">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"concept-create-element">create an element</dfn>, given a <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document" id=3D=
"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A3">document</a>
<var>document</var>, string <var>localName</var>, string-or-null <var>names=
pace</var>, and
optionally a string-or-null <var>prefix</var> (default null), string-or-nul=
l <var>is</var> (default
null), boolean <var>synchronousCustomElements</var> (default false), and "<=
code>default</code>",
null, or a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://ht=
ml.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#customelementregistry" id=
=3D"ref-for-customelementregistry=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">CustomElementRegistry<=
/a></code> object <var>registry</var> (default "<code>default</code>"):

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>result</var> be null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>registry</var> is "<code>default</code>", then set <var>re=
gistry</var> to the result
 of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipag=
e/custom-elements.html#look-up-a-custom-element-registry" id=3D"ref-for-loo=
k-up-a-custom-element-registry=E2=91=A2">looking up a custom element regist=
ry</a> given <var>document</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>definition</var> be the result of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/c=
ustom-elements.html#look-up-a-custom-element-definition" id=3D"ref-for-look=
-up-a-custom-element-definition">looking up a custom element definition</a>=
 given <var>registry</var>,
 <var>namespace</var>, <var>localName</var>, and <var>is</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>definition</var> is non-null, and <var>definition</var>=E2=
=80=99s
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/=
custom-elements.html#concept-custom-element-definition-name" id=3D"ref-for-=
concept-custom-element-definition-name">name</a> is not equal to its
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/=
custom-elements.html#concept-custom-element-definition-local-name" id=3D"re=
f-for-concept-custom-element-definition-local-name">local name</a> (i.e., <=
var>definition</var> represents a
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/=
custom-elements.html#customized-built-in-element" id=3D"ref-for-customized-=
built-in-element=E2=91=A1">customized built-in element</a>):

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>Let <var>interface</var> be the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-interface" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-element-interface">element interface</a> for <var>localName</var> an=
d the
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-na=
mespace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">HTML namespace</a>=
.

