ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-element" id=3D"ref-for=
-concept-attribute-element=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">element</a> to null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#han=
dle-attribute-changes" id=3D"ref-for-handle-attribute-changes=E2=91=A2">Han=
dle attribute changes</a> for <var>oldAttribute</var> with <var>element</va=
r>,
