//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attri=
bute-value=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">value</a>, and <var>newAttribute</var>=E2=80=
=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-att=
ribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-value=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">valu=
e</a>.
