   <hr>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"get an attribute by name">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"concept-element-attributes-get-by-name">get an attribute by name</df=
n> given a
string <var>qualifiedName</var> and an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=
=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A3">element</a> <var>element</var>:

</p>
