=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">HTML namespace</a> and its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-con=
cept-node-document=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A1">node document</a>
 is an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#html-=
document" id=3D"ref-for-html-document=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">HTML document</a>,=
 then set <var>qualifiedName</var> to <var>qualifiedName</var> in
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-low=
ercase" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-lowercase=E2=91=A2">ASCII lowercase</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return the first <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=E2=91=A1=
=E2=91=A7">attribute</a> in <var>element</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-attribute" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attribute=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">attribute list</a>
 whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conce=
pt-attribute-qualified-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-qualified-name=
=E2=91=A1">qualified name</a> is <var>qualifiedName</var>; otherwise null.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"get an attribute by namespace=
 and local name">
    <p>To
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-element-attributes-get-by-namespace">get an attribute by namespace and=
 local name</dfn>
given null or a string <var>namespace</var>, a string <var>localName</var>,=
 and an
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A4">element</a> <var>elem=
ent</var>:

