 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-att=
ribute-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-namespace=E2=91=A8">names=
pace</a> is <var>namespace</var> and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concep=
