   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"get an attribute value">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"concept-element-attributes-get-value">get an attribute value</dfn> g=
iven an
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A5">element</a> <var>elem=
ent</var>, a string <var>localName</var>, and an optional null or
