 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>attr</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-concep=
t-attribute-value=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">value</a>.
