   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"set an attribute">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"concept-element-attributes-set">set an attribute</dfn> given an
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attr=
ibute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=E2=91=A2=E2=93=AA">attribute</a> <va=
r>attr</var> and an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A6">e=
lement</a> <var>element</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>verifiedValue</var> be the result of calling
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist=
/spec/#get-trusted-type-compliant-attribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-get-truste=
d-type-compliant-attribute-value">get trusted type compliant attribute valu=
e</a> with <var>attr</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-att=
ribute-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-local-name=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A0">local name</a>, <var>attr</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-namespace" id=3D"re=
f-for-concept-attribute-namespace=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">namespace</a>, <var>el=
ement</var>, and
 <var>attr</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-val=
ue=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">value</a>. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-trusted-types" title=3D"Trusted Types">[TRUS=
TED-TYPES]</a>

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>attr</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
attribute-element=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">element</a> is neither null nor <var>e=
lement</var>,
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-thro=
w" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A3">throw</a> an "<code class=3D"=
idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" href=3D"https://web=
idl.spec.whatwg.org/#inuseattributeerror" id=3D"ref-for-inuseattributeerror=
">InUseAttributeError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"=
idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A7">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>oldAttr</var> be the result of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ele=
ment-attributes-get-by-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-=
get-by-namespace=E2=91=A0">getting an attribute</a> given
 <var>attr</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=
-namespace=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">namespace</a>, <var>attr</var>=E2=80=99s <a d=
ata-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribut=
e-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-local-name=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1"=
>local name</a>, and
 <var>element</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>oldAttr</var> is <var>attr</var>, return <var>attr</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>attr</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-a=
ttribute-value=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">value</a> to <var>verifiedValue</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>oldAttr</var> is non-null, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-attributes-replace" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-replace">replace</a>
 <var>oldAttr</var> with <var>attr</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Otherwise, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-element-attributes-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-at=
tributes-append=E2=91=A0">append</a> <var>attr</var> to <var>element</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>oldAttr</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"set an attribute value">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"concept-element-attributes-set-value">set an attribute value</dfn> g=
iven an
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A7">element</a> <var>elem=
ent</var>, a string <var>localName</var>, a string <var>value</var>,
an optional null or string <var>prefix</var> (default null), and an optiona=
l null or string
<var>namespace</var> (default null):

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>Let <var>attribute</var> be the result of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ele=
ment-attributes-get-by-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-=
get-by-namespace=E2=91=A1">getting an attribute</a> given
 <var>namespace</var>, <var>localName</var>, and <var>element</var>.

=20
     </li><li>If <var>attribute</var> is null, then <a data-link-type=3D"df=
n" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-attributes-append" =
id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-append=E2=91=A1">append</a> the re=
sult of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#create-an-a=
ttribute" id=3D"ref-for-create-an-attribute=E2=91=A1">creating an attribute=
</a> given <var>element</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-no=
de-document=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A2">node document</a>,
 <var>localName</var>, <var>namespace</var>, <var>prefix</var>, and <var>va=
lue</var> to
 <var>element</var>, and then return.

=20
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-element-attributes-change" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-ch=
ange">Change</a> <var>attribute</var> to <var>value</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"remove an attribute by name">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"concept-element-attributes-remove-by-name">remove an attribute by na=
me</dfn>
given a string <var>qualifiedName</var> and an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-e=
lement=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A8">element</a> <var>element</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>attr</var> be the result of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ele=
ment-attributes-get-by-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-get-b=
y-name">getting an attribute</a> given <var>qualifiedName</var> and
 <var>element</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>attr</var> is non-null, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-attributes-remove" id=3D"=
ref-for-concept-element-attributes-remove">remove</a> <var>attr</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>attr</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"remove an attribute by namesp=
ace and local name">
    <p>To
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-element-attributes-remove-by-namespace">remove an attribute by namespa=
ce and local name</dfn>
given null or a string <var>namespace</var>, a string <var>localName</var>,=
 and an
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A8=E2=93=AA">element</a> <var>elem=
ent</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>attr</var> be the result of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ele=
ment-attributes-get-by-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-=
get-by-namespace=E2=91=A2">getting an attribute</a> given
 <var>namespace</var>, <var>localName</var>, and <var>element</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>attr</var> is non-null, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-attributes-remove" id=3D"=
ref-for-concept-element-attributes-remove=E2=91=A0">remove</a> <var>attr</v=
ar>.

 </p>
