</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data=
-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-element-classname"><code=
>className</code></dfn> attribute must
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-refl=
ect" id=3D"ref-for-concept-reflect=E2=91=A0">reflect</a> "<code>class</code=
>".

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data=
-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-element-classlist"><code=
