</code> object whose associated <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A8=
=E2=91=A5">element</a> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.=
spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7=E2=93=AA">this<=
/a> and whose associated
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attr=
ibute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A2">attribute</a>=E2=
=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-attribute-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-local-name=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A2">local name</a> is <code>class</code>. The <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-dtl-tokens" id=3D"ref=
-for-concept-dtl-tokens">token set</a> of this
particular <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist=E2=91=A2">DOMTo=
kenList</a></code> object are also known as the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" h=
ref=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
element=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A6">element</a>=E2=80=99s
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" d=
ata-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"class" id=3D"concept-class">classes</dfn>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data=
