</code></dfn> attribute must <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#concept-reflect" id=3D"ref-for-concept-reflect=E2=91=A1">r=
eflect</a>
"<code>slot</code>".

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><code>id</code>, <code>class</code>, and=
 <code>slot</code> are effectively
superglobal attributes as they can appear on any element, regardless of tha=
t element=E2=80=99s
namespace.

</p>
