   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"setAttribute(qualifiedName, v=
alue)" data-algorithm-for=3D"Element">
    <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-type=
=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-element-setattribute"><code>setAttri=
bute(<var>qualifiedName</var>, <var>value</var>)</code></dfn>
