</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>qualifiedName</var> is not a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-attribute-local-name" id=3D"ref-for=
-valid-attribute-local-name=E2=91=A1">valid attribute local name</a>, then =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw=
" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A4">throw</a> an
  "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" h=
ref=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidcharactererror" id=3D"ref-for=
-invalidcharactererror=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">InvalidCharacterError</a></code>"=
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.=
whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A5=E2=91=
=A8">DOMException</a></code>.

  </p>
      <p class=3D"note" id=3D"node-setAttribute-qualifiedName" role=3D"note=
"><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#node-setAttri=
bute-qualifiedName"></a>Despite the parameter naming,
  <var>qualifiedName</var> is only used as a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-qualified-name" id=3D"re=
f-for-concept-attribute-qualified-name=E2=91=A8">qualified name</a> if an <=
a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attri=
bute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A5">attribute</a> alre=
ady
  exists with that qualified name. Otherwise, it is used as the <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-local=
-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-local-name=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">local =
name</a> of the new
  attribute. We only need to validate it for the latter case.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A4">this</a> is in the =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-names=
pace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">HTML namespace</a> an=
d its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A3">nod=
e document</a> is an
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#html-docume=
nt" id=3D"ref-for-html-document=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">HTML document</a>, then =
set <var>qualifiedName</var> to <var>qualifiedName</var> in
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-low=
ercase" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-lowercase=E2=91=A3">ASCII lowercase</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>verifiedValue</var> be the result of calling
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist=
/spec/#get-trusted-type-compliant-attribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-get-truste=
d-type-compliant-attribute-value=E2=91=A0">get trusted type compliant attri=
bute value</a> with <var>qualifiedName</var>, null, <a data-link-type=3D"df=
n" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A5">this</a>,
 and <var>value</var>. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#biblio-trusted-types" title=3D"Trusted Types">[TRUSTED-TYPES]=
</a>

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>attribute</var> be the first <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept=
-attribute=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A6">attribute</a> in <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A7=E2=91=A6">this</a>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ele=
ment-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attribute=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">=
attribute list</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-qualified-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attrib=
ute-qualified-name=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">qualified name</a> is <var>qualifiedN=
ame</var>,
 and null otherwise.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>attribute</var> is non-null, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-attributes-change" i=
d=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-change=E2=91=A0">change</a>
 <var>attribute</var> to <var>verifiedValue</var> and return.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>attribute</var> to the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#create-an-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-c=
reate-an-attribute=E2=91=A2">creating an attribute</a> given <a data-link-t=
ype=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-thi=
s=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A7">this</a>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-nod=
e-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A4">node doc=
ument</a>, <var>qualifiedName</var>, null, null, and <var>verifiedValue</va=
r>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-element-attributes-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-ap=
pend=E2=91=A2">Append</a> <var>attribute</var> to <a data-link-type=3D"dfn"=
 href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A8">this</a>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"setAttributeNS(namespace, qua=
lifiedName, value)" data-algorithm-for=3D"Element">
    <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-type=
=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-element-setattributens"><code>setAtt=
ributeNS(<var>namespace</var>, <var>qualifiedName</var>, <var>value</var>)<=
