=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8=E2=93=AA">this</a>, and <var>value</var>=
. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-=
trusted-types" title=3D"Trusted Types">[TRUSTED-TYPES]</a>

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-element-attributes-set-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes=
-set-value=E2=91=A0">Set an attribute value</a> for <a data-link-type=3D"df=
n" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A0">this</a> using <var>localName</var>,
 <var>verifiedValue</var>, <var>prefix</var>, and <var>namespace</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
