ec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A4">this</a=
> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-el=
ement-attribute-has" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attribute-has=E2=91=A4">=
has</a> an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A7">attrib=
ute</a> whose
