<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw=
" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A5">throw</a> an
  "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" h=
ref=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidcharactererror" id=3D"ref-for=
-invalidcharactererror=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">InvalidCharacterError</a></code>"=
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.=
whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A6=E2=93=
=AA">DOMException</a></code>.

  </p>
      <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">See <a href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#node-setAttribute-qualifiedName">the discussion above</a> about why
  we validate it as a local name, instead of a qualified name.

