<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-names=
pace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A6">HTML namespace</a> an=
d its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A6">nod=
e document</a> is an
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#html-docume=
nt" id=3D"ref-for-html-document=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">HTML document</a>, then =
