       <li>
        <p>If <var>force</var> is not given or is true, then <a data-link-t=
ype=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-attributes=
-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-append=E2=91=A3">append</=
a>
   the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#create-an-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-create-an-attribute=E2=91=A3">creat=
ing an attribute</a> given <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl=
.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A7">this=
</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#concept-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A3=E2=
=91=A7">node document</a> and
