bidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A8">=
this</a>, and then return true.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Return false.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>force</var> is not given or is false,
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ele=
ment-attributes-remove-by-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-re=
