   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"Element/matches(selectors)">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-element-matches"><code>mat=
ches(<var>selectors</var>)</code></dfn> and
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-type=
=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-element-webkitmatchesselector"><code=
>webkitMatchesSelector(<var>selectors</var>)</code></dfn> method steps
are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>selector</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn"=
 href=3D"https://drafts.csswg.org/selectors-4/#parse-a-selector" id=3D"ref-=
for-parse-a-selector=E2=91=A1">parse a selector</a> from <var>selectors</va=
r>.
 <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-s=
electors4" title=3D"Selectors Level 4">[SELECTORS4]</a>

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>selector</var> is failure, then <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=
=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A3">throw</a> a "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" =
data-link-type=3D"exception" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#syntax=
error" id=3D"ref-for-syntaxerror=E2=91=A1">SyntaxError</a></code>"
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.=
whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A6=E2=91=
=A7">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://drafts.=
csswg.org/selectors-4/#match-a-selector-against-an-element" id=3D"ref-for-m=
atch-a-selector-against-an-element=E2=91=A0">match a selector against an el=
ement</a>, using <var>selector</var>,
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">this</a>, and <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://drafts.csswg.org/selectors-4/#scoping-root" id=3D=
"ref-for-scoping-root=E2=91=A1">scoping root</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=
=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">this</a>, returns success, then return true; otherwise,
 return false. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#biblio-selectors4" title=3D"Selectors Level 4">[SELECTORS4]</a>
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <hr>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data=
-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-element-getelementsbytagnam=
e"><code>getElementsByTagName(<var>qualifiedName</var>)</code></dfn>
