telementsbytagnamens=E2=91=A0">list of elements with namespace <var>namespa=
ce</var> and local
name <var>localName</var></a> for <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:/=
/webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A6">this</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data=
-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-element-getelementsbyclassn=
ame"><code>getElementsByClassName(<var>classNames</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are to return the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-getelementsbyclassname" id=3D"ref-for-concept-ge=
telementsbyclassname=E2=91=A0">list of elements with class names <var>class=
Names</var></a> for
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">this</a>.

</p>
   <hr>
   <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"=
" id=3D"insert-adjacent">insert adjacent</dfn>, given an <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-concept-element=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA=E2=93=AA">element</a> <var>element</var=
>, string
<var>where</var>, and a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5=E2=
=91=A4">node</a> <var>node</var>, run the steps associated with the first
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-case=
-insensitive" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-case-insensitive=E2=91=A1">ASCII case-ins=
ensitive</a> match for <var>where</var>:

</p>
   <dl class=3D"switch">
    <dt>"<code>beforebegin</code>"
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>If <var>element</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=
-parent=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A3">parent</a> is null, return null.

  </p>
     <p>Return the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-pre-insert" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-pre-in=
sert=E2=91=A6">pre-inserting</a> <var>node</var> into <var>element</var>=E2=
=80=99s
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A4">parent</a> =
before <var>element</var>.

 </p>
    </dd><dt>"<code>afterbegin</code>"
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Return the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-pre-insert" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-pre-in=
sert=E2=91=A7">pre-inserting</a> <var>node</var> into <var>element</var> be=
fore
 <var>element</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-first-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-firs=
t-child=E2=91=A4">first child</a>.

 </p>
    </dd><dt>"<code>beforeend</code>"
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Return the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-pre-insert" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-pre-in=
sert=E2=91=A8">pre-inserting</a> <var>node</var> into <var>element</var> be=
fore
 null.

 </p>
    </dd><dt>"<code>afterend</code>"
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>If <var>element</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=
-parent=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A5">parent</a> is null, return null.

  </p>
     <p>Return the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-pre-insert" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-pre-in=
sert=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">pre-inserting</a> <var>node</var> into <var>element=
</var>=E2=80=99s
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A6">parent</a> =
before <var>element</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-next-sibling" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tr=
ee-next-sibling=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">next sibling</a>.

 </p>
    </dd><dt>Otherwise
    </dt><dd>
     <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#d=
fn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A4">Throw</a> a "<code cla=
ss=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" href=3D"https=
://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#syntaxerror" id=3D"ref-for-syntaxerror=E2=91=A2"=
>SyntaxError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOM=
Exception=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A8">DOMException</a></code>.
</p>
   </dd></dl>
   <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-type=
=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-element-insertadjacentelement"><code=
>insertAdjacentElement(<var>where</var>, <var>element</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are to return the result of running <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#insert-adjacent" id=3D"ref-for-insert-=
adjacent">insert adjacent</a>, give <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A8">this</a>,
<var>where</var>, and <var>element</var>.

</p>
   <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Element" data-dfn-type=
=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-element-insertadjacenttext"><code>in=
sertAdjacentText(<var>where</var>, <var>data</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>Let <var>text</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-text-node" id=3D"ref-for-create-a=
-text-node=E2=91=A3">creating a text node</a> given <a data-link-type=3D"df=
n" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=
=A1=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">this</a>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-nod=
e-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A1">node doc=
ument</a> and <var>data</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Run <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
insert-adjacent" id=3D"ref-for-insert-adjacent=E2=91=A0">insert adjacent</a=
>, given <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#=
this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">this</a>, <var>where</=
var>, and <var>text</var>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">This method returns nothing because it e=
xisted before we had a chance to design it.


</p>
