ported-property-names=E2=91=A0">supported property names</a> are the return=
 value of running these
steps:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>Let <var>names</var> be the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-qualified-name" id=3D"ref-for-con=
cept-attribute-qualified-name=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">qualified names</a> of the=
