ribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A0">attributes</a> i=
n this
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#namednodemap" id=3D"ref-for-namednodemap=E2=91=A7">NamedNodeMap</a=
></code> object=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#concept-namednodemap-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-namedno=
demap-attribute=E2=91=A4">attribute list</a>, with duplicates omitted, in
 order.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>If this <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#namednodemap" id=3D"ref-for-namednodemap=E2=91=A8">=
NamedNodeMap</a></code> object=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-namednodemap-element" id=3D"ref-for-co=
ncept-namednodemap-element=E2=91=A0">element</a> is in the
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-nam=
espace" id=3D"ref-for-html-namespace=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A8">HTML namespace</a> =
and its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A2">n=
ode document</a> is an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#html-document" id=3D"ref-for-html-document=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">HT=
ML document</a>, then
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-ite=
rate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">for each</a> <var>name<=
/var> of <var>names</var>:

  </p>
     <ol>
      <li>
       <p>Let <var>lowercaseName</var> be <var>name</var>, in <a data-link-=
type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-lowercase" id=3D"=
ref-for-ascii-lowercase=E2=91=A6">ASCII lowercase</a>.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>If <var>lowercaseName</var> is not equal to <var>name</var>, remo=
ve <var>name</var> from
   <var>names</var>.
  </p>
     </li></ol>
    </li><li>
     <p>Return <var>names</var>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
