   <p><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#attr" id=3D"ref-for-attr=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A6">Attr</a></code> <=
a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node"=
 id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A5">nodes</a> are simpl=
y known as
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" data-lt=
=3D"attribute" id=3D"concept-attribute">attributes</dfn>. They are sometime=
s referred
to as <em>content attributes</em> to avoid confusion with IDL attributes.

</p>
   <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A1">Attributes<=
/a> have a
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data=
-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-attribute-namespace">namespace</dfn> (null or a =
non-empty string),
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data=
-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-attribute-namespace-prefix">namespace prefix</df=
n> (null or a non-empty string),
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data=
-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-attribute-local-name">local name</dfn> (a non-em=
pty string),
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data=
-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-attribute-value">value</dfn> (a string), and
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data=
-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-attribute-element">element</dfn> (null or an
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A1">element</a>)=
.</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">If designed today they would just have a=
 name and value. =E2=98=B9

</p>
   <p>An <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A2">attribut=
e</a>=E2=80=99s
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data=
-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-attribute-qualified-name">qualified name</dfn> i=
s its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attr=
ibute-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-local-name=E2=91=A1=E2=93=
=AA">local name</a> if its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-concept-at=
tribute-namespace-prefix=E2=91=A3">namespace prefix</a> is null, and its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attr=
ibute-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-namespace-prefix=E2=
=91=A4">namespace prefix</a>, followed by "<code>:</code>", followed by its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attr=
ibute-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-local-name=E2=91=A1=E2=91=
=A0">local name</a>, otherwise.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">User agents could have this as an intern=
al slot as an optimization.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"create an attribute">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"create-an-attribute">create an attribute</dfn> given a <a data-link-=
type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document" id=3D"r=
ef-for-concept-document=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A5">document</a> <var>document</var>=
, a
string <var>localName</var>, and optionally a string-or-null <var>namespace=
</var> (default null), a
string-or-null <var>prefix</var> (default null), and a string <var>value</v=
ar> (default the empty
string):

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>attribute</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-node" id=3D"ref-for-create-=
a-node=E2=91=A5">creating a node</a> that implements <code class=3D"idl"><a=
 data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#attr" id=3D"re=
f-for-attr=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A7">Attr</a></code>,
 given <var>document</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>attribute</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-namespace" id=3D"ref-for=
-concept-attribute-namespace=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">namespace</a> to <var>names=
pace</var>,
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-att=
ribute-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-namespace-prefix=
=E2=91=A5">namespace prefix</a> to <var>prefix</var>, <a data-link-type=3D"=
dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-local-name" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-local-name=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">local name</a> =
to
 <var>localName</var>, and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-val=
ue=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">value</a> to <var>value</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>attribute</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <p>An
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" data-lt=
=3D"named attribute" id=3D"concept-named-attribute"><code><var>A</var></cod=
e> attribute</dfn>
is an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A3">attribute</=
a> whose
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attr=
ibute-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-local-name=E2=91=A1=E2=91=
=A2">local name</a> is
<code><var>A</var></code> and whose
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attr=
ibute-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-namespace=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A7">namespace</a> and
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attr=
ibute-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-namespace-prefix=E2=
=91=A6">namespace prefix</a> are
null.

</p>
   <hr>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-df=
n-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-attr-namespaceuri"><code>na=
mespaceURI</code></dfn> getter steps are to return
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-names=
pace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-namespace=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">namespac=
e</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-df=
n-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-attr-prefix"><code>prefix</=
code></dfn> getter steps are to return <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1=E2=
=91=A4">this</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attr=
ibute-namespace-prefix" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-namespace-prefix=E2=
=91=A7">namespace prefix</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-df=
n-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-attr-localname"><code>local=
Name</code></dfn> getter steps are to return
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-local=
-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-local-name=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">local =
name</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-df=
n-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-attr-name"><code>name</code=
></dfn> getter steps are to return <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1=E2=91=
=A6">this</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attr=
ibute-qualified-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-qualified-name=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A3">qualified name</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-df=
n-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-attr-value"><code>value</co=
de></dfn> getter steps are to return <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1=E2=
=91=A7">this</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attr=
ibute-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-value=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">value=
</a>.

</p>
   <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"=
" id=3D"set-an-existing-attribute-value">set an existing attribute value</d=
fn>, given an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#concept-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A4">att=
ribute</a> <var>attribute</var> and
string <var>value</var>, run these steps:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>If <var>attribute</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-element" id=3D"ref-for-conc=
ept-attribute-element=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">element</a> is null, then set <var=
>attribute</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-att=
ribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-value=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">valu=
e</a> to <var>value</var> and return.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Let <var>element</var> be <var>attribute</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-elem=
ent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-element=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">element</a>=
.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Let <var>verifiedValue</var> be the result of calling
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io/trusted-types/dist=
/spec/#get-trusted-type-compliant-attribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-get-truste=
d-type-compliant-attribute-value=E2=91=A2">get trusted type compliant attri=
bute value</a> with <var>attribute</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-att=
ribute-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-local-name=E2=91=A1=E2=
=91=A4">local name</a>, <var>attribute</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D=
"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-namespace" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-namespace=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">namespace</a>, <=
var>element</var>,
 and <var>value</var>. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#biblio-trusted-types" title=3D"Trusted Types">[TRUSTED-TYPES]=
</a>

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>If <var>attribute</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-element" id=3D"ref-for-conc=
ept-attribute-element=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">element</a> is null, then set <var=
>attribute</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-att=
ribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-value=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A6">valu=
e</a> to <var>verifiedValue</var> and return.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-element-attributes-change" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-cha=
nge=E2=91=A1">Change</a> <var>attribute</var> to <var>verifiedValue</var>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p>The <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-attr-value" id=3D"ref-for-dom-attr-value=E2=91=A0">va=
lue</a></code> setter steps are to <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#set-an-existing-attribute-value" id=3D"ref-for-set-a=
n-existing-attribute-value=E2=91=A1">set an existing attribute value</a> wi=
th <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" =
id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A8">this</a>
and the given value.

</p>
   <hr>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-df=
n-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-attr-ownerelement"><code>ow=
nerElement</code></dfn> getter steps are to return
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
