k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-eleme=
nt" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-element=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">element</a>.

</p>
   <hr>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Attr" data-df=
n-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-attr-specified"><code>speci=
