   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#characterdata" id=3D"ref-for-cha=
racterdata=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">CharacterData</a></code> is an abstract inter=
face. You cannot get a direct instance of it. It
is used by <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">Text</a></co=
de>, <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#processinginstruction" id=3D"ref-for-processinginstruction=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A2">ProcessingInstruction</a></code>, and <code class=3D"idl">=
<a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#comment" id=
=3D"ref-for-comment=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">Comment</a></code> <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A6">nodes</a>.

</p>
   <p>Each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A7">node</a=
> inheriting from the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#characterdata" id=3D"ref-for-characterdata=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A7">CharacterData</a></code> interface has an associated mutab=
le
string called <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"CharacterData" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-cd-data">data</dfn>.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"replace data">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"concept-cd-replace">replace data</dfn> of a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A8">node</a> <var>node</var>
with an integer <var>offset</var>, integer <var>count</var>, string <var>da=
ta</var>, and an optional
boolean <var>piAttributesAlreadyUpdated</var> (default false):

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>length</var> be <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-length" id=3D"=
ref-for-concept-node-length=E2=91=A4">length</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>offset</var> is greater than <var>length</var>, then <a da=
ta-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw" id=
=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A7">throw</a> an
 "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" hr=
ef=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#indexsizeerror" id=3D"ref-for-indexsi=
zeerror">IndexSizeError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"re=
f-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A1">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>offset</var> + <var>count</var> is greater than <var>lengt=
h</var>, then set
 <var>count</var> to <var>length</var> =E2=88=92 <var>offset</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#que=
ue-a-mutation-record" id=3D"ref-for-queue-a-mutation-record=E2=91=A1">Queue=
 a mutation record</a> of "<code>characterData</code>" for <var>node</var> =
with
 null, null, <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-cd-data" id=3D"ref-for-concept-cd-data=
=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">data</a>, =C2=AB =C2=BB, =C2=AB =C2=BB, null, and null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Insert <var>data</var> into <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link=
-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-cd-data" id=3D"r=
ef-for-concept-cd-data=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">data</a> after
 <var>offset</var> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.wha=
twg.org/#code-unit" id=3D"ref-for-code-unit">code units</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>deleteOffset</var> be <var>offset</var> + <var>data</var>=
=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-le=
ngth" id=3D"ref-for-string-length=E2=91=A3">length</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Starting from <var>deleteOffset</var> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-unit" id=3D"ref-for-code-unit=E2=
=91=A0">code units</a>, remove <var>count</var>
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-unit=
" id=3D"ref-for-code-unit=E2=91=A1">code units</a> from <var>node</var>=E2=
=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-cd-data" id=3D"ref-for-concept-cd-data=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">data</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>For each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A8">live r=
ange</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#concept-range-start-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-node=E2=91=
=A5">start node</a> is <var>node</var> and
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ran=
ge-start-offset" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-offset=E2=91=A6">start o=
ffset</a> is greater than <var>offset</var> but less than or equal to
 <var>offset</var> + <var>count</var>: set its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-start-offset" id=3D"ref-fo=
r-concept-range-start-offset=E2=91=A7">start offset</a> to <var>offset</var=
>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>For each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A0=E2=93=
=AA">live range</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-node=
=E2=91=A5">end node</a> is <var>node</var> and
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ran=
ge-end-offset" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-offset=E2=91=A6">end offset<=
/a> is greater than <var>offset</var> but less than or equal to
 <var>offset</var> + <var>count</var>: set its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end-offset" id=3D"ref-for-=
concept-range-end-offset=E2=91=A7">end offset</a> to <var>offset</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>For each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A0">live range</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#concept-range-start-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-n=
ode=E2=91=A6">start node</a> is <var>node</var> and
