ge-start-offset" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-offset=E2=91=A8">start o=
ffset</a> is greater than <var>offset</var> + <var>count</var>: increase it=
s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ran=
ge-start-offset" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-offset=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA=
">start offset</a> by <var>data</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" h=
ref=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-length" id=3D"ref-for-string-l=
ength=E2=91=A4">length</a> and decrease it by
 <var>count</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>For each <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A1">live range</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-node=
=E2=91=A6">end node</a> is <var>node</var> and
