not contain duplicates.

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>pi</var> . <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"=
method" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-processinginstruction-geta=
ttribute" id=3D"ref-for-dom-processinginstruction-getattribute=E2=91=A0">ge=
tAttribute</a>(<var>name</var>)</code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
