ttribute" id=3D"ref-for-dom-processinginstruction-setattribute=E2=91=A0">se=
tAttribute</a>(<var>name</var>, <var>value</var>)</code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Sets <var>pi</var>=E2=80=99s attribute named <var>name</var> to <va=
r>value</var>.

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>pi</var> . <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"=
