veattribute" id=3D"ref-for-dom-processinginstruction-removeattribute=E2=91=
=A0">removeAttribute</a>(<var>name</var>)</code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Removes <var>pi</var>=E2=80=99s attribute named <var>name</var>.

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>pi</var> . <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"=
method" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-processinginstruction-togg=
leattribute" id=3D"ref-for-dom-processinginstruction-toggleattribute=E2=91=
=A0">toggleAttribute</a>(<var>name</var> [, <var>force</var>])</code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>If <var>force</var> is not given, "toggles" <var>name</var>, removi=
ng it if it is
  present and adding it if it is not present. If <var>force</var> is true, =
adds
  <var>name</var>. If <var>force</var> is false, removes <var>name</var>.

  </p>
     <p>Returns true if <var>name</var> is now present; otherwise false.

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>pi</var> . <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"=
