ttribute" id=3D"ref-for-dom-processinginstruction-hasattribute=E2=91=A0">ha=
sAttribute</a>(<var>name</var>)</code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Returns true if <var>pi</var> has an attribute named <var>name</var=
>; otherwise false.
</p>
   </dd></dl>
