 "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" hr=
ef=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidcharactererror" id=3D"ref-for-=
invalidcharactererror=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">InvalidCharacterError</a></code>" =
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A7=E2=91=
=A7">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>attributes</var> be <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4=E2=
=91=A4">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-pi-attribute-map" id=3D"ref-for-concept-pi-attribute=
-map=E2=91=A7">attribute map</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>attributes</var>[<var>name</var>] does not <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-exists" id=3D"ref-for=
-map-exists=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">exist</a>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>If <var>force</var> is not given or is true, <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-set" id=3D"ref-for-map-=
set=E2=91=A5">set</a>
   <var>attributes</var>[<var>name</var>] to the empty string, <a data-link=
-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#update-data-from-attribu=
tes" id=3D"ref-for-update-data-from-attributes=E2=91=A1">update data from a=
ttributes</a>
   given <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#=
this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A5">this</a>, and then ret=
urn true.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Return false.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>force</var> is not given or is false, <a data-link-type=3D=
"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-remove" id=3D"ref-for-map-=
remove=E2=91=A1">remove</a>
 <var>attributes</var>[<var>name</var>], <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#update-data-from-attributes" id=3D"ref-for-upd=
ate-data-from-attributes=E2=91=A2">update data from attributes</a> given <a=
 data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D=
"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A6">this</a>, and
 then return false.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return true.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"hasAttribute(name)" data-algo=
rithm-for=3D"ProcessingInstruction">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"ProcessingIn=
struction" data-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-processingin=
struction-hasattribute"><code>hasAttribute(<var>name</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are to return true if <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4=E2=91=
=A7">this</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-pi-a=
ttribute-map" id=3D"ref-for-concept-pi-attribute-map=E2=91=A8">attribute ma=
p</a>[<var>name</var>] <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec=
.whatwg.org/#list-contain" id=3D"ref-for-list-contain=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">ex=
ists</a>; otherwise
false.
</p>
   </div>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"4.14" id=3D"interface-commen=
t"><span class=3D"secno">4.14. </span><span class=3D"content">Interface <co=
