" data-link-type=3D"interface" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-=
DOMString" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMString=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2=E2=93=AA"><c- b=3D=
"">DOMString</c-></a> <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"C=
omment/Comment(data), Comment/constructor(data), Comment/Comment(), Comment=
/constructor()" data-dfn-type=3D"argument" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-comme=
nt-comment-data-data"><code><c- g=3D"">data</c-></code></dfn> =3D "");
};
</pre>
   <dl class=3D"domintro">
    <dt><code><var>comment</var> =3D new <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-ty=
pe=3D"constructor" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-comment-comment=
" id=3D"ref-for-dom-comment-comment=E2=91=A0">Comment([<var>data</var> =3D =
""])</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dd>Returns a new <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#comment" id=3D"ref-for-comment=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A4">Comment</a></code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A8=E2=91=A2">node</a> whose
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-cd-=
data" id=3D"ref-for-concept-cd-data=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A3">data</a> is <var>dat=
a</var>.

   </dd></dl>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"create a comment node">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 id=3D"create-a-comment-node">create a comment node</dfn> given a <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-document=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A8">document</a> <var>document<=
/var> and
a string <var>data</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>comment</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-node" id=3D"ref-for-create-a-=
node=E2=91=A8">creating a node</a> that implements <code class=3D"idl"><a d=
ata-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#comment" id=3D"r=
ef-for-comment=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">Comment</a></code>,
 given <var>document</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>comment</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-cd-data" id=3D"ref-for-concept-cd-dat=
a=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A4">data</a> to <var>data</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>comment</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"Comment(data)" data-algorithm=
-for=3D"Comment">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Comment" dat=
a-dfn-type=3D"constructor" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"Comment(data)|constr=
uctor(data)|Comment()|constructor()" id=3D"dom-comment-comment"><code>new C=
omment(<var>data</var>)</code></dfn>
constructor steps are to set <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webi=
dl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A8">th=
is</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-cd-data" id=3D"ref-for-concept-cd-data=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A5">data=
</a> to <var>data</var> and
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5=E2=93=AA">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document" =
id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-document=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A6">node document</a> to=
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/w=
ebappapis.html#current-global-object" id=3D"ref-for-current-global-object=
=E2=91=A3">current global object</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/na=
v-history-apis.html#concept-document-window" id=3D"ref-for-concept-document=
-window=E2=91=A4">associated <code>Document</code></a>.
</p>
   </div>
   <h2 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"5" id=3D"ranges"><span class=
=3D"secno">5. </span><span class=3D"content">Ranges</span><a class=3D"self-=
link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#ranges"></a></h2>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"5.1" id=3D"introduction-to-d=
om-ranges"><span class=3D"secno">5.1. </span><span class=3D"content">Introd=
uction to "DOM Ranges"</span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#introduction-to-dom-ranges"></a></h3>
   <p><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#staticrange" id=3D"ref-for-staticrange">StaticRange</a></code=
> and <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#range" id=3D"ref-for-range=E2=91=A0">Range</a></code> objects=
 (<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ra=
nge" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range">ranges</a>) represent a sequence of conte=
nt within a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">node tree</a>. Ea=
ch <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-r=
ange" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range=E2=91=A0">range</a> has a <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-start" id=3D"=
ref-for-concept-range-start=E2=91=A0">start</a> and an <a data-link-type=3D=
"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end" id=3D"ref-for=
-concept-range-end=E2=91=A0">end</a> which
are <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-=
range-bp" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp">boundary points</a>. A <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-bp" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp=E2=91=A0">boundary point</a> is a <a data-link=
-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#tuple" id=3D"ref-for-t=
uple">tuple</a> consisting of a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#boundary-poi=
nt-node" id=3D"ref-for-boundary-point-node">node</a> and an <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-bp-offset" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp-offset">offset</a>. So in other words, a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-rang=
e" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range=E2=91=A1">range</a> represents a piece of co=
ntent within a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#concept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">no=
de tree</a> between two
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-rang=
e-bp" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp=E2=91=A1">boundary points</a>.

</p>
   <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range=E2=91=A2">Ranges</a> are frequently us=
ed in editing for selecting and copying content.

</p>
   <ul class=3D"domTree">
    <li class=3D"t1">
     <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A0">Element</a><=
/code>: <code>p</code>
 =20
     <ul>
      <li class=3D"t1"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A4=E2=
=91=A1">Element</a></code>: <code class=3D"highlight lang-markup"><c- p=3D"=
">&lt;</c-><c- f=3D"">img</c-> <c- e=3D"">src</c-><c- o=3D"">=3D</c-><c- s=
=3D"">"insanity-wolf"</c-> <c- e=3D"">alt</c-><c- o=3D"">=3D</c-><c- s=3D""=
>"Little-endian BOM; decode as big-endian!"</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c-></code>
  =20
      </li><li class=3D"t3"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" h=
ref=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A2=E2=91=
=A8">Text</a></code>: <span>&nbsp;CSS 2.1 syndata is&nbsp;</span>
  =20
      </li><li class=3D"t1">
       <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#element" id=3D"ref-for-element=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A2">Element</a=
></code>: <code class=3D"highlight lang-markup"><c- p=3D"">&lt;</c-><c- f=
=3D"">em</c-><c- p=3D"">&gt;</c-></code>
   =20
       <ul>
        <li class=3D"t3"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A3=E2=93=AA=
">Text</a></code>: <span>awesome</span>
   =20
       </li></ul>
      </li><li class=3D"t3"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" h=
ref=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A3=E2=91=
=A0">Text</a></code>: <span>!</span>
 =20
     </li></ul>
   </li></ul>
   <p>In the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/=
#concept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A6">node=
 tree</a> above, a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-rang=
e" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range=E2=91=A3">range</a> can be used to represent=
 the sequence
=E2=80=9Csyndata is awes=E2=80=9D. Assuming <var>p</var> is assigned to the
<code>p</code> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#concept-element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA=E2=91=
=A2">element</a>, and
<var>em</var> to the <code>em</code>
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A3">element</a>,=
 this would be done as follows:

</p>
<pre class=3D"highlight lang-javascript"><code><c- a=3D"">var</c-> range <c=
- o=3D"">=3D</c-> <c- ow=3D"">new</c-> Range<c- p=3D"">(),</c->
    firstText <c- o=3D"">=3D</c-> p<c- p=3D"">.</c->childNodes<c- p=3D"">[<=
/c-><c- mf=3D"">1</c-><c- p=3D"">],</c->
    secondText <c- o=3D"">=3D</c-> em<c- p=3D"">.</c->firstChild
range<c- p=3D"">.</c->setStart<c- p=3D"">(</c->firstText<c- p=3D"">,</c-> <=
c- mf=3D"">9</c-><c- p=3D"">)</c-> <c- c1=3D"">// do not forget the leading=
 space</c->
range<c- p=3D"">.</c->setEnd<c- p=3D"">(</c->secondText<c- p=3D"">,</c-> <c=
- mf=3D"">4</c-><c- p=3D"">)</c->
<c- c1=3D"">// range now stringifies to the aforementioned quote</c->
</code></pre>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=
=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A5">Attributes</a> such as <code>src</code> and <code>alt</=
code> in the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A7">node tree</a> abo=
ve cannot be represented by a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range=E2=91=A4">rang=
e</a>. <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conce=
pt-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range=E2=91=A5">Ranges</a> are only useful =
for
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A3">nodes</a>.

</p>
   <p><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#range" id=3D"ref-for-range=E2=91=A1">Range</a></code> objects=
, unlike <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#staticrange" id=3D"ref-for-staticrange=E2=91=A0">StaticRan=
ge</a></code> objects, are affected by mutations to the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A8">node tree</a>. Th=
erefore they are also known as <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A6">live ranges</a>. Such mutations will not
invalidate them and will try to ensure that it still represents the same pi=
ece of content.
Necessarily, a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">=
live range</a> might itself be modified as part of the mutation to the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A2=E2=93=AA">node tree</a> whe=
n, e.g., part of the content it represents is mutated.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">See the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-insert" id=3D"ref-for-concept=
-node-insert=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">insert</a> and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-remove" id=3D"ref-for-conce=
pt-node-remove=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">remove</a> algorithms, the
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-node-normalize" id=3D"ref-for-dom-node-normalize=E2=91=A1">norm=
alize()</a></code> method, and the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-cd-replace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-cd-replace=
=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">replace data</a> and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-text-split" id=3D"ref-for-concept-text=
-split=E2=91=A0">split</a>
algorithms for details.

</p>
   <p>Updating <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">=
live ranges</a> in response to <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=
=A2=E2=91=A0">node tree</a> mutations can be expensive. For every
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A1">node tree</a> cha=
nge, all affected <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#range" id=3D"ref-for-range=E2=91=A2">Range</a></c=
ode> objects need to be updated. Even if the application
is uninterested in some <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A1=
=E2=93=AA">live ranges</a>, it still has to pay the cost of keeping them up=
-to-date
when a mutation occurs.

</p>
   <p>A <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#staticrange" id=3D"ref-for-staticrange=E2=91=A1">StaticRang=
e</a></code> object is a lightweight <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range=E2=91=
=A6">range</a> that does not update when the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-tree=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A2">node tree</a> mut=
ates. It is therefore not subject to the same maintenance cost as
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-live=
-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">live ranges</a>=
.


</p>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"5.2" id=3D"boundary-points">=
<span class=3D"secno">5.2. </span><span class=3D"content">Boundary points</=
span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#boundary-p=
oints"></a></h3>
   <p>A <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" i=
d=3D"concept-range-bp">boundary point</dfn> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#tuple" id=3D"ref-for-tuple=E2=91=A0"=
>tuple</a> consisting of a
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"boundary point" data-dfn-type=3D=
"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"boundary-point-node">node</dfn> (a <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref=
-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A4">node</a>) and an
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"boundary point" data-dfn-type=3D=
"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-range-bp-offset">offset</dfn> (a non-n=
egative integer).

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">A correct <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-bp" id=3D"ref-for-concept-ra=
nge-bp=E2=91=A2">boundary point</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-bp-offset" id=3D"ref-for-co=
ncept-range-bp-offset=E2=91=A0">offset</a> will
be between 0 and the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-range-bp" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp=E2=91=A3">boundar=
y point</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#boundary-point-node" id=3D"ref-for-boundary-point-node=E2=91=A0">=
node</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-length" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-length=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">length</a>, i=
nclusive.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"boundary point/position">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"boundary point" data-=
dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-range-bp-position">position=
</dfn> of a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-rang=
e-bp" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp=E2=91=A4">boundary point</a> (<var>nod=
eA</var>, <var>offsetA</var>) relative to a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-bp" id=3D"ref-for-concept-ra=
nge-bp=E2=91=A5">boundary point</a>
(<var>nodeB</var>, <var>offsetB</var>) is
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"boundary point" data-dfn-type=3D=
"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-range-bp-before">before</dfn>,
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"boundary point" data-dfn-type=3D=
"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-range-bp-equal">equal</dfn>, or
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"boundary point" data-dfn-type=3D=
"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-range-bp-after">after</dfn>, as return=
ed by these steps:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Assert: <var>nodeA</var> and <var>nodeB</var> have the same <a dat=
a-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root"=
 id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-root=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A2">root</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>If <var>nodeA</var> is <var>nodeB</var>, then return <a data-=
link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-bp-equ=
al" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp-equal">equal</a> if
 <var>offsetA</var> is <var>offsetB</var>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-bp-before" id=3D"ref-for-con=
cept-range-bp-before">before</a> if <var>offsetA</var>
 is less than <var>offsetB</var>, and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-bp-after" id=3D"ref-for-concept-ran=
ge-bp-after">after</a> if <var>offsetA</var> is
 greater than <var>offsetB</var>.

=20
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>nodeA</var> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-following" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-foll=
owing=E2=91=A8">following</a> <var>nodeB</var>, then if the
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ran=
ge-bp-position" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp-position">position</a> of (<=
var>nodeB</var>, <var>offsetB</var>) relative to
 (<var>nodeA</var>, <var>offsetA</var>) is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-bp-before" id=3D"ref-for-con=
cept-range-bp-before=E2=91=A0">before</a>, return
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ran=
ge-bp-after" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp-after=E2=91=A0">after</a>, and =
if it is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-range-bp-after" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp-after=E2=91=A1">after</=
a>, return
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ran=
ge-bp-before" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp-before=E2=91=A1">before</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>nodeA</var> is an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-an=
cestor=E2=91=A4">ancestor</a> of <var>nodeB</var>:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>Let <var>child</var> be <var>nodeB</var>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>While <var>child</var> is not a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
tree-child=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A7">child</a> of <var>nodeA</var>, set
   <var>child</var> to its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=
=A3=E2=91=A0">parent</a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>child</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-index" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=
-index=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">index</a> is less than <var>offsetA</var>, then r=
eturn
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-r=
ange-bp-after" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp-after=E2=91=A2">after</a>.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#concept-range-bp-before" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp-before=E2=91=A2=
">before</a>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
