trange"><span class=3D"secno">5.3. </span><span class=3D"content">Interface=
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#abstractrange" id=3D"ref-for-abstractrange">AbstractRange</a></cod=
e></span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interf=
ace-abstractrange"></a></h3>
