  <c- b=3D"">readonly</c-> <c- b=3D"">attribute</c-> <a data-link-type=3D"i=
dl-name" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#node" id=3D"ref-for-node=E2=
=91=A5=E2=91=A6"><c- n=3D"">Node</c-></a> <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-t=
