   <p>Objects implementing the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abstractrange" id=3D"ref-for-abstrac=
trange=E2=91=A0">AbstractRange</a></code> interface are known as
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" data-lt=
=3D"range" id=3D"concept-range">ranges</dfn>.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range=E2=91=A7">range</a> has two associat=
ed <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-r=
ange-bp" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp=E2=91=A6">boundary points</a> =E2=
=80=94 a
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"range" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" dat=
a-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-range-start">start</dfn> and
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"range" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" dat=
a-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-range-end">end</dfn>.

</p>
   <p>For convenience, a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#concept-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range=E2=91=A8">range</a>=
=E2=80=99s
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"range" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" dat=
a-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-range-start-node">start node</dfn> is its <a da=
ta-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-sta=
rt" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start=E2=91=A1">start</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#boundary-poi=
nt-node" id=3D"ref-for-boundary-point-node=E2=91=A1">node</a>, its
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"range" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" dat=
a-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-range-start-offset">start offset</dfn> is its
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-rang=
e-start" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start=E2=91=A2">start</a>=E2=80=99s <a=
 data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-=
bp-offset" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp-offset=E2=91=A1">offset</a>, its
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"range" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" dat=
a-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-range-end-node">end node</dfn> is its <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end=E2=91=A1">end</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#boundary-poi=
nt-node" id=3D"ref-for-boundary-point-node=E2=91=A2">node</a>,  and its
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"range" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" dat=
a-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-range-end-offset">end offset</dfn> is its <a da=
ta-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end=E2=91=A2">end</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-rang=
e-bp-offset" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp-offset=E2=91=A2">offset</a>.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"collapsed" data-algorithm-for=
=3D"range">
    <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">range</a> is <df=
n class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"range" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-e=
xport=3D"" id=3D"range-collapsed">collapsed</dfn> if its <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-start-node" id=
