ts
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-rang=
e-end-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">end nod=
e</a> and its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#concept-range-start-offset" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-offset=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A4">start offset</a> is its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end-offset" id=3D"ref-for-concep=
t-range-end-offset=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">end offset</a>.
</p>
