   <p>Objects implementing the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#range" id=3D"ref-for-range=E2=91=A6"=
>Range</a></code> interface are known as
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"con=
cept-live-range">live ranges</dfn>.

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">Algorithms that modify a <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree" id=3D"ref-for=
-concept-tree=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">tree</a> (in particular the <a data-link-t=
ype=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-insert" id=3D=
"ref-for-concept-node-insert=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">insert</a>,
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node=
-remove" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-remove=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">remove</a>, <=
a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#move" id=3D"r=
ef-for-move=E2=91=A2">move</a>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-cd-replace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-cd-replace=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A1">replace data</a>, and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-text-split" id=3D"ref-for-concept-text-s=
plit=E2=91=A1">split</a>
algorithms) modify <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A1=E2=91=
=A1">live ranges</a> associated with that <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D=
"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=
=91=A1=E2=91=A2">tree</a>.

</p>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"live range" data-dfn-t=
ype=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-range-root">root</dfn> of a <a d=
ata-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-live-ran=
ge" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2">live range</a> is t=
he
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-root=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A3">root</a> of its <=
a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range=
-start-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">star=
t node</a>.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A6">node</a> <=
var>node</var> is <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"live range" da=
ta-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"contained">contained</dfn>
in a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">live range=
</a> <var>range</var> if <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root" id=3D"ref-for-con=
cept-tree-root=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A4">root</a> is
<var>range</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-root">root</=
a>, and (<var>node</var>, 0) is
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-rang=
e-bp-after" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-bp-after=E2=91=A3">after</a> <var>r=
ange</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#concept-range-start" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start=E2=91=A6">s=
tart</a>, and
(<var>node</var>, <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-length" id=3D"ref-for-concept=
-node-length=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">length</a>) is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-bp-before" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-range-bp-before=E2=91=A4">before</a>
<var>range</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end=E2=91=A6"=
>end</a>.

</p>
   <p>A <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A7">node</a> i=
s
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"live range" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn=
" data-export=3D"" id=3D"partially-contained">partially contained</dfn> in =
a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-li=
ve-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">live range</a=
>
if it=E2=80=99s an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-inclusiv=
e-ancestor=E2=91=A6">inclusive ancestor</a> of the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-co=
ncept-live-range=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">live range</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-t=
ype=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-start-node" =
id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">start node</a>
but not its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-range-end-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A4">end node</a>, or vice versa.

</p>
   <div class=3D"note" role=3D"note">
    <p>Some facts to better understand these definitions:

 </p>
    <ul>
     <li>
      <p>The content that one would think of as being within the <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-live-range" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A6">live range</a> consists o=
f all
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#contained"=
 id=3D"ref-for-contained">contained</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=
=A0=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A8">nodes</a>, plus possibly some of the contents of the
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ra=
nge-start-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">s=
tart node</a> and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-range-end-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-node=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A5">end node</a> if those are <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#characterdata" id=3D"ref-for-=
characterdata=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">CharacterData</a></code>
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-no=
de" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA=E2=93=AA">nodes</a>.

  </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>The <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/=
#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A0">nodes=
</a> that are contained in a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=
=A1=E2=91=A7">live range</a> will generally not be
  contiguous, because the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=
=A3=E2=91=A1">parent</a> of a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#contained" id=3D"ref-for-contained=E2=91=A0">contained</a=
>
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-no=
de" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A1">node</a> will no=
t always be <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
contained" id=3D"ref-for-contained=E2=91=A1">contained</a>.

  </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>However, the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#concept-tree-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=
=91=A2=E2=91=A1">descendants</a> of a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#contained" id=3D"ref-for-contained=E2=91=A2">cont=
ained</a>
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-no=
de" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A2">node</a> are <a =
data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#contained" id=
=3D"ref-for-contained=E2=91=A3">contained</a>, and if two <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-sibling" id=3D"r=
ef-for-concept-tree-sibling=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">siblings</a> are
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#contained"=
 id=3D"ref-for-contained=E2=91=A4">contained</a>, so are any <a data-link-t=
ype=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-sibling" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-sibling=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">siblings</a> that lie b=
etween them.

  </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>The <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/=
#concept-range-start-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-node=E2=91=A0=
=E2=91=A7">start node</a> and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-n=
ode=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">end node</a> of a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"=
https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live=
-range=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A8">live range</a> are
  never <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#cont=
ained" id=3D"ref-for-contained=E2=91=A5">contained</a> within it.

  </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>The first <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#contained" id=3D"ref-for-contained=E2=91=A6">contained</a> <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"r=
ef-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A3">node</a> (if there are any)=
 will
  always be after the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#concept-range-start-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-node=
=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">start node</a>, and the last <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#contained" id=3D"ref-for-contained=E2=
=91=A7">contained</a>
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-no=
de" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A4">node</a> will al=
ways be equal to or before the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-=
node=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">end node</a>=E2=80=99s last
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-descendant" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-descendant=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A2">des=
cendant</a>.

  </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>There exists a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#partially-contained" id=3D"ref-for-partially-contained">partial=
ly contained</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A5">n=
ode</a> if and only if
  the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concep=
t-range-start-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-node=E2=91=A1=E2=93=
=AA">start node</a> and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#concept-range-end-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-node=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A8">end node</a> are different.

  </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>The <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-range-commonancestorcontainer" id=3D"ref-for-dom-r=
ange-commonancestorcontainer=E2=91=A0">commonAncestorContainer</a></code> a=
ttribute value is neither
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#contained"=
 id=3D"ref-for-contained=E2=91=A8">contained</a> nor <a data-link-type=3D"d=
fn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#partially-contained" id=3D"ref-for=
-partially-contained=E2=91=A0">partially contained</a>.

  </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.o=
rg/#concept-range-start-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-node=E2=91=
=A1=E2=91=A0">start node</a> is an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-an=
cestor=E2=91=A5">ancestor</a> of the
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ra=
nge-end-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-node=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">end n=
ode</a>, the common <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-inclusi=
ve-ancestor=E2=91=A7">inclusive ancestor</a> will be the
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ra=
nge-start-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">s=
tart node</a>. Exactly one of its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=
=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A8">children</a> will be
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#partially-=
contained" id=3D"ref-for-partially-contained=E2=91=A1">partially contained<=
/a>, and a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A5=E2=93=AA">chil=
d</a> will be
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#contained"=
 id=3D"ref-for-contained=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">contained</a> if and only if it=
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tre=
e-preceding" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-preceding=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">preced=
es</a> the
