=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
live-range=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A7">live range</a> whose <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-start" id=3D"ref-for-c=
oncept-range-start=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">start</a> is
   (<var>lastPartiallyContainedChild</var>, 0) and whose <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end" id=3D"ref-=
for-concept-range-end=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">end</a> is
