   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Let <var>subfragment</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D=
"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-extract" id=3D"ref=
-for-concept-range-extract=E2=91=A0">extracting</a>
   <var>subrange</var>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-node-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-append=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">Ap=
pend</a> <var>subfragment</var> to <var>clone</var>.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>fragment</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"extractContents()" data-algor=
ithm-for=3D"Range">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"Range" data-=
dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-range-extractcontents"><code=
>extractContents()</code></dfn> method steps are to return the
result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#co=
ncept-range-extract" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-extract=E2=91=A1">extracti=
ng</a> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#th=
is" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A6">this</a>.
</p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"clone the contents" data-algo=
rithm-for=3D"live range">
    <p>To
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"live range" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn=
" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"clone the contents|cloning the contents" id=
=3D"concept-range-clone">clone the contents</dfn>
of a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept=
-live-range" id=3D"ref-for-concept-live-range=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A8">live range=
</a> <var>range</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>fragment</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#create-a-document-fragment" id=3D"ref=
-for-create-a-document-fragment=E2=91=A2">creating a document fragment</a> =
given
 <var>range</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-start-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start=
-node=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A1">start node</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document" id=3D"ref-for-=
concept-node-document=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A8">node document</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>range</var> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#range-collapsed" id=3D"ref-for-range-collapsed=E2=91=A3=
">collapsed</a>, then return <var>fragment</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>originalStartNode</var>, <var>originalStartOffset</var>,
 <var>originalEndNode</var>, and <var>originalEndOffset</var> be <var>range=
</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ran=
ge-start-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-node=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A2">st=
art node</a>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org=
/#concept-range-start-offset" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-start-offset=E2=
=91=A1=E2=91=A2">start offset</a>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-=
end-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A8">end node</a>, and
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ran=
ge-end-offset" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-offset=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2">en=
d offset</a>, respectively.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>originalStartNode</var> is <var>originalEndNode</var> and =
