        <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#c=
oncept-node-append" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node-append=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">Ap=
pend</a> <var>clone</var> to <var>fragment</var>.

