 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>originalStartNode</var> is not an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn=
" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1">inclusive an=
cestor</a> of
 <var>originalEndNode</var>, then set <var>firstPartiallyContainedChild</va=
r> to the first
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tre=
e-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A8">child</a> of <=
var>commonAncestor</var> that is
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#partially-c=
ontained" id=3D"ref-for-partially-contained=E2=91=A7">partially contained</=
a> in <var>range</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>lastPartiallyContainedChild</var> be null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>originalEndNode</var> is not an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor" id=3D=
"ref-for-concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2">inclusive ances=
tor</a> of
  <var>originalStartNode</var>, then set <var>lastPartiallyContainedChild</=
var> to the last
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A6=E2=93=AA">child</a> of =
<var>commonAncestor</var> that is
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#partially-=
contained" id=3D"ref-for-partially-contained=E2=91=A8">partially contained<=
/a> in <var>range</var>.

