https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for=
-concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">inclusive ancestor</a> =
of
  <var>originalEndNode</var>, <var>originalStartNode</var> is itself
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#partially-=
contained" id=3D"ref-for-partially-contained=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">partially c=
ontained</a> in <var>range</var>, and so are all its
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
