rs</a> up until a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg=
.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A6=E2=91=
=A0">child</a> of <var>commonAncestor</var>.
  <var>commonAncestor</var> cannot be <var>originalStartNode</var>, because=
