  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tr=
ee-inclusive-ancestor" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-inclusive-ancestor=E2=91=
=A1=E2=91=A4">inclusive ancestor</a> of <var>originalEndNode</var>. The oth=
er case is similar. Also,
  notice that the two <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A6=E2=
=91=A1">children</a> will never be equal if both are defined.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>containedChildren</var> be a list of all <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child" id=3D"re=
f-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A2">children</a> of
 <var>commonAncestor</var> that are <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#contained" id=3D"ref-for-contained=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A3">contained</a> in <var>range</var>, in
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tre=
e-order" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-order=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A0">tree order</a>=
.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If any member of <var>containedChildren</var> is a <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype" id=3D"ref-=
for-concept-doctype=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">doctype</a>, then <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-throw" id=3D"ref-for-d=
fn-throw=E2=91=A7=E2=91=A6">throw</a> a
  "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" h=
ref=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#hierarchyrequesterror" id=3D"ref-for=
-hierarchyrequesterror=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2">HierarchyRequestError</a></code>"=
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.=
whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A0=E2=93=
=AA=E2=91=A0">DOMException</a></code>.

  </p>
      <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">We do not have to worry about the fir=
st or last partially
  contained node, because a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.s=
pec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype" id=3D"ref-for-concept-doctype=E2=91=A0=E2=
