"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#characterd=
ata" id=3D"ref-for-characterdata=E2=91=A2=E2=93=AA">CharacterData</a></code=
> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-no=
