><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#characterda=
ta" id=3D"ref-for-characterdata=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A0">CharacterData</a></code>=
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-nod=
e" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">node</a>:

