 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A4">this</a>=E2=80=99s =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-rang=
e-end-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-node=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A0">end nod=
e</a> is a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#text" id=3D"ref-for-text=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A0">Text</a></co=
de> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-=
node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A5">node</a>, then
 append the substring of that <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=
=A2=E2=91=A6">node</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-cd-data" id=3D"ref-for-concept-cd-data=E2=91=
=A3=E2=91=A5">data</a> from its start until
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=
=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A5">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-range-end-offse=
t" id=3D"ref-for-concept-range-end-offset=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">end offset</a>=
 to <var>string</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>string</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <hr>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-typ=
e=3D"idl" href=3D"https://w3c.github.io/DOM-Parsing/#dom-range-createcontex=
tualfragment" id=3D"ref-for-dom-range-createcontextualfragment">createConte=
xtualFragment()</a></code>, <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" h=
ref=3D"https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view-1/#dom-range-getclientrects" id=
=3D"ref-for-dom-range-getclientrects">getClientRects()</a></code>,
and <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://drafts.cs=
swg.org/cssom-view-1/#dom-range-getboundingclientrect" id=3D"ref-for-dom-ra=
nge-getboundingclientrect">getBoundingClientRect()</a></code> methods are d=
efined in other specifications.
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-do=
m-parsing" title=3D"DOM Parsing and Serialization">[DOM-Parsing]</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-cs=
som-view" title=3D"CSSOM View Module">[CSSOM-VIEW]</a>



</p>
   <h2 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"6" id=3D"traversal"><span cl=
ass=3D"secno">6. </span><span class=3D"content">Traversal</span><a class=3D=
"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#traversal"></a></h2>
   <p><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator=E2=91=A3">NodeIterat=
or</a></code> and <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"htt=
ps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#treewalker" id=3D"ref-for-treewalker=E2=91=A1">Tr=
eeWalker</a></code> objects can be used to filter and traverse <a data-link=
-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-=
for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A7">node</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree=
" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3">trees</a>.

</p>
   <p>Each <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator=E2=91=A4">NodeI=
terator</a></code> and <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#treewalker" id=3D"ref-for-treewalker=E2=91=
=A2">TreeWalker</a></code> object has an associated boolean
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"traversal" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn"=
 data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"concept-traversal-active">is active</dfn> to avoi=
d recursive invocations. It is
initially false.

</p>
   <p>Each <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator=E2=91=A5">NodeI=
terator</a></code> and <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#treewalker" id=3D"ref-for-treewalker=E2=91=
=A3">TreeWalker</a></code> object also has an associated
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"traversal" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn"=
 data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"concept-traversal-root">root</dfn> (a <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref=
-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A8">node</a>), a
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"traversal" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn"=
 data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"concept-traversal-whattoshow">whatToShow</dfn> (a=
 bitmask), and a
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"traversal" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn"=
 data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"concept-traversal-filter">filter</dfn> (a callbac=
k).

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"filter">
    <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D=
"" id=3D"concept-node-filter">filter</dfn> a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=
=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3=E2=93=AA">node</a> <var>node</var> within
a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wh=
atwg.org/#nodeiterator" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator=E2=91=A6">NodeIterator</=
a></code> or <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#treewalker" id=3D"ref-for-treewalker=E2=91=A4">TreeWal=
ker</a></code> object <var>traverser</var>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>traverser</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-active" id=3D"ref-for-co=
ncept-traversal-active">is active</a> is true, then throw an
 "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" hr=
ef=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror" id=3D"ref-for-inva=
lidstateerror=E2=91=A1">InvalidStateError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><=
a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMExc=
eption" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">DOMExcep=
tion</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>n</var> be <var>node</var>=E2=80=99s <code class=3D"idl">=
<a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-node-nod=
etype" id=3D"ref-for-dom-node-nodetype=E2=91=A1">nodeType</a></code> attrib=
ute value =E2=88=92 1.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If the <var>n</var><sup>th</sup> bit (where 0 is the least signifi=
cant bit) of
 <var>traverser</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-whattoshow" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tra=
versal-whattoshow=E2=91=A1">whatToShow</a> is not set, then return
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#dom-nodefilter-filter_skip" id=3D"ref-for-dom-nodefilter-filter_sk=
ip">FILTER_SKIP</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>traverser</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-filter" id=3D"ref-for-co=
ncept-traversal-filter=E2=91=A1">filter</a> is null, then return
 <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.wha=
twg.org/#dom-nodefilter-filter_accept" id=3D"ref-for-dom-nodefilter-filter_=
accept">FILTER_ACCEPT</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>traverser</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-active" id=3D"ref-for-co=
ncept-traversal-active=E2=91=A0">is active</a> to true.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>result</var> be the return value of <a data-link-type=3D"=
dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#call-a-user-objects-operation"=
 id=3D"ref-for-call-a-user-objects-operation=E2=91=A0">call a user object=
=E2=80=99s operation</a> with
 <var>traverser</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://d=
om.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-filter" id=3D"ref-for-concept-travers=
al-filter=E2=91=A2">filter</a>, "<code>acceptNode</code>", and
 =C2=AB <var>node</var> =C2=BB. If this throws an exception, then set <var>=
traverser</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tra=
versal-active" id=3D"ref-for-concept-traversal-active=E2=91=A1">is active</=
a> to false and rethrow the exception.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>traverser</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-active" id=3D"ref-for-co=
ncept-traversal-active=E2=91=A2">is active</a> to false.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>result</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <h3 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"6.1" id=3D"interface-nodeite=
rator"><span class=3D"secno">6.1. </span><span class=3D"content">Interface =
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#nodeiterator" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator=E2=91=A7">NodeIterator</a>=
</code></span><a class=3D"self-link" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#i=
nterface-nodeiterator"></a></h3>
