   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator" id=3D"ref-for-node=
iterator=E2=91=A8">NodeIterator</a></code> objects can be created using the
<code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#dom-document-createnodeiterator" id=3D"ref-for-dom-document-createn=
odeiterator=E2=91=A0">createNodeIterator()</a></code> method on <code class=
=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#doc=
ument" id=3D"ref-for-document=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A5">Document</a></code> object=
s.

</p>
   <p>Each <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator=E2=91=A0=E2=93=
=AA">NodeIterator</a></code> object has an associated
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"NodeIterator" data-dfn-type=3D"d=
fn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"iterator-collection">iterator collection</dfn>=
, which is a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-coll=
ection" id=3D"ref-for-concept-collection=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A8">collection</a> =
rooted at the <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A0">NodeIterator</a></code> object=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" =
href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-root" id=3D"ref-for-=
concept-traversal-root=E2=91=A3">root</a>, whose
filter matches any <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-for-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A0"=
>node</a>.

</p>
   <p>A <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D""=
 id=3D"node-pointer">node pointer</dfn> is a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#tuple" id=3D"ref-for-tuple=E2=91=A1">tup=
le</a> consisting of a
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"node pointer" data-dfn-type=3D"d=
fn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"node-pointer-node">node</dfn> (a <a data-link-=
type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node" id=3D"ref-f=
or-concept-node=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A1">node</a>) and a
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"node pointer" data-dfn-type=3D"d=
fn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"node-pointer-pointer-before">pointer before</d=
fn> (a boolean).

</p>
   <p>Each <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://do=
m.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A1">NodeIterator</a></code> object also has an associated <dfn class=3D"df=
n-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"NodeIterator" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexpor=
t=3D"" id=3D"nodeiterator-reference">reference</dfn> (a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#node-pointer=
" id=3D"ref-for-node-pointer">node pointer</a>) and <dfn class=3D"dfn-panel=
ed" data-dfn-for=3D"NodeIterator" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" =
id=3D"nodeiterator-candidate-reference">candidate reference</dfn> (null or =
a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#node-pointer=
" id=3D"ref-for-node-pointer=E2=91=A0">node pointer</a>, and initially null=
).

</p>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">As mentioned earlier, <code class=3D"idl=
"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterat=
or" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">NodeIterator</a></code> o=
bjects have an associated
