://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator-candidate-reference" id=3D"ref-for-nod=
eiterator-candidate-reference=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A2">candidate reference</a>=E2=
=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#node=
-pointer-node" id=3D"ref-for-node-pointer-node=E2=91=A4">node</a>,
     true).
    </p>
        </li></ol>
       </li><li>
        <p>Let <var>node</var> be <var>iterator</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-lin=
k-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator-candidate-=
reference" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator-candidate-reference=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3=
">candidate reference</a>=E2=80=99s
