ter-node" id=3D"ref-for-node-pointer-node=E2=91=A5">node</a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Let <var>filterResult</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-filter" id=3D"re=
f-for-concept-node-filter">filtering</a> <var>node</var> within
