</var>=E2=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeitera=
tor-candidate-reference" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator-candidate-reference=E2=
=91=A0=E2=91=A4">candidate reference</a> to null and rethrow that exception=
.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>filterResult</var> is <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-t=
ype=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-nodefilter-filter_acce=
pt" id=3D"ref-for-dom-nodefilter-filter_accept=E2=91=A0">FILTER_ACCEPT</a><=
/code>:

    </p>
        <ol>
         <li>
          <p>Set <var>iterator</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hr=
ef=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator-reference" id=3D"ref-for-no=
deiterator-reference=E2=91=A5">reference</a> to <var>iterator</var>=E2=80=
=99s
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeite=
rator-candidate-reference" id=3D"ref-for-nodeiterator-candidate-reference=
=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">candidate reference</a>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p>Set <var>result</var> to <var>node</var>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#iteration-break" id=3D"ref-for-iteration-break=E2=91=A3">Break</a>.
    </p>
        </li></ol>
      </li></ol>
     </li><li>
      <p>Set <var>iterator</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#nodeiterator-candidate-reference" id=3D"re=
f-for-nodeiterator-candidate-reference=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">candidate referen=
ce</a> to null.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>result</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
