   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"nextNode()" data-algorithm-fo=
r=3D"TreeWalker">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"TreeWalker" =
data-dfn-type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-treewalker-nextnode"><c=
ode>nextNode()</code></dfn> method steps are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>node</var> be <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://w=
ebidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A4"=
>this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#treewalker-current" id=3D"ref-for-treewalker-current=E2=91=A0=E2=91=
=A2">current</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>result</var> be <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"=
idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-nodefilter-filter_accept" id=
=3D"ref-for-dom-nodefilter-filter_accept=E2=91=A7">FILTER_ACCEPT</a></code>=
.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>While true:

  </p>
      <ol>
       <li>
        <p>While <var>result</var> is not <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-=
type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-nodefilter-filter_rej=
ect" id=3D"ref-for-dom-nodefilter-filter_reject=E2=91=A1">FILTER_REJECT</a>=
</code> and <var>node</var> has a
    <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-=
tree-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-child=E2=91=A6=E2=91=A7">child</a>:

    </p>
        <ol>
         <li>
          <p>Set <var>node</var> to its <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-first-child" id=3D"ref-for-concept=
-tree-first-child=E2=91=A8">first child</a>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p>Set <var>result</var> to the result of <a data-link-type=3D"df=
n" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-filter" id=3D"ref-for-=
concept-node-filter=E2=91=A7">filtering</a> <var>node</var> within
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this=
" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A5">this</a>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p>If <var>result</var> is <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-nodefilter-filter_accept"=
 id=3D"ref-for-dom-nodefilter-filter_accept=E2=91=A8">FILTER_ACCEPT</a></co=
de>, then set <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.=
org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A6">this</a>=E2=80=99=
s
     <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#treewal=
ker-current" id=3D"ref-for-treewalker-current=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">current</a=
> to <var>node</var> and return <var>node</var>.
    </p>
        </li></ol>
       </li><li>
        <p>Let <var>sibling</var> be null.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Let <var>temporary</var> be <var>node</var>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>While <var>temporary</var> is non-null:

    </p>
        <ol>
         <li>
          <p>If <var>temporary</var> is <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"h=
ttps://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A2=
=E2=91=A7">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-traversal-root" id=3D"ref-for-concept-traversal-r=
oot=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">root</a>, then return null.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p>Set <var>sibling</var> to <var>temporary</var>=E2=80=99s <a da=
ta-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-next=
-sibling" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-next-sibling=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">next s=
ibling</a>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p>If <var>sibling</var> is non-null, then <a data-link-type=3D"d=
fn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#iteration-break" id=3D"ref-for-i=
teration-break=E2=91=A5">break</a>.

     </p>
         </li><li>
          <p>Set <var>temporary</var> to <var>temporary</var>=E2=80=99s <a =
data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-pa=
rent" id=3D"ref-for-concept-tree-parent=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A8">parent</a>.
    </p>
        </li></ol>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>sibling</var> is null, then return null.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Set <var>node</var> to <var>sibling</var>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>Set <var>result</var> to the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-filter" id=3D"ref-for-co=
ncept-node-filter=E2=91=A8">filtering</a> <var>node</var> within
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" =
id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A8">this</a>.

   </p>
       </li><li>
        <p>If <var>result</var> is <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D=
"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-nodefilter-filter_accept" id=
=3D"ref-for-dom-nodefilter-filter_accept=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">FILTER_ACCEPT</=
a></code>, then set <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.w=
hatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A3=E2=93=AA">this</a>=E2=
=80=99s
   <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#treewalke=
r-current" id=3D"ref-for-treewalker-current=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">current</a> =
to <var>node</var> and return <var>node</var>.
  </p>
      </li></ol>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
