element" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A4">element<=
/a>) and an <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"DOMTokenList" data-d=
fn-type=3D"dfn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"domtokenlist-attribute-name">attri=
bute name</dfn> (an <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.what=
wg.org/#concept-attribute" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute=E2=91=A4=E2=91=
=A6">attribute</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attr=
ibute-local-name" id=3D"ref-for-concept-attribute-local-name=E2=91=A1=E2=91=
=A5">local name</a>).

</p>
   <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#other-=
applicable-specifications" id=3D"ref-for-other-applicable-specifications=E2=
=91=A0=E2=93=AA">Specifications</a> may define
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"Node" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data=
-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-supported-tokens">supported tokens</dfn> for a <=
code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatw=
g.org/#domtokenlist" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist=E2=91=A7">DOMTokenList</a><=
/code>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist=
-element" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-element">element</a> and <a data-link-=
type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist-attribute-na=
me" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-attribute-name">attribute name</a>.</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"validation steps" data-algori=
thm-for=3D"DOMTokenList">
    <p>A <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist=E2=91=A8">DOMToke=
nList</a></code> object <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"DOMTokenList" data-dfn-type=3D"d=
fn" data-export=3D"" id=3D"concept-domtokenlist-validation">validation step=
s</dfn> for a given
<var>token</var> are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist-element" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-e=
lement=E2=91=A0">element</a> and
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlis=
t-attribute-name" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-attribute-name=E2=91=A0">attri=
bute name</a> does not define <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom=
.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-supported-tokens" id=3D"ref-for-concept-supported=
-tokens">supported tokens</a>, then
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-thro=
w" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A8=E2=91=A5">throw</a> a <code>TypeError</=
code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>lowercaseToken</var> be <var>token</var>, in <a data-link=
-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-lowercase" id=3D=
"ref-for-ascii-lowercase=E2=91=A7">ASCII lowercase</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <var>lowercaseToken</var> is present in the <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-supported-tokens" id=
=3D"ref-for-concept-supported-tokens=E2=91=A0">supported tokens</a> of
 <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist-element" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-element=E2=
=91=A1">element</a> and <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.=
whatwg.org/#domtokenlist-attribute-name" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-attribu=
te-name=E2=91=A1">attribute name</a>, then
 return true.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return false.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"update steps" data-algorithm-=
for=3D"DOMTokenList">
    <p>A <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA=
">DOMTokenList</a></code> object <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"DOMTokenList" data-dfn-type=3D"d=
fn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"concept-dtl-update">update steps</dfn> are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-element-attributes-get-by-namespace" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-=
attributes-get-by-namespace=E2=91=A6">get an attribute by namespace and loc=
al name</a> given null, <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlis=
t-attribute-name" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-attribute-name=E2=91=A2">attri=
bute name</a>, and <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist-element" id=3D"ref-for-domtok=
enlist-element=E2=91=A2">element</a>
 returns null and <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-dtl-tokens" id=3D"ref-for-concept-=
dtl-tokens=E2=91=A0">token set</a> is empty, then return.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#con=
cept-element-attributes-set-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes=
-set-value=E2=91=A1">Set an attribute value</a> given <var>set</var>=E2=80=
=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtoke=
nlist-element" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-element=E2=91=A3">element</a>,
 <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spe=
c.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist-attribute-name" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-attri=
bute-name=E2=91=A3">attribute name</a>, and the result of running the
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ord=
ered-set-serializer" id=3D"ref-for-concept-ordered-set-serializer">ordered =
set serializer</a> for <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" h=
ref=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-dtl-tokens" id=3D"ref-for-conce=
pt-dtl-tokens=E2=91=A1">token set</a>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"serialize steps" data-algorit=
hm-for=3D"DOMTokenList">
    <p>A <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0=
">DOMTokenList</a></code> object <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"DOMTokenList" data-dfn-type=3D"d=
fn" data-noexport=3D"" id=3D"concept-dtl-serialize">serialize steps</dfn> a=
re to return the result of
running <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-element-attributes-get-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-=
get-value=E2=91=A0">get an attribute value</a> given <var>set</var>=E2=80=
=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtoke=
nlist-element" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-element=E2=91=A4">element</a> and
<var>set</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist-attribute-name" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-attrib=
ute-name=E2=91=A4">attribute name</a>.
