   <hr>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"DOMTokenList/attribute change=
 steps">
    <p>A <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.=
spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1=
">DOMTokenList</a></code> object <var>set</var> has these <a data-link-type=
=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-attributes-ch=
ange-ext" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-change-ext=E2=91=A3">att=
ribute change steps</a> for
<var>set</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec=
.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist-element" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-element=E2=91=
=A5">element</a>:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>If <var>localName</var> is <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-t=
ype=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist-attribute-nam=
e" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-attribute-name=E2=91=A5">attribute name</a>,
 <var>namespace</var> is null, and <var>value</var> is null, then <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-empty" id=3D"r=
ef-for-list-empty=E2=91=A5">empty</a>
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-dtl=
-tokens" id=3D"ref-for-concept-dtl-tokens=E2=91=A2">token set</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Otherwise, if <var>localName</var> is <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlis=
t-attribute-name" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-attribute-name=E2=91=A6">attri=
bute name</a> and <var>namespace</var> is null, then set <var>set</var>=E2=
=80=99s
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-dtl=
-tokens" id=3D"ref-for-concept-dtl-tokens=E2=91=A3">token set</a> to <var>v=
alue</var>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#=
concept-ordered-set-parser" id=3D"ref-for-concept-ordered-set-parser=E2=91=
=A0">parsed</a>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"DOMTokenList/created">
    <p>When a <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https:/=
/dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist=E2=91=A0=E2=
=91=A2">DOMTokenList</a></code> object <var>set</var> is created:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>element</var> be <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-ty=
pe=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist-element" id=3D=
"ref-for-domtokenlist-element=E2=91=A6">element</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>attributeName</var> be <var>set</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist-attribut=
e-name" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-attribute-name=E2=91=A7">attribute name<=
/a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Let <var>value</var> be the result of
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-ele=
ment-attributes-get-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-get-val=
ue=E2=91=A1">getting an attribute value</a> given <var>element</var> and
 <var>attributeName</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Run the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-element-attributes-change-ext" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-a=
ttributes-change-ext=E2=91=A4">attribute change steps</a> for <var>element<=
/var>, <var>attributeName</var>,
 <var>value</var>, <var>value</var>, and null.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <dl class=3D"domintro">
    <dt><code><var>tokenlist</var> . <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=
=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domtokenlist-length" id=
