=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Returns the number of tokens.

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>tokenlist</var> . <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-=
type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domtokenlist-item" id=
=3D"ref-for-dom-domtokenlist-item=E2=91=A0">item(index)</a></code></code>
=20
    </dt><dt><code><var>tokenlist</var>[<var>index</var>]</code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Returns the token with index <var>index</var>.

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>tokenlist</var> . <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-=
type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domtokenlist-contains=
" id=3D"ref-for-dom-domtokenlist-contains=E2=91=A0">contains(token)</a></co=
de></code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
