 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>tokenlist</var> . <a data-link-type=3D"functionish"=
 href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domtokenlist-add" id=3D"ref-for-d=
om-domtokenlist-add=E2=91=A0">add(<var>tokens</var>=E2=80=A6)</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Adds all arguments passed, except those already present.
  </p>
     <p>Throws a "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=
=3D"exception" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#syntaxerror" id=3D"r=
ef-for-syntaxerror=E2=91=A3">SyntaxError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a=
 data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMExce=
ption" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0">DOMExcept=
ion</a></code> if one of the arguments is the empty
  string.
  </p>
     <p>Throws an "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=
=3D"exception" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidcharactererro=
r" id=3D"ref-for-invalidcharactererror=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A7">InvalidCharacterE=
rror</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"http=
s://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMExceptio=
n=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1">DOMException</a></code> if one of the argumen=
ts
  contains any <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.=
org/#ascii-whitespace" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-whitespace=E2=91=A4">ASCII white=
space</a>.

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>tokenlist</var> . <a data-link-type=3D"functionish"=
