ption" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A4">DOMExcept=
ion</a></code> if <var>token</var> is empty.
  </p>
     <p>Throws an "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=
=3D"exception" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidcharactererro=
r" id=3D"ref-for-invalidcharactererror=E2=91=A1=E2=93=AA">InvalidCharacterE=
rror</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"http=
s://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMExceptio=
n=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">DOMException</a></code> if <var>token</var> c=
ontains
  any spaces.

 </p>
    </dd><dt><code><var>tokenlist</var> . <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-t=
ype=3D"method" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domtokenlist-replac=
e" id=3D"ref-for-dom-domtokenlist-replace=E2=91=A0">replace(<var>token</var=
>, <var>newToken</var>)</a></code>
=20
    </dt><dd>
     <p>Replaces <var>token</var> with <var>newToken</var>.
  </p>
     <p>Returns true if <var>token</var> was replaced with <var>newToken</v=
ar>; otherwise false.
  </p>
     <p>Throws a "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=
=3D"exception" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#syntaxerror" id=3D"r=
ef-for-syntaxerror=E2=91=A6">SyntaxError</a></code>" <code class=3D"idl"><a=
 data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-DOMExce=
ption" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">DOMExcept=
ion</a></code> if one of the arguments is the empty
  string.
  </p>
     <p>Throws an "<code class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=
=3D"exception" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidcharactererro=
r" id=3D"ref-for-invalidcharactererror=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A0">InvalidCharacterE=
