, then
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-thro=
w" id=3D"ref-for-dfn-throw=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA=E2=91=A3">throw</a> an "<code =
class=3D"idl"><a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"exception" href=3D"ht=
tps://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidcharactererror" id=3D"ref-for-invalidc=
haractererror=E2=91=A1=E2=91=A4">InvalidCharacterError</a></code>" <code cl=
ass=3D"idl"><a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#idl-DOMException" id=3D"ref-for-idl-DOMException=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A1=E2=91=
=A5">DOMException</a></code>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>If <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.or=
g/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A4=E2=93=AA">this</a>=E2=80=99s =
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-dtl-=
tokens" id=3D"ref-for-concept-dtl-tokens=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A5">token set</a> d=
oes not <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#li=
st-contain" id=3D"ref-for-list-contain=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A3">contain</a> <var>=
token</var>, then
 return false.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#s=
et-replace" id=3D"ref-for-set-replace">Replace</a> <var>token</var> in <a d=
ata-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"r=
ef-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A0">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-typ=
e=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-dtl-tokens" id=3D"re=
f-for-concept-dtl-tokens=E2=91=A0=E2=91=A6">token set</a> with
 <var>newToken</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Run the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.=
org/#concept-dtl-update" id=3D"ref-for-concept-dtl-update=E2=91=A4">update =
steps</a>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return true.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">The <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"ht=
tps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-dtl-update" id=3D"ref-for-concept-dtl-up=
date=E2=91=A5">update steps</a> are not always run for <code class=3D"idl">=
<a data-link-type=3D"idl" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domtoken=
list-replace" id=3D"ref-for-dom-domtokenlist-replace=E2=91=A1">replace()</a=
></code>
for web compatibility.

</p>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"supports(token)" data-algorit=
hm-for=3D"DOMTokenList">
    <p>The
<dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"DOMTokenList" data-dfn-=
type=3D"method" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-domtokenlist-supports"><code>sup=
ports(<var>token</var>)</code></dfn>
method steps are:

</p>
    <ol>
     <li>
      <p>Let <var>result</var> be the return value of <a data-link-type=3D"=
dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-domtokenlist-validation" =
id=3D"ref-for-concept-domtokenlist-validation">validation steps</a> called =
with
 <var>token</var>.

 </p>
     </li><li>
      <p>Return <var>result</var>.
</p>
    </li></ol>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"value" data-algorithm-for=3D"=
DOMTokenList">
    <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled idl-code" data-dfn-for=3D"DOMTokenList=
" data-dfn-type=3D"attribute" data-export=3D"" id=3D"dom-domtokenlist-value=
"><code>value</code></dfn> getter steps are to return the
result of running <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://webidl.spec.wha=
twg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A1">this</a>=E2=
=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#conc=
ept-dtl-serialize" id=3D"ref-for-concept-dtl-serialize">serialize steps</a>=
.
</p>
   </div>
   <div class=3D"algorithm" data-algorithm=3D"DOMTokenList/value setter">
    <p>The <a class=3D"idl-code" data-link-type=3D"attribute" href=3D"https=
://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domtokenlist-value" id=3D"ref-for-dom-domtokenl=
ist-value=E2=91=A2"><code>value</code></a> setter steps are to
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-elem=
ent-attributes-set-value" id=3D"ref-for-concept-element-attributes-set-valu=
e=E2=91=A2">set an attribute value</a> for <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=91=
=A4=E2=91=A2">this</a>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://=
dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist-element" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-eleme=
nt=E2=91=A7">element</a> using <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://we=
bidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" id=3D"ref-for-this=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A3">=
this</a>=E2=80=99s
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#domtokenlist=
-attribute-name" id=3D"ref-for-domtokenlist-attribute-name=E2=91=A8">attrib=
ute name</a> and the given value.
</p>
   </div>
   <h2 class=3D"heading settled" data-level=3D"8" id=3D"xpath"><span class=
=3D"secno">8. </span><span class=3D"content">XPath</span><a class=3D"self-l=
ink" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#xpath"></a></h2>
   <p class=3D"XXX"><cite>DOM Level 3 XPath</cite> defined an API for evalu=
ating <cite>XPath 1.0</cite>
expressions. These APIs are widely implemented, but have not been maintaine=
d. The interface
definitions are maintained here so that they can be updated when <cite>Web =
IDL</cite> changes.
Complete definitions of these APIs remain necessary and such work is tracke=
d and can be contributed
to in <a href=3D"https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/67">whatwg/dom#67</a>=
. <a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-=
dom-level-3-xpath" title=3D"Document Object Model (DOM) Level 3 XPath Speci=
fication">[DOM-Level-3-XPath]</a>
<a data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-xp=
ath" title=3D"XML Path Language (XPath) Version 1.0">[XPath]</a> <a data-li=
nk-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-webidl" titl=
e=3D"Web IDL Standard">[WEBIDL]</a>


</p>
