   <p class=3D"XXX"><cite>XSL Transformations (XSLT)</cite> is a language f=
or transforming XML documents
into other XML documents. The APIs defined in this section have been widely=
 implemented, and are
maintained here so that they can be updated when <cite>Web IDL</cite> chang=
es. Complete definitions
of these APIs remain necessary and such work is tracked and can be contribu=
ted to in
<a href=3D"https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/181">whatwg/dom#181</a>. <a=
 data-link-type=3D"biblio" href=3D"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#biblio-xslt=
" title=3D"XSL Transformations (XSLT) Version 1.0">[XSLT]</a>


</p>
